1
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:26,291
<font size="20">Nangyari ang cold case natin ngayon
no'ng gabi ng May 11, 1973.</font>

2
00:00:27,125 --> 00:00:32,250
<font size="20">Bandang 12:48 a.m. sa isang bahagi
ng Brick Lane sa East London,</font>

3
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,541
<font size="20">naglalakad ang isang lalaki mula sa pub</font>

4
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:37,666
<font size="20">pauwi sa bahay ng girlfriend niyang
si Angela Hughes</font>

5
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:42,166
<font size="20">nang makarinig siya ng dalawang boses
mula sa bintana ni Angela sa third floor.</font>

6
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:53,125
<font size="20">Hoy, tigil! Hoy!</font>

7
00:00:54,541 --> 00:00:55,583
<font size="20">Tumigil ka!</font>

8
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:04,583
<font size="20">Pagdating ng mga pulis,
patay na si Angela Hughes.</font>

9
00:01:05,083 --> 00:01:08,083
<font size="20">Hinalughog nila 'yong apartment niya,
pero walang ninakaw ro'n.</font>

10
00:01:08,166 --> 00:01:10,125
<font size="20">Aba, nangangamoy.</font>

11
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,541
<font size="20">Ano'ng nangangamoy, Ron?</font>

12
00:01:11,625 --> 00:01:13,833
<font size="20">Ano 'yong motibo sa pagnanakaw?</font>

13
00:01:13,916 --> 00:01:16,166
<font size="20">Mahirap lang sila. Walang saysay 'yon.</font>

14
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:17,208
<font size="20">Tama naman.</font>

15
00:01:17,291 --> 00:01:18,791
<font size="20">At kung tama ang intindi ko,</font>

16
00:01:18,875 --> 00:01:24,125
<font size="20">'yong boyfriend lang ni Angela
ang nakakita do'n sa nakamaskara?</font>

17
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:27,041
<font size="20">Ayon sa police report, oo.</font>

18
00:01:27,125 --> 00:01:28,333
<font size="20">Sino 'yong boyfriend?</font>

19
00:01:29,791 --> 00:01:31,208
<font size="20">Nakuha ba ang pangalan niya?</font>

20
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:35,708
<font size="20">Si Peter Mercer. 25 years old. Mekaniko.</font>

21
00:01:35,791 --> 00:01:37,916
<font size="20">Na-discharge sa army
nang may tama sa tuhod.</font>

22
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,708
<font size="20">Nabaril siya sa field.</font>

23
00:01:39,791 --> 00:01:41,750
<font size="20">Malaki ang tsansang
may unprocessed trauma.</font>

24
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:43,791
<font size="20">-Pwedeng magpabago-bago ang kilos niya.
-Oo.</font>

25
00:01:43,875 --> 00:01:46,625
<font size="20">Hinabol ni Mercer 'yong nakamaskara,
pero di niya nahuli.</font>

26
00:01:46,708 --> 00:01:50,541
<font size="20">Tapos di nagtagal, naglaho na rin siya.
Hindi na ulit siya nakita.</font>

27
00:01:50,625 --> 00:01:54,541
<font size="20">Kita mo? Nangangamoy talaga, e.
Mas masangsang pa sa malansang isda.</font>

28
00:01:54,625 --> 00:01:57,916
<font size="20">Pwede pa kaya sanang
mailigtas no'n 'yong babae?</font>

29
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,625
<font size="20">Ewan ko. Hindi ko masabi.</font>

30
00:01:59,708 --> 00:02:03,666
<font size="20">Sabi sa report, 'yong pagsaksak
ang pumatay sa kanya, di 'yong pagkahulog.</font>

31
00:02:03,750 --> 00:02:04,916
<font size="20">Pinatay nga siya.</font>

32
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:08,708
<font size="20">Malamang na marunong si Mercer
ng basic first aid.</font>

33
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:11,291
<font size="20">Bakit di niya niligtas? Ang tanga naman.</font>

34
00:02:11,375 --> 00:02:13,375
<font size="20">Sabi niya sa pulis,
namatay agad si Angela.</font>

35
00:02:13,458 --> 00:02:15,708
<font size="20">Pero alam kong matagal maubusan ng dugo.</font>

36
00:02:16,791 --> 00:02:18,166
<font size="20">Aaminin ko, naguguluhan ako.</font>

37
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:20,500
<font size="20">-Talaga?
-Pero sobrang hirap kasi nito.</font>

38
00:02:20,583 --> 00:02:24,083
<font size="20">Parang ang dali na lang tuloy
no'ng chop-chop na katawan sa mailbox.</font>

39
00:02:24,166 --> 00:02:28,750
<font size="20">Tama. Medical expert
ang kailangan natin ngayon.</font>

40
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:51,625
<font size="20">Ito pala ang Coopers Chase
na bukambibig n'yo.</font>

41
00:02:52,125 --> 00:02:53,333
<font size="20">Ililibot kita.</font>

42
00:02:53,416 --> 00:02:58,291
<font size="20">Doon ang hospice wing
para sa mga… alam mo na.</font>

43
00:02:58,375 --> 00:03:00,125
<font size="20">May archery classes kami,</font>

44
00:03:00,208 --> 00:03:03,875
<font size="20">at may residente rito na nanalo
ng silver medal no'ng 1972 Olympics.</font>

45
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:08,750
<font size="20">Magaling! Napakahusay. Ganyan nga.</font>

46
00:03:08,833 --> 00:03:11,625
<font size="20">Aminin mo, Joanna, ang ganda rito.</font>

47
00:03:12,208 --> 00:03:15,083
<font size="20">May mga llama pa rito
bilang support animal.</font>

48
00:03:15,166 --> 00:03:17,458
<font size="20">Lahat naman may llama na ngayon, Ma.</font>

49
00:03:17,541 --> 00:03:18,791
<font size="20">-Ay.
-Mag-ingat ka.</font>

50
00:03:18,875 --> 00:03:23,583
<font size="20">Moody ang mga llama.
Nangangagat sila at nandudura sa mukha.</font>

51
00:03:25,166 --> 00:03:28,916
<font size="20">May mga kilala akong gumagawa no'n
kapag sobrang stressed sila.</font>

52
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,333
<font size="20">Halika, ipapakita ko 'yong jigsaw room.</font>

53
00:03:31,916 --> 00:03:35,041
<font size="20">Naubusan ba siya ng dugo dahil sa saksak
o sa pagkahulog?</font>

54
00:03:35,125 --> 00:03:36,333
<font size="20">Susmaryosep.</font>

55
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:39,333
<font size="20">Ay, hello.</font>

56
00:03:40,583 --> 00:03:43,000
<font size="20">Di ba para sa jigsaw 'tong kuwartong 'to?</font>

57
00:03:43,083 --> 00:03:45,416
<font size="20">Kapag Huwebes, hindi.</font>

58
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,125
<font size="20">Sige. Pasensya na.</font>

59
00:03:52,875 --> 00:03:54,208
<font size="20">Iiwan na namin kayo.</font>

60
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:56,750
<font size="20">Ma?</font>

61
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:02,875
<font size="20">Sila yata 'yong Agatha Christie club.</font>

62
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,458
<font size="20">Kailangan ko na talagang umalis.</font>

63
00:04:08,541 --> 00:04:12,083
<font size="20">Matindi 'yong traffic at meron akong
mahalagang kliyenteng dadalhin sa opera.</font>

64
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:14,000
<font size="20">Alam mo, Ma?</font>

65
00:04:14,083 --> 00:04:16,541
<font size="20">-Tingin ko, di ka dapat nakatira dito.
-Ano?</font>

66
00:04:16,625 --> 00:04:20,375
<font size="20">Bakit ayaw mong bilhan kita ng apartment
na malapit-lapit sa 'kin?</font>

67
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:23,333
<font size="20">Joanna, kailangan kong tumira sa lugar</font>

68
00:04:23,416 --> 00:04:25,916
<font size="20">kung saan magkakaro'n ako ng mga kaibigan.</font>

69
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,875
<font size="20">Paano ko magagawa 'yon
nang mag-isa sa Hackney</font>

70
00:04:28,958 --> 00:04:34,250
<font size="20">habang napapaligiran
ng mga hipster at vegan bakery?</font>

71
00:04:34,333 --> 00:04:38,166
<font size="20">-Di sila matutuwa sa matandang babae.
-Sige na nga.</font>

72
00:04:38,875 --> 00:04:40,958
<font size="20">Gusto lang kitang maging masaya.</font>

73
00:04:41,458 --> 00:04:43,208
<font size="20">Mula no'ng namatay si Papa…</font>

74
00:04:43,291 --> 00:04:44,916
<font size="20">Nag-aalala lang ako sa 'yo.</font>

75
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,958
<font size="20">Okay lang ako.</font>

76
00:04:50,708 --> 00:04:52,833
<font size="20">-Ingat sa pagmamaneho.
-Okay.</font>

77
00:04:54,291 --> 00:04:56,541
<font size="20">Sana tama ako rito, Gerry.</font>

78
00:04:57,041 --> 00:04:59,750
<font size="20">Di ako sanay na ako ang gumagawa
ng malalaking desisyon.</font>

79
00:05:01,125 --> 00:05:04,958
<font size="20">Happy birthday to you</font>

80
00:05:05,041 --> 00:05:07,291
<font size="20">Happy birthday to…</font>

81
00:05:07,375 --> 00:05:08,833
<font size="20">Ayun siya.</font>

82
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,375
<font size="20">Happy birthday…</font>

83
00:05:10,458 --> 00:05:12,833
<font size="20">-Oo. Hindi.
-Two siguro dito.</font>

84
00:05:12,916 --> 00:05:15,333
<font size="20">-Nurse ka ba?
-Ano 'yon?</font>

85
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:18,166
<font size="20">Hindi ka kasi naapektuhan
ng mga litrato kanina,</font>

86
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,750
<font size="20">kaya naisip ko
na baka may medical training ka.</font>

87
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:22,208
<font size="20">Posible ring doktor ka,</font>

88
00:05:22,291 --> 00:05:25,041
<font size="20">pero bihira ang mga babaeng doktor
no'ng kabataan natin,</font>

89
00:05:25,125 --> 00:05:28,666
<font size="20">kaya naisip ko, baka trauma nurse ka
na marami nang nakitang fatal injury.</font>

90
00:05:29,166 --> 00:05:30,083
<font size="20">Tama ba ako?</font>

91
00:05:30,166 --> 00:05:31,958
<font size="20">Tumpak.</font>

92
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:35,083
<font size="20">Sorry, ako pala si Elizabeth.</font>

93
00:05:35,166 --> 00:05:36,166
<font size="20">Ibrahim.</font>

94
00:05:37,333 --> 00:05:38,375
<font size="20">Ron.</font>

95
00:05:38,958 --> 00:05:40,583
<font size="20">-Ako si Joyce.
-Joyce.</font>

96
00:05:40,666 --> 00:05:43,583
<font size="20">Joyce, pakitingnan naman 'tong litrato.</font>

97
00:05:45,541 --> 00:05:47,333
<font size="20">Diyos ko po.</font>

98
00:05:47,833 --> 00:05:50,833
<font size="20">Baka pwedeng sa susunod na lang
'yong mga detalye.</font>

99
00:05:50,916 --> 00:05:54,708
<font size="20">Posible pa ba siyang mabuhay
matapos magtamo ng ganyang tama?</font>

100
00:05:54,791 --> 00:05:58,625
<font size="20">Depende kung gaano siya kabigat.</font>

101
00:05:58,708 --> 00:06:00,041
<font size="20">Ang daming dugo.</font>

102
00:06:00,125 --> 00:06:01,791
<font size="20">Forty-six kilos siya.</font>

103
00:06:01,875 --> 00:06:05,208
<font size="20">Oo, sa tingin ko,
pwede pa siyang mabuhay kung may—</font>

104
00:06:05,291 --> 00:06:08,958
<font size="20">Gaano katagal pa ba
'tong pang-iistorbo n'yo?</font>

105
00:06:09,041 --> 00:06:11,583
<font size="20">Sinasagutan namin 'tong extra-hard Sudoku.</font>

106
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:15,708
<font size="20">Joyce, gusto mo bang sumama sa 'min
para mapag-usapan natin 'to?</font>

107
00:06:15,791 --> 00:06:16,833
<font size="20">Tayo-tayo lang?</font>

108
00:06:16,916 --> 00:06:18,666
<font size="20">A, sige.</font>

109
00:06:19,166 --> 00:06:20,083
<font size="20">Pero sino tayo?</font>

110
00:06:20,166 --> 00:06:22,166
<font size="20">Sorry, ang bastos ko naman.</font>

111
00:06:22,708 --> 00:06:24,666
<font size="20">Kami ang Thursday Murder Club.</font>

112
00:06:35,875 --> 00:06:37,250
<font size="20">Magandang balita naman, Lloyd.</font>

113
00:06:37,333 --> 00:06:39,916
<font size="20">Ayusin mo 'yan,
ang laki-laki ng binabayad ko sa 'yo.</font>

114
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,791
<font size="20">Good morning, Ian.
Sige, ito na ang update.</font>

115
00:06:42,875 --> 00:06:46,041
<font size="20">Sabi ni Mrs. Ventham,
gusto niyang makuha 'yong kotse at bahay,</font>

116
00:06:46,125 --> 00:06:48,291
<font size="20">pati 'yong apartment sa Majorca.</font>

117
00:06:48,375 --> 00:06:50,083
<font size="20">Pambihira, isang karat lang 'yon!</font>

118
00:06:50,166 --> 00:06:52,958
<font size="20">Punyeta sa OA naman ng reaksyon niya!</font>

119
00:06:53,458 --> 00:06:57,166
<font size="20">Di rin naman siya inosente.
May pruweba na ako. Panabla ko 'yon.</font>

120
00:06:57,250 --> 00:07:00,250
<font size="20">OA man o hindi, humanda ka, Ian.</font>

121
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:02,291
<font size="20">Seryoso si Gemma sa divorce</font>

122
00:07:02,375 --> 00:07:04,791
<font size="20">at gagamitin niya ang lahat laban sa 'yo.</font>

123
00:07:20,666 --> 00:07:22,041
<font size="20">-Uy.
-Ian.</font>

124
00:07:27,708 --> 00:07:32,416
<font size="20">Bakit urgent 'to?
Bakit tayo nag-uusap nang patago?</font>

125
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,166
<font size="20">Kailangan kong magamit nang husto
ang mga asset ko ngayon.</font>

126
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:38,291
<font size="20">Ipapahukay ko na 'yong buong sementeryo,
may papeles man o wala.</font>

127
00:07:38,375 --> 00:07:41,666
<font size="20">Mas mabuti nang humingi ng tawad
kesa humingi ng permiso, di ba?</font>

128
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:44,708
<font size="20">Tapos, gigibain 'yong simbahan.
Papalitan ng luxury apartments.</font>

129
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:49,083
<font size="20">Ay, di pwede. Paano 'yong matatanda?
Di sila matutuwa do'n.</font>

130
00:07:49,166 --> 00:07:51,125
<font size="20">Di nila kailangang matuwa.
Mawawala na sila.</font>

131
00:07:51,208 --> 00:07:53,500
<font size="20">Gagawin kong event space
'yong original building.</font>

132
00:07:53,583 --> 00:07:55,208
<font size="20">Pero di sila basta-bastang aalis.</font>

133
00:07:55,291 --> 00:07:59,083
<font size="20">Marami sa kanila, malakas
at makapangyarihan no'ng panahon nila.</font>

134
00:07:59,166 --> 00:08:01,250
<font size="20">Lipas na sila. Panahon ko naman.</font>

135
00:08:01,333 --> 00:08:02,833
<font size="20">Lupa ko 'yon, e.</font>

136
00:08:03,333 --> 00:08:06,708
<font size="20">Hindi ko inaalala
'yong mga bugnuting gurang.</font>

137
00:08:07,208 --> 00:08:10,541
<font size="20">Ang problema lang talaga, si Tony Curran.</font>

138
00:08:12,125 --> 00:08:12,958
<font size="20">Bakit?</font>

139
00:08:16,083 --> 00:08:19,375
<font size="20">-Heto na, Mr. Ventham.
-Salamat.</font>

140
00:08:20,333 --> 00:08:24,125
<font size="20">Part-owner ng Coopers Chase si Tony.
Malaki rin ang kikitain niya, di ba?</font>

141
00:08:24,208 --> 00:08:27,541
<font size="20">Kung papayag siya.
Pero di napapakiusapan ang bugok na 'yon.</font>

142
00:08:27,625 --> 00:08:30,541
<font size="20">Ayaw niyang maabala si Maud,
'yong tita niyang nakatira do'n.</font>

143
00:08:30,625 --> 00:08:32,333
<font size="20">Kung tumanggi siya, sino'ng gagawa?</font>

144
00:08:36,958 --> 00:08:37,916
<font size="20">Ako?</font>

145
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:41,875
<font size="20">Gusto mo 'yon? Ikaw ang boss?
Kikita ka nang mas malaki?</font>

146
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:45,875
<font size="20">Sige ba.</font>

147
00:08:46,375 --> 00:08:48,166
<font size="20">Makakatulong 'yon sa 'kin.</font>

148
00:08:48,250 --> 00:08:50,125
<font size="20">May sakit si Mama sa Poland,</font>

149
00:08:50,208 --> 00:08:53,166
<font size="20">at kailangan kong magpadala ng pera
para mapagamot siya.</font>

150
00:08:53,250 --> 00:08:54,083
<font size="20">Pero…</font>

151
00:08:54,166 --> 00:08:57,166
<font size="20">Bogdan, may mga maghuhukay na
sa Lunes ng umaga.</font>

152
00:08:57,250 --> 00:09:01,625
<font size="20">Pumunta ka lang sa sementeryo at maghukay,
tapos babayaran ka nang malaki.</font>

153
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:05,583
<font size="20">Sobra-sobra pa para maalagaan
'yong nanay mo sa Romania.</font>

154
00:09:05,666 --> 00:09:07,666
<font size="20">-Poland.
-Poland. Sige.</font>

155
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:12,625
<font size="20">Delikadong tao si Tony Curran
na sangkot sa mga delikadong bagay.</font>

156
00:09:13,166 --> 00:09:14,708
<font size="20">Kung sisisantehin mo siya,</font>

157
00:09:16,083 --> 00:09:17,083
<font size="20">baka patayin ka niya.</font>

158
00:09:18,375 --> 00:09:19,208
<font size="20">Bogdan,</font>

159
00:09:20,458 --> 00:09:23,125
<font size="20">mixed martial artist ako, kuha mo?</font>

160
00:09:23,208 --> 00:09:24,333
<font size="20">Pambato ng rehiyon.</font>

161
00:09:24,416 --> 00:09:27,041
<font size="20">Oo, delikado rin akong tao.</font>

162
00:09:27,125 --> 00:09:28,125
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

163
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,291
<font size="20">Ano, pumapayag ka na ba?</font>

164
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:35,083
<font size="20">Sige, payag na 'ko.</font>

165
00:09:35,166 --> 00:09:37,375
<font size="20">-May kasunduan na tayo.
-Ayos.</font>

166
00:09:37,458 --> 00:09:39,250
<font size="20">Good morning, Tita Maud.</font>

167
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:41,333
<font size="20">Paborito ko 'to!</font>

168
00:09:41,416 --> 00:09:43,083
<font size="20">Ang ganda mo ngayon, a?</font>

169
00:09:43,166 --> 00:09:44,833
<font size="20">Ang bait mo talaga, Tone.</font>

170
00:09:44,916 --> 00:09:48,416
<font size="20">-Morning, Tony. Hi, pare. Kumusta?
-Ron. Good morning, pare.</font>

171
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:51,291
<font size="20">Si Joyce nga pala.
Kalilipat lang niya rito.</font>

172
00:09:51,375 --> 00:09:53,375
<font size="20">-Welcome sa Coopers Chase, Joyce.
-Salamat.</font>

173
00:09:53,458 --> 00:09:54,833
<font size="20">Morning, Maud.</font>

174
00:09:57,541 --> 00:09:58,500
<font size="20">Sino siya?</font>

175
00:09:58,583 --> 00:10:01,958
<font size="20">Si Tony Curran, co-owner ng Coopers Chase
kasama si Ian Ventham.</font>

176
00:10:02,041 --> 00:10:04,875
<font size="20">Binili niya nang cash
'yong sirang kumbento no'ng '80s.</font>

177
00:10:04,958 --> 00:10:06,541
<font size="20">Sulit nga 'yong binayad niya ro'n.</font>

178
00:10:06,625 --> 00:10:07,750
<font size="20">Oo nga.</font>

179
00:10:07,833 --> 00:10:11,458
<font size="20">Siya raw mismo
ang nag-renovate nitong lugar no'ng una.</font>

180
00:10:11,541 --> 00:10:14,833
<font size="20">Tapos pinasok si Ventham para may
dagdag na kapital para matapos 'to.</font>

181
00:10:14,916 --> 00:10:17,083
<font size="20">-E, di magkasosyo sila?
-Oo.</font>

182
00:10:17,166 --> 00:10:20,166
<font size="20">-Mukha siyang…
-Brusko, oo, pero wag kang mag-alala.</font>

183
00:10:20,250 --> 00:10:23,041
<font size="20">Kakampi natin si Tony.
'Yon ang pinakamahalaga.</font>

184
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:25,208
<font size="20">Ano'ng ibig mong sabihing
kakampi natin siya?</font>

185
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:29,583
<font size="20">May bali-balitang gusto ni Ian Ventham
na gibain ang Coopers Chase.</font>

186
00:10:30,375 --> 00:10:32,416
<font size="20">Ano? Bakit naman?</font>

187
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:35,333
<font size="20">Para palitan ng luxury apartments.
Palalayasin na tayo.</font>

188
00:10:35,416 --> 00:10:37,375
<font size="20">Pero kalilipat ko lang dito.</font>

189
00:10:37,458 --> 00:10:41,416
<font size="20">Di 'yon papayagan ni Tony, di ba?
Lalo na at buhay pa si Tita Maud.</font>

190
00:10:41,916 --> 00:10:45,375
<font size="20">Kaya mahalaga sa 'tin si Tony Curran
sa sarili niyang paraan.</font>

191
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,875
<font size="20">Pati si Tita Maud.</font>

192
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,375
<font size="20">-Tara, kainin na natin 'yang cake.
-Tara.</font>

193
00:10:56,625 --> 00:10:59,666
<font size="20">Matagal nang nangangailangan
ng medical expert</font>

194
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:00,958
<font size="20">ang Thursday Murder Club.</font>

195
00:11:01,041 --> 00:11:06,416
<font size="20">Kaya gusto naming sumali ka sa 'min,
pero pansamantala lang.</font>

196
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,083
<font size="20">Mukhang masaya 'yan.</font>

197
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:12,625
<font size="20">Sobrang sarap naman nito, Joyce.
Pwede akong kumain nito araw-araw.</font>

198
00:11:12,708 --> 00:11:16,750
<font size="20">Wag mong araw-arawin 'yan, Ron.
Wag mong sayangin 'yong statin mo.</font>

199
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:19,000
<font size="20">Pero sobrang sarap nga nito.</font>

200
00:11:19,083 --> 00:11:21,500
<font size="20">-Wala akong masabi.
-Salamat.</font>

201
00:11:21,583 --> 00:11:22,750
<font size="20">Para sa anak ko sana,</font>

202
00:11:22,833 --> 00:11:25,500
<font size="20">pero perimenopausal daw siya
kaya di na pwede sa kanya.</font>

203
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:30,208
<font size="20">Baka pwedeng mamaya na natin
pag-usapan 'yang cake…</font>

204
00:11:30,291 --> 00:11:31,750
<font size="20">-Joyce?
-Ano 'yon?</font>

205
00:11:34,458 --> 00:11:37,250
<font size="20">-'Yong litratong nakita mo kanina.
-Okay.</font>

206
00:11:37,333 --> 00:11:40,041
<font size="20">'Yong pinatay na babae,
mula 'yon sa cold case namin ngayon.</font>

207
00:11:40,125 --> 00:11:41,125
<font size="20">Si Angela Hughes,</font>

208
00:11:41,208 --> 00:11:43,750
<font size="20">"ang kaso ng babaeng nakaputi
na nahulog sa bintana".</font>

209
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:45,583
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

210
00:11:46,125 --> 00:11:50,208
<font size="20">Ayon sa police report, in-interrogate
'yong boyfriend niyang si Peter Mercer,</font>

211
00:11:50,291 --> 00:11:52,041
<font size="20">at pinalaya din ng mga pulis.</font>

212
00:11:52,125 --> 00:11:53,625
<font size="20">Sa tingin nila, mabuti siyang tao</font>

213
00:11:53,708 --> 00:11:56,291
<font size="20">at naniwala sila sa kwento niya
na may nanloob.</font>

214
00:11:56,375 --> 00:11:58,958
<font size="20">Pero may isang pulis,</font>

215
00:11:59,041 --> 00:12:02,625
<font size="20">si DI Penny Grey
na nag-iisang babae sa pulisya noon,</font>

216
00:12:02,708 --> 00:12:06,125
<font size="20">na gustong i-interrogate ulit si Mercer,
pero tinanggihan ang hiling niya.</font>

217
00:12:06,208 --> 00:12:08,375
<font size="20">Nagkaisa ang boys' club,</font>

218
00:12:08,458 --> 00:12:12,833
<font size="20">tapos naglaho na si Mercer
at hindi na siya nakita ulit.</font>

219
00:12:13,333 --> 00:12:14,541
<font size="20">Sarado na ang kaso.</font>

220
00:12:15,125 --> 00:12:16,458
<font size="20">Hindi na ngayon.</font>

221
00:12:16,541 --> 00:12:19,166
<font size="20">Matanong ko lang,
paano n'yo nakuha ang mga kasong 'to?</font>

222
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:22,083
<font size="20">Siguradong confidential
ang mga dokumentong 'to.</font>

223
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:26,458
<font size="20">Oo nga, pero binibigay 'to
ng isa pang nagtatag sa grupo namin</font>

224
00:12:26,541 --> 00:12:29,291
<font size="20">na malapit ko ring kaibigan, si Penny.</font>

225
00:12:29,375 --> 00:12:34,166
<font size="20">A, si DI Penny Gray na gustong
i-interrogate ulit si Peter Mercer.</font>

226
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:35,833
<font size="20">Oo, siya mismo.</font>

227
00:12:35,916 --> 00:12:38,833
<font size="20">Exciting, a.
Sasama ba siya sa susunod na linggo?</font>

228
00:12:40,458 --> 00:12:42,333
<font size="20">Hindi siya makakasama.</font>

229
00:12:43,083 --> 00:12:45,208
<font size="20">Nakatira na siya sa hospice wing.</font>

230
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:52,375
<font size="20">Sorry.</font>

231
00:12:53,416 --> 00:12:54,250
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

232
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,791
<font size="20">Mare, gusto kitang i-update
tungkol sa cold case natin ngayon.</font>

233
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:02,041
<font size="20">Pinipilit ni Ibrahim
na tawagin namin 'yong</font>

234
00:13:02,125 --> 00:13:05,208
<font size="20">"ang kaso ng babaeng nakaputi
na nahulog sa bintana".</font>

235
00:13:05,708 --> 00:13:08,041
<font size="20">Talaga ba? Maganda bang pakinggan?</font>

236
00:13:08,541 --> 00:13:12,208
<font size="20">Pero mahirap-hirap 'tong kasong 'to.
Magugustuhan mo.</font>

237
00:13:13,208 --> 00:13:17,416
<font size="20">Nakasalalay ang sagot kung gaano katagal
bago namatay 'yong babae.</font>

238
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,125
<font size="20">Pero sinusuwerte tayo.</font>

239
00:13:19,625 --> 00:13:22,541
<font size="20">-Suwerte?
-Oo. May gustong tumulong sa 'tin.</font>

240
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:25,583
<font size="20">Dati siyang nurse na kalilipat lang dito.
Si Joyce.</font>

241
00:13:25,666 --> 00:13:29,041
<font size="20">Mabait naman siya,
medyo mababaw nga lang mag-isip.</font>

242
00:13:29,125 --> 00:13:32,291
<font size="20">Pero maalam siya sa mga sugat
mula sa saksak at iba pa.</font>

243
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,375
<font size="20">Lahat ng tao, may pakinabang.</font>

244
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:38,125
<font size="20">Naku, Pen, sana talaga
pwede mo kaming tulungan sa kasong 'to.</font>

245
00:13:38,208 --> 00:13:42,833
<font size="20">Maganda 'to. Di ako makapaniwalang
di mo sinuggest 'to bago ka…</font>

246
00:13:47,458 --> 00:13:49,625
<font size="20">John, naririnig niya kaya tayo?</font>

247
00:13:51,375 --> 00:13:53,500
<font size="20">Minsan, pinagdarasal ko na sana oo,</font>

248
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:56,583
<font size="20">pero minsan,
pinagdarasal ko rin na sana hindi.</font>

249
00:13:56,666 --> 00:13:58,333
<font size="20">Binabasahan ko na lang siya.</font>

250
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:01,875
<font size="20">-Sana tungkol sa murder mysteries.
-Oo naman.</font>

251
00:14:01,958 --> 00:14:05,875
<font size="20">Halos mabaliw na siya sa pagkainip
bago ka lumipat dito.</font>

252
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:08,875
<font size="20">Dahil sa Thursday Murder Club,
nabuhayan siya.</font>

253
00:14:09,375 --> 00:14:11,000
<font size="20">Ang galing ng grupo n'yo.</font>

254
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:16,000
<font size="20">Kumusta si Stephen?</font>

255
00:14:16,666 --> 00:14:18,041
<font size="20">Alam mo na.</font>

256
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:22,958
<font size="20">Lalala na lang 'yon, di ba?
'Yong gano'ng klase ng dementia.</font>

257
00:14:23,041 --> 00:14:24,875
<font size="20">At hindi na siya gagaling.</font>

258
00:14:24,958 --> 00:14:26,791
<font size="20">Minsan okay siya, minsan hindi.</font>

259
00:14:26,875 --> 00:14:30,041
<font size="20">At minsan nando'n siya,
'yong Stephen na minahal ko.</font>

260
00:14:30,125 --> 00:14:32,250
<font size="20">Matalino, maayos kausap.</font>

261
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:35,250
<font size="20">Tapos malingat lang ako,
wala na siya ulit.</font>

262
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:37,541
<font size="20">Wala na.</font>

263
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:41,541
<font size="20">Kumapit ka sa magagandang alaala.</font>

264
00:14:45,041 --> 00:14:47,625
<font size="20">-Stephen, nandito na ako.
-Hello, mahal.</font>

265
00:14:48,125 --> 00:14:49,458
<font size="20">Masaya ba ang araw mo?</font>

266
00:14:49,541 --> 00:14:52,375
<font size="20">Oo, okay naman. Salamat. Ikaw?</font>

267
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,291
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

268
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:56,875
<font size="20">-Naghatid ng tanghalian 'yong babae.
-Ano'ng kinain mo?</font>

269
00:14:58,041 --> 00:14:59,541
<font size="20">Ay, naku po.</font>

270
00:15:00,041 --> 00:15:01,083
<font size="20">Nakalimutan ko na. Um…</font>

271
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:05,000
<font size="20">Kung ano man 'yon, masarap 'yon.</font>

272
00:15:05,083 --> 00:15:09,541
<font size="20">Ang tanghalian ngayon, chicken pie
na may leeks at nilagang patatas.</font>

273
00:15:10,125 --> 00:15:11,000
<font size="20">Ang sarap.</font>

274
00:15:11,083 --> 00:15:12,291
<font size="20">Mukha ngang masarap.</font>

275
00:15:12,375 --> 00:15:15,166
<font size="20">-Ano'ng binabasa mo?
-Ano…</font>

276
00:15:16,125 --> 00:15:21,416
<font size="20">Nakatingin ako sa garden kanina,
tapos nakakita ako ng magpie. Isa lang.</font>

277
00:15:21,916 --> 00:15:25,541
<font size="20">Nag-alala ako. Kaya nag-research ako.</font>

278
00:15:26,041 --> 00:15:29,750
<font size="20">Alam mo bang habambuhay silang nagsasama?
Ang ganda, di ba?</font>

279
00:15:30,375 --> 00:15:31,625
<font size="20">Parang tayo.</font>

280
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:40,541
<font size="20">Diyos ko, anong oras na.
Huli na ako sa meeting sa publisher ko.</font>

281
00:15:40,625 --> 00:15:42,000
<font size="20">-Hindi, okay lang.
-Ano?</font>

282
00:15:42,083 --> 00:15:45,083
<font size="20">Wag kang magmadali.
Ipagtitimpla muna kita ng tsaa, ha?</font>

283
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:48,666
<font size="20">-Umidlip ka muna.
-Sige, gusto ko 'yan.</font>

284
00:16:24,416 --> 00:16:26,416
<font size="20">Hello sa inyong lahat. Um…</font>

285
00:16:26,958 --> 00:16:28,583
<font size="20">Sorry, late ako. Ako si…</font>

286
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:33,625
<font size="20">Ako si PC Donna De Freitas
ng Fairhaven Police Station.</font>

287
00:16:34,208 --> 00:16:39,750
<font size="20">At ngayon, tuturuan ko kayo kung paano
siguruhing ligtas ang bahay n'yo.</font>

288
00:16:39,833 --> 00:16:41,916
<font size="20">Totoong pulis ka ba?</font>

289
00:16:42,416 --> 00:16:46,041
<font size="20">Siyempre, totoong pulis siya, Marjorie.
Umayos ka.</font>

290
00:16:46,125 --> 00:16:50,125
<font size="20">Opo, totoong pulis ako.</font>

291
00:16:50,208 --> 00:16:53,041
<font size="20">Mabuti. Meron akong tanong
na may kinalaman sa trabaho mo.</font>

292
00:16:53,125 --> 00:16:54,375
<font size="20">-Ganito…
-Okay.</font>

293
00:16:55,041 --> 00:16:58,875
<font size="20">Kung pinatay ng isang lalaki
ang girlfriend niya tapos naglaho siya,</font>

294
00:16:58,958 --> 00:17:03,583
<font size="20">hanggang kailan bukas ang imbestigasyon
bago siya ideklarang nawawala?</font>

295
00:17:07,958 --> 00:17:10,125
<font size="20">A, e…</font>

296
00:17:10,958 --> 00:17:14,791
<font size="20">Di ko alam kung ano'ng kinalaman no'n
sa kaligtasan sa bahay.</font>

297
00:17:16,458 --> 00:17:21,166
<font size="20">Sana hindi 'to boring na diskusyon
tungkol sa mga kandado sa pinto.</font>

298
00:17:22,166 --> 00:17:24,375
<font size="20">Oo, alam na naming
dapat hingiin muna ang ID.</font>

299
00:17:24,458 --> 00:17:28,208
<font size="20">"Taga-gas company ka ba talaga,
o magnanakaw ka?" Gano'n.</font>

300
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:30,666
<font size="20">Opo.</font>

301
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,708
<font size="20">Magpapapasok ako ng magnanakaw.</font>

302
00:17:32,791 --> 00:17:34,583
<font size="20">Para may bisita naman ako.</font>

303
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:43,208
<font size="20">Ang totoo, ang ituturo ko sa inyo,</font>

304
00:17:44,125 --> 00:17:46,833
<font size="20">tungkol sa safety alert bracelets.</font>

305
00:17:52,625 --> 00:17:54,250
<font size="20">Hindi pwede.</font>

306
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:55,583
<font size="20">Hindi pwede!</font>

307
00:17:56,958 --> 00:17:58,916
<font size="20">-Kotse ko 'yon.
-Sorry.</font>

308
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:02,458
<font size="20">Sineseryoso ng parking committee
ang trabaho nila.</font>

309
00:18:02,541 --> 00:18:05,125
<font size="20">-Pasista sila.
-Hindi pwede 'yon. Pulis ako.</font>

310
00:18:05,208 --> 00:18:07,583
<font size="20">Kahit hari ka pa ng England,
wala silang pakialam.</font>

311
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:11,500
<font size="20">Oo, mga isang oras pa
bago ka makakaalis dito.</font>

312
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:16,916
<font size="20">Gusto mong sumabay sa 'ming mananghalian?</font>

313
00:18:19,208 --> 00:18:21,416
<font size="20">-Order tayo ng tig-isang bote?
-Sige.</font>

314
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:24,500
<font size="20">-Bote ng ano?
-Kulay. Red at white. Wine.</font>

315
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:26,583
<font size="20">Maaga pa para uminom ako.</font>

316
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:30,041
<font size="20">Hindi, 'no. Hindi na maaga
kung gising ka na ng 5:30.</font>

317
00:18:30,125 --> 00:18:31,625
<font size="20">Hulaan mo kung ilang taon na ako.</font>

318
00:18:33,208 --> 00:18:34,208
<font size="20">Seventy-eight?</font>

319
00:18:34,708 --> 00:18:37,000
<font size="20">-Pero di halata.
-Nagpi-Pilates ako, e.</font>

320
00:18:37,083 --> 00:18:40,291
<font size="20">Gaya nga ng sinabi ko,
di kayo mukhang matanda sa 65,</font>

321
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:43,166
<font size="20">pero nahahalata ang edad sa mga kamay.</font>

322
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,875
<font size="20">Ganyan nga dapat ang pulis.</font>

323
00:18:44,958 --> 00:18:48,083
<font size="20">PC De Freitas,
ito ba ang una mong trabaho?</font>

324
00:18:48,166 --> 00:18:49,541
<font size="20">Hindi ho.</font>

325
00:18:49,625 --> 00:18:52,208
<font size="20">Nagtrabaho ako saglit
sa Met Police sa London,</font>

326
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:54,458
<font size="20">tapos umalis ako at lumipat dito.</font>

327
00:18:54,541 --> 00:18:56,916
<font size="20">Kumusta naman? Nababagot ka siguro, 'no?</font>

328
00:18:59,666 --> 00:19:02,458
<font size="20">Okay lang. Pwede mong sabihin sa 'min.</font>

329
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:04,250
<font size="20">Sige ho.</font>

330
00:19:05,166 --> 00:19:09,833
<font size="20">Oho, bagot na bagot na ako
sa paghuli ng traffic offenses buong araw.</font>

331
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,791
<font size="20">Single ba kayo? May asawa na?</font>

332
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:16,750
<font size="20">Binata ako.</font>

333
00:19:16,833 --> 00:19:18,458
<font size="20">Diborsyado. Dalawang beses.</font>

334
00:19:20,666 --> 00:19:21,500
<font size="20">Biyuda ako.</font>

335
00:19:22,416 --> 00:19:25,666
<font size="20">May asawa si Elizabeth.
Si Stephen, napakabait no'n.</font>

336
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:28,416
<font size="20">Talaga ho? Sasabay ba siya sa 'tin ngayon?</font>

337
00:19:29,083 --> 00:19:30,833
<font size="20">Hindi, may deadline pa siya.</font>

338
00:19:30,916 --> 00:19:32,666
<font size="20">Published author si Stephen.</font>

339
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:35,833
<font size="20">Talaga ho? Kayo, ano'ng trabaho n'yo
bago kayo nag-retire?</font>

340
00:19:35,916 --> 00:19:39,500
<font size="20">Psychiatrist. Ang specialization ko,
pagtulong sa mga beteranong may PTSD.</font>

341
00:19:39,583 --> 00:19:41,708
<font size="20">E, kayo, Ron?</font>

342
00:19:42,416 --> 00:19:43,916
<font size="20">A, unyonista.</font>

343
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:47,083
<font size="20">Hindi lang ordinaryong unyonista, Ron.</font>

344
00:19:47,166 --> 00:19:51,375
<font size="20">Pinakabatikang unyonista.
Ang tawag nga sa kanya dati, Kasamang Ron.</font>

345
00:19:51,458 --> 00:19:52,916
<font size="20">Oo nga.</font>

346
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,833
<font size="20">Kung may piket, welga, o pagkakampo,</font>

347
00:19:55,916 --> 00:19:58,875
<font size="20">ako ang nangunguna
sa pagpapakilos ng mga tao.</font>

348
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,875
<font size="20">Ang saya ng mga araw na 'yon.</font>

349
00:20:02,541 --> 00:20:03,791
<font size="20">Kayo, Joyce?</font>

350
00:20:03,875 --> 00:20:05,625
<font size="20">Naku, wala.</font>

351
00:20:05,708 --> 00:20:08,291
<font size="20">Nurse ako na naging nanay,
tapos naging nurse ulit.</font>

352
00:20:08,375 --> 00:20:11,541
<font size="20">'Yong anak kong si Joanna
ang interesting sa pamilya namin.</font>

353
00:20:11,625 --> 00:20:14,750
<font size="20">Nagma-manage siya ng hedge fund,
kung pamilyar kayo do'n.</font>

354
00:20:14,833 --> 00:20:15,833
<font size="20">-Hindi.
-Di ko alam.</font>

355
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:16,833
<font size="20">Ako rin.</font>

356
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:20,541
<font size="20">E, kayo, Elizabeth?
Ano'ng trabaho n'yo noon?</font>

357
00:20:22,833 --> 00:20:24,166
<font size="20">International affairs.</font>

358
00:20:24,250 --> 00:20:26,875
<font size="20">Ano ho, parang diplomat?</font>

359
00:20:29,375 --> 00:20:32,291
<font size="20">Sabihin na lang nating
marami akong kayang gawin.</font>

360
00:20:32,375 --> 00:20:34,416
<font size="20">-Salinan ko po kayo?
-'Yong wine. Salamat.</font>

361
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:35,791
<font size="20">Pahingi ako niyan.</font>

362
00:20:35,875 --> 00:20:38,750
<font size="20">Ano'ng meron ngayon? Tingnan natin.</font>

363
00:20:38,833 --> 00:20:41,000
<font size="20">-Oorderan na kita.
-Talaga?</font>

364
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:42,916
<font size="20">Bilis, Jackie, sabayan mo ako.</font>

365
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:45,541
<font size="20">Ang ganda dito.</font>

366
00:20:45,625 --> 00:20:47,916
<font size="20">Nakaka-excite na tuloy tumanda.</font>

367
00:20:49,541 --> 00:20:53,375
<font size="20">Ibig kong sabihin, makaabot
sa malalayong kabanata ng buhay ko.</font>

368
00:20:53,458 --> 00:20:55,416
<font size="20">Oo, walang katulad ang Coopers Chase.</font>

369
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,250
<font size="20">-Uy!
-Napakasuwerte namin—</font>

370
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:59,583
<font size="20">-Ayan na siya.
-Uy, si Jason.</font>

371
00:20:59,666 --> 00:21:00,750
<font size="20">Kumusta, Pa?</font>

372
00:21:00,833 --> 00:21:02,958
<font size="20">Mabuti naman, anak.
Masaya kasi nakita kita.</font>

373
00:21:03,541 --> 00:21:07,166
<font size="20">-Si Jason Ritchie ba 'yon?
-Oo, ang celebrity namin. Anak ni Ron.</font>

374
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:09,250
<font size="20">Dumadalaw nang mga tatlong beses
kada linggo.</font>

375
00:21:09,833 --> 00:21:11,041
<font size="20">Uy, Ibsy.</font>

376
00:21:11,125 --> 00:21:12,916
<font size="20">-Jason.
-Hello, Jason.</font>

377
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:16,541
<font size="20">-Elizabeth.
-Jason, siya si PC Donna De Freitas.</font>

378
00:21:16,625 --> 00:21:18,333
<font size="20">-Okay. Kumusta?
-Hi.</font>

379
00:21:18,416 --> 00:21:19,916
<font size="20">Nice to meet you.</font>

380
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,333
<font size="20">Fan ako— sobrang fan mo ako.
Pinanood ko ang lahat ng laban mo.</font>

381
00:21:25,375 --> 00:21:28,666
<font size="20">Ano na'ng ginagawa mo
mula no'ng na-injure ka?</font>

382
00:21:29,583 --> 00:21:31,833
<font size="20">May paisa-isang TV guesting.</font>

383
00:21:31,916 --> 00:21:33,083
<font size="20">Oo nga.</font>

384
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:36,041
<font size="20">Siya ang ultimate champion noon,
di ba, anak?</font>

385
00:21:36,125 --> 00:21:37,541
<font size="20">-Alam niya, Pa.
-Oo.</font>

386
00:21:37,625 --> 00:21:40,541
<font size="20">Jason, siya si Joyce. Bago lang siya rito.</font>

387
00:21:40,625 --> 00:21:44,958
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang sabihing
sobrang galing mo sa Celebrity MasterChef.</font>

388
00:21:45,041 --> 00:21:47,291
<font size="20">Maraming salamat, Joyce.</font>

389
00:21:47,375 --> 00:21:50,291
<font size="20">Ano na'ng susunod mong gagawin, Jason?</font>

390
00:21:50,375 --> 00:21:53,125
<font size="20">Kakasimula lang ng rehearsal
ng Dancing on Ice.</font>

391
00:21:54,541 --> 00:21:56,708
<font size="20">Parang sports din 'yon, di ba?</font>

392
00:21:59,000 --> 00:21:59,833
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

393
00:22:01,583 --> 00:22:05,083
<font size="20">Maraming salamat sa tanghalian.</font>

394
00:22:05,166 --> 00:22:06,583
<font size="20">Salamat. Ay.</font>

395
00:22:07,458 --> 00:22:09,916
<font size="20">-Salamat. Ingat kayo.
-Galingan mo.</font>

396
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:12,500
<font size="20">-Bye.
-Sige, bye.</font>

397
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:18,250
<font size="20">Okay siya, a.</font>

398
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:20,625
<font size="20">Baka mapakinabangan natin siya.</font>

399
00:22:20,708 --> 00:22:22,208
<font size="20">Tony, pare, hayaan mo na.</font>

400
00:22:22,291 --> 00:22:25,916
<font size="20">-Di ko palalampasin 'to.
-Wala naman akong ginagawang masama.</font>

401
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,708
<font size="20">Pabor 'to sa 'tin.
Basahin mo 'yong kontrata.</font>

402
00:22:28,791 --> 00:22:29,916
<font size="20">-Kontrata?
-Oo.</font>

403
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,666
<font size="20">Ipapagawa mo kay Bogdan,
'yong Polish na trabahador, 'no?</font>

404
00:22:32,750 --> 00:22:35,541
<font size="20">Wala kang magagawa
hangga't buhay si Tita Maud.</font>

405
00:22:35,625 --> 00:22:38,000
<font size="20">-Magkita na lang tayo sa korte.
-Sige ba.</font>

406
00:22:38,083 --> 00:22:39,625
<font size="20">-Naku.
-Handa na ako.</font>

407
00:22:39,708 --> 00:22:41,583
<font size="20">Tungkol saan kaya 'yon?</font>

408
00:22:42,333 --> 00:22:43,208
<font size="20">Sa pera.</font>

409
00:22:44,333 --> 00:22:46,166
<font size="20">Lagi namang tungkol sa pera.</font>

410
00:22:47,541 --> 00:22:49,000
<font size="20">Tony, ano'ng nangyayari?</font>

411
00:22:49,083 --> 00:22:51,125
<font size="20">Ano'ng nangyayari, Liz? Siya.</font>

412
00:22:51,208 --> 00:22:52,916
<font size="20">Si Ventham, may binabalak siya.</font>

413
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:56,666
<font size="20">Huhukayin niya 'yong sementeryo
at gagawing luxury apartments.</font>

414
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:59,625
<font size="20">-Totoo pala 'yong tsismis?
-Sobrang ingay no'n.</font>

415
00:22:59,708 --> 00:23:03,041
<font size="20">Oo, pero paano 'yong main building?
'Yong mga apartment namin?</font>

416
00:23:04,083 --> 00:23:07,000
<font size="20">-Gagawin niyang event space.
-Diyos ko.</font>

417
00:23:07,583 --> 00:23:08,458
<font size="20">-Ron.
-O.</font>

418
00:23:08,541 --> 00:23:11,166
<font size="20">-Ano'ng pwedeng gawin?
-Magpatawag ng residents' meeting.</font>

419
00:23:11,250 --> 00:23:14,875
<font size="20">Nasa kontrata ng pag-upa natin 'yon.
Kailangan niya muna tayong konsultahin.</font>

420
00:23:14,958 --> 00:23:17,666
<font size="20">Pero wala ka bang magagawa
bilang co-owner?</font>

421
00:23:17,750 --> 00:23:19,166
<font size="20">Marami.</font>

422
00:23:19,250 --> 00:23:20,666
<font size="20">Marami akong magagawa.</font>

423
00:23:21,250 --> 00:23:22,333
<font size="20">Tinitiyak ko sa inyo,</font>

424
00:23:22,416 --> 00:23:25,666
<font size="20">gagawin ko lahat para maligtas
ang lugar na 'to at kayong mga residente.</font>

425
00:23:25,750 --> 00:23:28,541
<font size="20">Di basta-basta binabangga ang mga Curran.</font>

426
00:23:29,041 --> 00:23:30,750
<font size="20">Humanda siya.</font>

427
00:23:31,333 --> 00:23:32,166
<font size="20">Seryoso ako.</font>

428
00:23:35,083 --> 00:23:37,083
<font size="20">May laban tayong haharapin.</font>

429
00:23:43,833 --> 00:23:45,791
<font size="20">-Boo!
-Boo!</font>

430
00:23:52,625 --> 00:23:57,583
<font size="20">ILIGTAS ANG COOPERS CHASE</font>

431
00:23:58,083 --> 00:24:01,583
<font size="20">-Ano'ng ginagawa mo? Hoy!
-Tarantado ka!</font>

432
00:24:01,666 --> 00:24:02,875
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

433
00:24:03,916 --> 00:24:05,291
<font size="20">Punong-puno, a.</font>

434
00:24:05,375 --> 00:24:08,041
<font size="20">Una sa lahat, iko-quote ko si Confucius.</font>

435
00:24:08,125 --> 00:24:10,458
<font size="20">Eto ang quote para sa 'yo.</font>

436
00:24:11,125 --> 00:24:13,666
<font size="20">Sa 'yo nanggaling 'to,
Mr. Ventham, hindi sa 'kin.</font>

437
00:24:13,750 --> 00:24:17,625
<font size="20">"Maaari lamang magtayo ng iba pang tirahan
ang Ventham Investments, Inc.</font>

438
00:24:17,708 --> 00:24:21,666
<font size="20">kung kokonsultahin ang kasalukuyang
mga residente ng Coopers Chase."</font>

439
00:24:22,958 --> 00:24:25,708
<font size="20">Konsultasyon nga 'to.
Kayo ang mga residente.</font>

440
00:24:25,791 --> 00:24:28,291
<font size="20">Kumonsulta na kayo
sa loob ng sampung minuto.</font>

441
00:24:28,375 --> 00:24:31,458
<font size="20">Hindi 'to konsultasyon. Pananambang 'to.</font>

442
00:24:31,541 --> 00:24:35,875
<font size="20">Alam naming balak mong palayasin
kaming lahat na retiradong nakatira dito.</font>

443
00:24:35,958 --> 00:24:41,041
<font size="20">-Oo, tapos itatapon mo kami sa kalye.
-Ano ba. Hindi totoo 'yan, ano ba.</font>

444
00:24:41,125 --> 00:24:44,708
<font size="20">Hindi sa kalye. Babayaran kayo
at bibigyan ng malilipatan.</font>

445
00:24:44,791 --> 00:24:48,750
<font size="20">Pero gusto namin sa Coopers Chase.
May kontrata kami ng pag-upa.</font>

446
00:24:48,833 --> 00:24:50,250
<font size="20">Panghabambuhay na pag-upa.</font>

447
00:24:50,333 --> 00:24:51,875
<font size="20">Oo, at di kayo mamatay-matay.</font>

448
00:24:51,958 --> 00:24:54,583
<font size="20">Pero kung babasahin n'yo ang kontrata,</font>

449
00:24:54,666 --> 00:24:56,666
<font size="20">makikita n'yong may clause na—</font>

450
00:24:56,750 --> 00:24:59,250
<font size="20">Ang punto, Mr. Ventham, gusto namin dito.</font>

451
00:24:59,333 --> 00:25:00,166
<font size="20">Tama!</font>

452
00:25:00,250 --> 00:25:02,458
<font size="20">Ito ang tahanan namin. Magkakaibigan kami.</font>

453
00:25:02,541 --> 00:25:06,583
<font size="20">May mga residente ring nangangailangan
ng espesyal na pangangalaga ang asawa.</font>

454
00:25:06,666 --> 00:25:08,375
<font size="20">O walang pamilya sa bansang 'to.</font>

455
00:25:09,208 --> 00:25:11,208
<font size="20">At paano na 'yong mga llama?</font>

456
00:25:11,875 --> 00:25:14,625
<font size="20">Walang-habas sila, parang mga kuneho.</font>

457
00:25:14,708 --> 00:25:18,291
<font size="20">Nag-donate ako sa donkey sanctuary
kaya kukunin nila 'yong mga llama.</font>

458
00:25:18,375 --> 00:25:22,083
<font size="20">At 'yon din ba
ang gusto mong gawin sa 'ming lahat?</font>

459
00:25:23,416 --> 00:25:25,916
<font size="20">Ako ang vet nila. Inaalagaan ko sila.</font>

460
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:29,500
<font size="20">At hindi mo pwedeng gawin 'yon
nang di mo ako kinokonsulta.</font>

461
00:25:29,583 --> 00:25:32,166
<font size="20">Kahit ano pa'ng sabihin n'yo, lupa ko 'to.</font>

462
00:25:32,250 --> 00:25:34,916
<font size="20">Okay? Karapatan kong
gawin ang gusto ko rito.</font>

463
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:38,125
<font size="20">Sagrado ang mga puntod
at di mo dapat hukayin ang mga 'yon</font>

464
00:25:38,208 --> 00:25:40,208
<font size="20">para lang kumita ng pera.</font>

465
00:25:40,291 --> 00:25:41,583
<font size="20">Kasalanan 'yon.</font>

466
00:25:45,041 --> 00:25:47,458
<font size="20">Nagagalit din pala si Father Mackie.</font>

467
00:25:47,541 --> 00:25:49,541
<font size="20">Araw-araw niyang inaalagaan 'yon, e.</font>

468
00:25:49,625 --> 00:25:51,750
<font size="20">Parang minamaliit
ang pananampalataya niya.</font>

469
00:25:51,833 --> 00:25:52,875
<font size="20">Siguro nga.</font>

470
00:25:52,958 --> 00:25:56,000
<font size="20">Dahil umalis na ang sugo ng Diyos,
hanggang dito na lang tayo.</font>

471
00:25:56,083 --> 00:25:59,166
<font size="20">Tapos na ang oras.
Maghuhukay na sa Lunes. Maraming salamat.</font>

472
00:26:11,250 --> 00:26:14,750
<font size="20">Nagkamali siya ng binangga
kung inaakala niyang palalampasin ko 'to.</font>

473
00:26:14,833 --> 00:26:17,333
<font size="20">-Dineretso ko siya.
-Talaga?</font>

474
00:26:17,833 --> 00:26:20,125
<font size="20">Oo, 'ka ko, "Makinig ka, Ventham."</font>

475
00:26:20,208 --> 00:26:23,083
<font size="20">"Subukan mo akong palitan
no'ng Polish na ugok na 'yon,</font>

476
00:26:23,166 --> 00:26:24,541
<font size="20">"malilintikan ka talaga."</font>

477
00:26:24,625 --> 00:26:25,583
<font size="20">Teka lang, Tony.</font>

478
00:26:25,666 --> 00:26:29,541
<font size="20">Wag kang padalos-dalos. Maging alerto ka.</font>

479
00:26:29,625 --> 00:26:32,958
<font size="20">-Tatawagan kita ulit. Bye.
-Sige, bye.</font>

480
00:26:47,541 --> 00:26:49,041
<font size="20">Ano'ng ginagawa mo rito?</font>

481
00:26:53,500 --> 00:26:57,583
<font size="20">Lumilitaw na pinagpapalo hanggang mamatay
ang biktima.</font>

482
00:26:57,666 --> 00:26:59,458
<font size="20">Walang nakitang murder weapon.</font>

483
00:27:09,250 --> 00:27:13,708
<font size="20">Almusal na kasama ang KNT1.
Ang radyo ninyo sa Kent.</font>

484
00:27:13,791 --> 00:27:14,916
<font size="20">Nagbabagang balita.</font>

485
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:19,416
<font size="20">Natagpuang patay ang lokal na negosyante
at kontratistang si Tony Curran</font>

486
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:21,875
<font size="20">sa bahay niya kahapon ng umaga.</font>

487
00:27:21,958 --> 00:27:24,541
<font size="20">Lumilitaw na pinagpapalo siya
hanggang mamatay.</font>

488
00:27:24,625 --> 00:27:26,916
<font size="20">Wala pang natutukoy na suspek.</font>

489
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,958
<font size="20">Ayon sa pulisya,
kasalukuyan itong iniimbestigahan.</font>

490
00:27:33,083 --> 00:27:34,791
<font size="20">Elizabeth? Elizabeth!</font>

491
00:27:35,375 --> 00:27:38,458
<font size="20">Kailangan nating magkita-kita
sa labas ng jigsaw room, ngayon na!</font>

492
00:27:39,541 --> 00:27:41,916
<font size="20">Emergency meeting, ngayon na!</font>

493
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,083
<font size="20">Ano'ng nangyayari?</font>

494
00:27:43,166 --> 00:27:45,583
<font size="20">Ayan! Sige, ganyan nga.</font>

495
00:27:45,666 --> 00:27:49,541
<font size="20">Kaliwa! Kanan!</font>

496
00:27:51,916 --> 00:27:52,875
<font size="20">-Ron!
-Bakit?</font>

497
00:27:52,958 --> 00:27:55,916
<font size="20">Kailangan nating mag-meeting.
Umahon ka na, bilis!</font>

498
00:27:57,250 --> 00:27:59,541
<font size="20">Tungkol saan ba 'to, Joyce?
Nagyo-yoga ako, e.</font>

499
00:27:59,625 --> 00:28:01,791
<font size="20">Isang beses ka lang makakasaludo sa araw.</font>

500
00:28:01,875 --> 00:28:05,416
<font size="20">Di dapat nagpapatawag ng meeting
ang mga pansamantalang miyembro ng TMC.</font>

501
00:28:05,500 --> 00:28:07,791
<font size="20">May pinatay! May pinatay ngayon!</font>

502
00:28:07,875 --> 00:28:08,750
<font size="20">-Ano?
-Sino?</font>

503
00:28:08,833 --> 00:28:11,750
<font size="20">Si Tony Curran! Pinatay siya sa bahay niya
kahapon ng umaga.</font>

504
00:28:12,375 --> 00:28:15,333
<font size="20">May totoong kaso na tayong lulutasin.
Ang saya, di ba?</font>

505
00:28:16,541 --> 00:28:20,041
<font size="20">-Hindi, Joyce, di masaya 'to.
-Kung patay na si Tony Curran…</font>

506
00:28:20,125 --> 00:28:23,083
<font size="20">Sino na'ng pipigil
sa pagkawasak ng Coopers Chase?</font>

507
00:28:23,166 --> 00:28:24,833
<font size="20">Magagawa ni Ventham ang gusto niya.</font>

508
00:28:24,916 --> 00:28:28,458
<font size="20">Oo naman. Nalulungkot ako sa nangyari.
Sumalangit nawa si Tony.</font>

509
00:28:28,541 --> 00:28:32,375
<font size="20">-Sino'ng gustong pumatay kay Tony Curran?
-Oo. At paano natin sila mahuhuli?</font>

510
00:28:32,875 --> 00:28:36,166
<font size="20">Malamang na gumagawa na
ng listahan ng suspek ang mga pulis.</font>

511
00:28:36,250 --> 00:28:41,916
<font size="20">Kailangan natin ng lalaki, o babae,
sa loob ng pulisya.</font>

512
00:28:43,708 --> 00:28:47,125
<font size="20">Mukhang alam na natin kung sino.</font>

513
00:28:47,208 --> 00:28:49,000
<font size="20">Makinig kayong lahat.</font>

514
00:28:49,083 --> 00:28:51,416
<font size="20">Masahol ang dahilan ng pagkamatay,</font>

515
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:54,541
<font size="20">blunt trauma sa kanang bahagi ng ulo.</font>

516
00:28:54,625 --> 00:28:57,708
<font size="20">Magulo sa bahay,
posibleng pagnanakaw na nauwi sa pagpatay,</font>

517
00:28:57,791 --> 00:29:00,375
<font size="20">pero walang bakas ng sapilitang pagpasok.</font>

518
00:29:00,458 --> 00:29:03,541
<font size="20">Unlisted number
'yong huling tinawagan niya.</font>

519
00:29:03,625 --> 00:29:05,291
<font size="20">Malamang, burner phone 'yon.</font>

520
00:29:05,375 --> 00:29:08,916
<font size="20">May iba't ibang gamit
sa sahig at sideboard.</font>

521
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:13,916
<font size="20">Mga dokumento, bayarin, kontrata,
kasama ang litratong 'to.</font>

522
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,291
<font size="20">Ngayon—</font>

523
00:29:16,041 --> 00:29:18,458
<font size="20">Iwan mo na 'yang tray, Constable.</font>

524
00:29:18,541 --> 00:29:21,166
<font size="20">Siguradong may mahahalaga ka pang
trabahong aasikasuhin.</font>

525
00:29:21,666 --> 00:29:22,500
<font size="20">Opo.</font>

526
00:29:23,250 --> 00:29:24,250
<font size="20">Meron nga.</font>

527
00:29:26,083 --> 00:29:27,791
<font size="20">-Napakahahalagang trabaho.
-Okay…</font>

528
00:29:27,875 --> 00:29:29,666
<font size="20">Di kusang matitimpla ang tsaa.</font>

529
00:29:33,916 --> 00:29:35,833
<font size="20">-Hello?
-Joyce, handa ka na?</font>

530
00:29:35,916 --> 00:29:36,958
<font size="20">Malapit na.</font>

531
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:41,041
<font size="20">-Magkita tayo sa bus stop.
-Sige.</font>

532
00:30:00,666 --> 00:30:03,041
<font size="20">Ayan. Ano? Sobra na ba?</font>

533
00:30:03,125 --> 00:30:07,041
<font size="20">Hindi. Mukha namang makatotohanan.</font>

534
00:30:07,541 --> 00:30:08,375
<font size="20">Hello?</font>

535
00:30:09,500 --> 00:30:12,208
<font size="20">Fairhaven Police Station. Oo naman.</font>

536
00:30:12,291 --> 00:30:14,625
<font size="20">Ako si Dr. Ibrahim Arif.</font>

537
00:30:14,708 --> 00:30:15,708
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

538
00:30:15,791 --> 00:30:20,041
<font size="20">May mahalagang impormasyon
'yong kaibigan kong si Ron Ritchie</font>

539
00:30:20,125 --> 00:30:22,666
<font size="20">tungkol sa pagpatay kay Tony Curran.</font>

540
00:30:23,166 --> 00:30:24,750
<font size="20">Nasa Coopers Chase kami.</font>

541
00:30:24,833 --> 00:30:27,000
<font size="20">Pasensya na, hindi pwede, e.</font>

542
00:30:27,083 --> 00:30:29,791
<font size="20">Hindi kami makakapunta sa presinto.</font>

543
00:30:29,875 --> 00:30:34,541
<font size="20">May sakit at mahina si Ron ngayon.</font>

544
00:30:34,625 --> 00:30:36,916
