545
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:38,375
<font size="20">Wag mong sabihin 'yan.</font>

546
00:30:39,416 --> 00:30:41,750
<font size="20">Pwede ba kayong magpadala ng tao rito?</font>

547
00:30:43,208 --> 00:30:46,458
<font size="20">-Magaling. Salamat.
-Ayos. Magaling. Okay na, 'no?</font>

548
00:30:46,541 --> 00:30:49,416
<font size="20">Hindi pa, Ron.
Masyadong maayos ang itsura mo.</font>

549
00:30:49,916 --> 00:30:51,500
<font size="20">-Sige.
-Magpakadungis ka.</font>

550
00:30:51,583 --> 00:30:53,375
<font size="20">Magpakadungis.</font>

551
00:31:02,958 --> 00:31:05,625
<font size="20">Lalabas ako. Kung kailangan mo ako,
tumawag ka lang.</font>

552
00:31:05,708 --> 00:31:08,250
<font size="20">Ayos lang ako. Wag mo akong alalahanin.</font>

553
00:31:09,083 --> 00:31:10,125
<font size="20">Bakit…</font>

554
00:31:11,500 --> 00:31:13,291
<font size="20">Bakit ganyan ang bihis mo?</font>

555
00:31:14,208 --> 00:31:15,833
<font size="20">Kamukha mo si Queen Elizabeth.</font>

556
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:18,375
<font size="20">-Talaga ba?
-Oo.</font>

557
00:31:22,041 --> 00:31:23,458
<font size="20">Nakakalungkot nga no'n.</font>

558
00:31:24,208 --> 00:31:25,333
<font size="20">No'ng libing niya.</font>

559
00:31:26,125 --> 00:31:28,083
<font size="20">-Naaalala mo 'yon?
-Oo naman.</font>

560
00:31:28,750 --> 00:31:31,541
<font size="20">September 19, 2022.</font>

561
00:31:31,625 --> 00:31:33,500
<font size="20">Pinanood natin 'yon sa TV.</font>

562
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:36,208
<font size="20">Pinuna mo pa nga 'yong security no'n.</font>

563
00:31:36,291 --> 00:31:37,583
<font size="20">Oo nga.</font>

564
00:31:38,708 --> 00:31:39,833
<font size="20">Ano'ng gagawin mo?</font>

565
00:31:39,916 --> 00:31:42,541
<font size="20">Alam mo na, kung ano-ano. May plano ako.</font>

566
00:31:42,625 --> 00:31:47,125
<font size="20">Mahal kong Elizabeth, lagi kang may plano.</font>

567
00:31:49,291 --> 00:31:50,166
<font size="20">Kanan.</font>

568
00:32:01,958 --> 00:32:03,500
<font size="20">Gusto ko 'yang pamatong mo.</font>

569
00:32:04,375 --> 00:32:06,708
<font size="20">-Ano na'ng gagawin?
-Sumunod ka sa 'kin.</font>

570
00:32:07,666 --> 00:32:09,125
<font size="20">Sobrang exciting nito.</font>

571
00:32:09,208 --> 00:32:11,583
<font size="20">Pakiramdam ko,
nasa panggabing drama tayo sa Linggo</font>

572
00:32:11,666 --> 00:32:14,166
<font size="20">tungkol sa matatalinong
matatandang babaeng detective</font>

573
00:32:14,250 --> 00:32:15,958
<font size="20">na laging nauutakan ang mga pulis.</font>

574
00:32:16,041 --> 00:32:17,125
<font size="20">Ikaw rin ba?</font>

575
00:32:17,208 --> 00:32:19,166
<font size="20">-Hindi. At saka, Joyce?
-Ano 'yon?</font>

576
00:32:19,250 --> 00:32:22,958
<font size="20">Wag mo na ulit mababanggit sa 'kin
ang "matatalinong matatandang babae".</font>

577
00:32:23,041 --> 00:32:23,875
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

578
00:32:29,708 --> 00:32:31,750
<font size="20">Iho, tulungan mo naman ako.</font>

579
00:32:31,833 --> 00:32:35,833
<font size="20">-Ninakaw 'yong bag ko sa labas ng…
-Marks and Spencer's.</font>

580
00:32:35,916 --> 00:32:37,625
<font size="20">Oo, sa Marks and Spencer's.</font>

581
00:32:37,708 --> 00:32:42,291
<font size="20">Nando'n lahat. 'Yong pension
at lahat ng pera ko. Tulungan mo ako.</font>

582
00:32:42,375 --> 00:32:45,666
<font size="20">Sige po. Kukunin ko ang detalye n'yo. Um…</font>

583
00:32:45,750 --> 00:32:48,875
<font size="20">Babaeng police constable lang
ang kakausapin ko.</font>

584
00:32:48,958 --> 00:32:52,791
<font size="20">Sinisigurado ko sa inyong kwalipikado ako
at mahinahon lang ako.</font>

585
00:32:52,875 --> 00:32:54,458
<font size="20">-Hindi, babae dapat.
-Pero…</font>

586
00:32:54,541 --> 00:32:55,750
<font size="20">Madre siya!</font>

587
00:32:58,125 --> 00:32:58,958
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

588
00:33:00,416 --> 00:33:02,916
<font size="20">Tama, madre ako.</font>

589
00:33:03,500 --> 00:33:07,750
<font size="20">Oo, may panata na ako, kaya bawal akong
makisama sa kahit sinong lalaki.</font>

590
00:33:07,833 --> 00:33:09,833
<font size="20">Maliban kay Hesus.</font>

591
00:33:10,750 --> 00:33:11,916
<font size="20">Sige po, um…</font>

592
00:33:12,958 --> 00:33:14,458
<font size="20">-Dito lang kayo.
-Pakibilisan.</font>

593
00:33:14,541 --> 00:33:16,708
<font size="20">Sige po, dito lang kayo.</font>

594
00:33:19,791 --> 00:33:23,000
<font size="20">Madre, ang galing mo. Sana naisip ko 'yon.</font>

595
00:33:24,666 --> 00:33:27,083
<font size="20">Mga miss, ano po'ng…</font>

596
00:33:30,916 --> 00:33:32,083
<font size="20">maitutulong ko?</font>

597
00:33:38,333 --> 00:33:41,541
<font size="20">-Nanakaw ba talaga 'yong bag n'yo?
-Hindi.</font>

598
00:33:41,625 --> 00:33:44,875
<font size="20">Good luck sa magtatangka no'n.
Isipin mo na lang.</font>

599
00:33:47,041 --> 00:33:49,958
<font size="20">Pwedeng magtanong
kung ano'ng ginagawa n'yo rito?</font>

600
00:33:50,041 --> 00:33:53,166
<font size="20">Manghuhuli pa ako
ng mga kriminal at iba pa.</font>

601
00:33:53,250 --> 00:33:55,833
<font size="20">Magaling. Una sa lahat, sasabihin ko lang.</font>

602
00:33:55,916 --> 00:33:59,333
<font size="20">Wag kang magpanggap na di ka masayang
makita kami, kasi alam kong masaya ka.</font>

603
00:33:59,416 --> 00:34:01,125
<font size="20">Masaya rin kaming makita ka.</font>

604
00:34:01,208 --> 00:34:04,375
<font size="20">Mas masaya kung aaminin nating lahat 'yon.</font>

605
00:34:08,083 --> 00:34:12,041
<font size="20">Para sa record,
ayaw sumagot ni PC De Freitas</font>

606
00:34:12,125 --> 00:34:14,625
<font size="20">pero pinipigilan niyang ngumiti.</font>

607
00:34:16,125 --> 00:34:19,791
<font size="20">At kung ano man 'yong trabaho mong
naistorbo namin, isa lang ang alam ko.</font>

608
00:34:19,875 --> 00:34:22,041
<font size="20">Hindi 'yon paghuli ng kriminal.</font>

609
00:34:22,541 --> 00:34:24,333
<font size="20">Nakakabagot ang trabaho mo.</font>

610
00:34:27,416 --> 00:34:28,500
<font size="20">No comment.</font>

611
00:34:29,625 --> 00:34:31,375
<font size="20">May itatanong kami sa 'yo.</font>

612
00:34:33,041 --> 00:34:34,041
<font size="20">Sige ho.</font>

613
00:34:34,625 --> 00:34:38,458
<font size="20">Gusto mo bang makasali sa imbestigasyon
ng pagpatay kay Tony Curran?</font>

614
00:34:42,041 --> 00:34:44,250
<font size="20">Hindi mangyayari 'yon.</font>

615
00:34:44,333 --> 00:34:47,208
<font size="20">Pero kung magagawa namin,
interesado ka ba?</font>

616
00:34:48,875 --> 00:34:50,625
<font size="20">Kung magagawa n'yo?</font>

617
00:34:51,166 --> 00:34:53,375
<font size="20">Sino ba kayo, head ng MI5?</font>

618
00:34:55,833 --> 00:34:56,666
<font size="20">Hindi.</font>

619
00:34:57,500 --> 00:35:02,000
<font size="20">Hindi, babae lang ako na di basta sumusuko
kapag tinanggihan. Ikaw rin siguro.</font>

620
00:35:05,375 --> 00:35:06,416
<font size="20">Ano'ng mapapala n'yo?</font>

621
00:35:07,250 --> 00:35:09,416
<font size="20">Gusto ko 'yang pagdududa mo.</font>

622
00:35:09,500 --> 00:35:12,208
<font size="20">'Yan ang katangiang pinakahinahangaan ko.</font>

623
00:35:12,291 --> 00:35:13,583
<font size="20">Mabuti.</font>

624
00:35:14,083 --> 00:35:18,250
<font size="20">E di, ayos lang na sabihin n'yo
kung ano'ng mapapala n'yo dito, di ba?</font>

625
00:35:19,625 --> 00:35:23,750
<font size="20">Baka kasi may tanong kami
tungkol sa imbestigasyon.</font>

626
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,375
<font size="20">Bawal akong magbigay
ng confidential information.</font>

627
00:35:27,458 --> 00:35:30,583
<font size="20">Wala akong ipapagawang
bawal sa trabaho mo. Nangangako ako.</font>

628
00:35:31,083 --> 00:35:32,625
<font size="20">Bilang babaeng lingkod ng Diyos.</font>

629
00:35:36,500 --> 00:35:38,375
<font size="20">Kung tatanggapin ko ang tulong n'yo</font>

630
00:35:38,458 --> 00:35:41,625
<font size="20">na makasama ako
sa imbestigasyon kay Tony Curran…</font>

631
00:35:43,375 --> 00:35:44,500
<font size="20">kailan tayo magsisimula?</font>

632
00:35:44,583 --> 00:35:46,166
<font size="20">-Maya-maya na.
-Maya-maya na?</font>

633
00:35:46,250 --> 00:35:47,208
<font size="20">Depende sa traffic.</font>

634
00:35:47,291 --> 00:35:51,041
<font size="20">-Nakahanda na ang mga tao namin.
-Sina Ron at Ibrahim ang tinutukoy niya.</font>

635
00:35:51,125 --> 00:35:54,458
<font size="20">Ito ang contact details ko.
I-text mo ako kung pwede ka.</font>

636
00:35:54,541 --> 00:35:58,750
<font size="20">-Natapos ang interview ng 12:47 p.m.
-Naka-off 'yang tape recorder.</font>

637
00:35:58,833 --> 00:36:00,416
<font size="20">-Oo nga pala.
-Oo.</font>

638
00:36:08,583 --> 00:36:09,666
<font size="20">Handa na ang lahat.</font>

639
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,708
<font size="20">Copy.</font>

640
00:36:18,208 --> 00:36:21,333
<font size="20">Magandang hapon.
Hinahanap ko si Mr. Ron Ritchie.</font>

641
00:36:21,416 --> 00:36:23,666
<font size="20">-Dito, Inspector.
-Salamat.</font>

642
00:36:26,375 --> 00:36:29,166
<font size="20">Ron? Nandito na 'yong mabait na pulis.</font>

643
00:36:29,250 --> 00:36:33,208
<font size="20">Pulis! Ayoko ng pulis!</font>

644
00:36:33,291 --> 00:36:35,208
<font size="20">Ano'ng kailangan mo sa 'kin? Ha?</font>

645
00:36:35,291 --> 00:36:37,208
<font size="20">-May karapatan akong magprotesta.
-Kalma.</font>

646
00:36:37,291 --> 00:36:40,583
<font size="20">Pasensya na sa asal ni Ron.
Di siya komportable sa mga awtoridad.</font>

647
00:36:40,666 --> 00:36:43,875
<font size="20">-Ron. Kumalma ka lang.
-Sige.</font>

648
00:36:43,958 --> 00:36:46,708
<font size="20">Kakausapin ka lang niya
tungkol sa nakita mong pagtatalo</font>

649
00:36:46,791 --> 00:36:48,625
<font size="20">nina Ian Ventham at Tony Curran.</font>

650
00:36:48,708 --> 00:36:51,500
<font size="20">Sinisigurado kong
walang mangyayaring masama sa inyo.</font>

651
00:36:51,583 --> 00:36:54,333
<font size="20">-May mga itatanong lang ako.
-Ayoko!</font>

652
00:36:54,416 --> 00:36:57,583
<font size="20">Ayoko. Gusto kong makausap
'yong babaeng parak. Ayoko sa kanya.</font>

653
00:36:58,166 --> 00:37:01,958
<font size="20">-Sinong babae?
-'Yong magandang babae na pumunta rito.</font>

654
00:37:02,041 --> 00:37:03,583
<font size="20">Si PC De Freitas.</font>

655
00:37:03,666 --> 00:37:05,958
<font size="20">'Yong nagbigay ng tips
tungkol sa lock ng bintana.</font>

656
00:37:06,041 --> 00:37:07,958
<font size="20">Nagustuhan siya ni Ron.</font>

657
00:37:10,250 --> 00:37:13,166
<font size="20">A, siya.</font>

658
00:37:13,250 --> 00:37:16,083
<font size="20">Hindi pwede, bago pa lang siya, e.</font>

659
00:37:16,166 --> 00:37:19,916
<font size="20">Wala pa siyang karanasan. Ang totoo,
di siya kasali sa imbestigasyon—</font>

660
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:22,625
<font size="20">Siya ang gusto ko!</font>

661
00:37:22,708 --> 00:37:25,916
<font size="20">Siya lang ang kakausapin ko.</font>

662
00:37:27,166 --> 00:37:29,708
<font size="20">Pasensya na. Si PC De Freit—</font>

663
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,833
<font size="20">May paraan ba
para maisali mo siya sa team mo?</font>

664
00:37:40,333 --> 00:37:41,666
<font size="20">Susubukan ko.</font>

665
00:37:46,916 --> 00:37:48,291
<font size="20">Magaling, Ibsy.</font>

666
00:37:48,375 --> 00:37:50,583
<font size="20">Ang galing mo, pare. Sobrang…</font>

667
00:37:52,958 --> 00:37:54,208
<font size="20">PC De Freitas.</font>

668
00:37:54,916 --> 00:37:57,666
<font size="20">Kakabalita lang ng HR. Ililipat ka.</font>

669
00:37:58,250 --> 00:38:00,750
<font size="20">-Saan?
-Sa CID.</font>

670
00:38:00,833 --> 00:38:02,833
<font size="20">Criminal Investigation Department.</font>

671
00:38:03,333 --> 00:38:06,291
<font size="20">Mag-iimbestiga ka na rin
sa kaso ni Tony Curran.</font>

672
00:38:06,958 --> 00:38:07,916
<font size="20">Imposible.</font>

673
00:38:08,958 --> 00:38:09,791
<font size="20">Talaga?</font>

674
00:38:17,625 --> 00:38:20,375
<font size="20">DONNA: WALA PANG 20 MINUTES 'YON!! WTF?!</font>

675
00:38:21,750 --> 00:38:23,500
<font size="20">Ano'ng ibig sabihin ng "WTF"?</font>

676
00:38:23,583 --> 00:38:24,500
<font size="20">What the fuck?</font>

677
00:38:24,583 --> 00:38:25,458
<font size="20">Ha?</font>

678
00:38:25,541 --> 00:38:26,375
<font size="20">What the fuck?</font>

679
00:38:29,208 --> 00:38:30,041
<font size="20">Sorry, iha.</font>

680
00:38:32,833 --> 00:38:34,583
<font size="20">Tinuro 'yon ng anak ko.</font>

681
00:38:34,666 --> 00:38:36,916
<font size="20">Sorry sa kaibigan ko. Medyo ano siya…</font>

682
00:38:40,083 --> 00:38:41,208
<font size="20">Hindi naman, a.</font>

683
00:38:58,666 --> 00:39:00,958
<font size="20">Wow, interesting.</font>

684
00:39:08,500 --> 00:39:13,541
<font size="20">MAY MISTERYOSONG PANGATLONG INVESTOR
ANG COOPERS CHASE</font>

685
00:39:13,625 --> 00:39:15,083
<font size="20">BAKIT GISING PA KAYO??</font>

686
00:39:33,041 --> 00:39:37,583
<font size="20">Joyce, nakuha ng kaibigan ko
'yong accounts ng Coopers Chase.</font>

687
00:39:37,666 --> 00:39:40,791
<font size="20">Pero sobrang hirap maintindihan
ng mga 'yon.</font>

688
00:39:40,875 --> 00:39:43,166
<font size="20">-Baka kaya ng anak mo, si…
-Joanna.</font>

689
00:39:43,250 --> 00:39:45,666
<font size="20">Joanna. Nasa finance siya, di ba?</font>

690
00:39:45,750 --> 00:39:48,875
<font size="20">Pwede kaya niyang tingnan
at ipaliwanag sa 'tin 'yon?</font>

691
00:39:49,541 --> 00:39:51,416
<font size="20">Confidential, siyempre.</font>

692
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:55,666
<font size="20">Ewan ko lang. Sobrang busy niya, e.
Wala nga siyang oras para kumustahin ako.</font>

693
00:39:55,750 --> 00:39:57,541
<font size="20">Subukan mo lang, ha?</font>

694
00:39:58,041 --> 00:40:00,791
<font size="20">Kung gusto natin ng propesyonal
at mabilis na imbestigasyon,</font>

695
00:40:00,875 --> 00:40:03,583
<font size="20">dapat gamitin natin
ang lahat ng resources natin.</font>

696
00:40:04,541 --> 00:40:05,958
<font size="20">-Susubukan ko.
-Magaling.</font>

697
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,750
<font size="20">Joyce, may talento ka.</font>

698
00:40:14,416 --> 00:40:17,500
<font size="20">Lilinawin ko lang.
Club na tungkol sa pagpatay?</font>

699
00:40:18,083 --> 00:40:20,125
<font size="20">Parang true crime podcast?</font>

700
00:40:20,208 --> 00:40:21,958
<font size="20">Parang gano'n.</font>

701
00:40:22,041 --> 00:40:24,583
<font size="20">Pero kami ang nag-iimbestiga
no'ng mga kaso.</font>

702
00:40:25,166 --> 00:40:26,666
<font size="20">Nakakakilabot, a.</font>

703
00:40:26,750 --> 00:40:29,166
<font size="20">Aaminin ko, parang di kapani-paniwala.</font>

704
00:40:29,250 --> 00:40:32,083
<font size="20">Pero napakaganda no'ng grupo.
Nagtutulungan kami.</font>

705
00:40:32,666 --> 00:40:35,666
<font size="20">Baka naman pwede mong tingnan
'yong mga account?</font>

706
00:40:35,750 --> 00:40:38,458
<font size="20">Kung hindi mo napapansin, busy ako, Ma.</font>

707
00:40:38,541 --> 00:40:40,208
<font size="20">Diyos ko naman, Joanna.</font>

708
00:40:40,708 --> 00:40:45,000
<font size="20">Isang beses kada linggo ka lang tumatawag.
Kung bumisita ka, 47 minutes lang.</font>

709
00:40:45,083 --> 00:40:46,625
<font size="20">Pati cake ko, ayaw mong kainin.</font>

710
00:40:46,708 --> 00:40:51,666
<font size="20">Ang hinihingi ko lang, iisantabi mo muna
'yang mga bilyonaryo mo saglit</font>

711
00:40:51,750 --> 00:40:55,416
<font size="20">at tulungan mo ang nag-iisang nanay mo
kahit ngayon lang!</font>

712
00:40:57,791 --> 00:40:59,708
<font size="20">-Titingnan ko ang magagawa ko.
-Salamat.</font>

713
00:41:01,416 --> 00:41:02,416
<font size="20">Mga kaso ni Curran.</font>

714
00:41:02,500 --> 00:41:06,166
<font size="20">Reckless driving, pananakit,
possession of an illegal weapon.</font>

715
00:41:06,250 --> 00:41:07,125
<font size="20">Marami pa.</font>

716
00:41:07,208 --> 00:41:09,750
<font size="20">Siguradong maraming may gustong
mamatay siya.</font>

717
00:41:09,833 --> 00:41:13,208
<font size="20">Pero kailangan muna nating malaman
kung sino 'yong lalaking nasa litrato.</font>

718
00:41:13,291 --> 00:41:14,166
<font size="20">Anong litrato?</font>

719
00:41:14,250 --> 00:41:18,375
<font size="20">'Yong litratong nakuha sa murder scene.
May ilang nakakalat do'n.</font>

720
00:41:18,458 --> 00:41:20,708
<font size="20">Mga litrato ng bakasyon. Kasal at iba pa.</font>

721
00:41:20,791 --> 00:41:24,000
<font size="20">Pero dito, may kasama siyang
lalaki na hindi namin makilala.</font>

722
00:41:24,083 --> 00:41:28,333
<font size="20">Kababalik lang nito mula sa forensics.
Gusto mo bang makita?</font>

723
00:41:28,833 --> 00:41:30,291
<font size="20">Kung puwede.</font>

724
00:41:30,791 --> 00:41:31,666
<font size="20">Sorry.</font>

725
00:41:31,750 --> 00:41:34,041
<font size="20">Di ba natural pakinggan
ang "kung puwede" sa CID?</font>

726
00:41:34,125 --> 00:41:36,458
<font size="20">Di ako ang dapat tinatanong n'yan.</font>

727
00:41:36,541 --> 00:41:38,541
<font size="20">Tingnan mo na lang, De Freitas.</font>

728
00:41:39,333 --> 00:41:42,375
<font size="20">Donna na lang.
Nakakailang kung apelyido, e.</font>

729
00:41:43,500 --> 00:41:44,333
<font size="20">Donna?</font>

730
00:41:45,250 --> 00:41:46,500
<font size="20">Oo, pangalan ko.</font>

731
00:41:47,500 --> 00:41:49,041
<font size="20">First name ko.</font>

732
00:41:49,125 --> 00:41:50,583
<font size="20">Sige, susubukan ko.</font>

733
00:41:50,666 --> 00:41:54,833
<font size="20">Pero hindi ako mahilig
tumawag ng tao sa pangalan nila.</font>

734
00:41:54,916 --> 00:41:59,375
<font size="20">Di ko nga alam ang pangalan ni Griffiths
kahit pitong taon na siya sa 'tin.</font>

735
00:41:59,958 --> 00:42:02,041
<font size="20">Di mo kilala 'tong katabi ni Curran?</font>

736
00:42:02,125 --> 00:42:04,541
<font size="20">Hindi, pero inaalam na ni Griffiths.</font>

737
00:42:04,625 --> 00:42:07,500
<font size="20">Sabihin mo kay Griffiths, wag na.
Si Bobby Tanner 'to.</font>

738
00:42:07,583 --> 00:42:08,416
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

739
00:42:08,916 --> 00:42:10,625
<font size="20">Utak siya ng sindikato.</font>

740
00:42:10,708 --> 00:42:14,166
<font size="20">Pinahirapan niya ang Met Police.
Ilang taon na nila siyang pinaghahahanap.</font>

741
00:42:14,250 --> 00:42:15,416
<font size="20">Nandito pala siya.</font>

742
00:42:15,916 --> 00:42:16,958
<font size="20">Ang ironic.</font>

743
00:42:17,041 --> 00:42:19,208
<font size="20">Hindi siya nahanap ng Met?</font>

744
00:42:19,291 --> 00:42:21,333
<font size="20">Hindi. At eto pa.</font>

745
00:42:21,916 --> 00:42:24,333
<font size="20">May isa pa silang kasama,
pero naka-crop siya.</font>

746
00:42:24,416 --> 00:42:25,291
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

747
00:42:25,916 --> 00:42:26,833
<font size="20">Oo, tingnan mo.</font>

748
00:42:26,916 --> 00:42:29,250
<font size="20">Kita mo 'yong braso niya
sa salamin sa likod?</font>

749
00:42:29,958 --> 00:42:31,041
<font size="20">Oo nga, 'no.</font>

750
00:42:32,625 --> 00:42:33,791
<font size="20">Ang galing mo do'n.</font>

751
00:42:35,666 --> 00:42:37,583
<font size="20">Sasabihin ko 'yan kay Griffiths.</font>

752
00:42:38,333 --> 00:42:40,000
<font size="20">'Yong pinakamainit, Joyce.</font>

753
00:42:44,541 --> 00:42:46,083
<font size="20">Nandito na sila. Handa na kayo?</font>

754
00:42:46,166 --> 00:42:47,000
<font size="20">-Oo.
-Handa na.</font>

755
00:42:47,083 --> 00:42:48,375
<font size="20">-Tandaan n'yo.
-Usod ka.</font>

756
00:42:48,458 --> 00:42:51,458
<font size="20">Bonus na lang
ang anumang impormasyong makukuha natin.</font>

757
00:42:51,541 --> 00:42:52,375
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

758
00:42:52,875 --> 00:42:55,000
<font size="20">Siguradong walang sasabihin si Hudson.</font>

759
00:42:55,083 --> 00:42:59,083
<font size="20">Kaya dapat maasiwa siya hangga't maaari.</font>

760
00:42:59,166 --> 00:43:02,125
<font size="20">Sa karanasan ko, umaamin
o nagbubunyag ng mga bagay ang mga tao</font>

761
00:43:02,208 --> 00:43:03,500
<font size="20">kapag di sila komportable.</font>

762
00:43:03,583 --> 00:43:07,416
<font size="20">Baka mas magbigay siya ng impormasyon
kung aasikasuhin at pakakainin natin siya.</font>

763
00:43:08,375 --> 00:43:09,208
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

764
00:43:09,291 --> 00:43:14,041
<font size="20">Nakapag-interrogate ka na ba ng espiya
ng kalaban sa dating East Germany?</font>

765
00:43:14,625 --> 00:43:15,875
<font size="20">Hindi pa.</font>

766
00:43:18,166 --> 00:43:19,583
<font size="20">Hello, Joanna, anak.</font>

767
00:43:19,666 --> 00:43:23,125
<font size="20">-Tiningnan ko ang accounts ni Ian Ventham.
-Ayan na.</font>

768
00:43:23,208 --> 00:43:25,833
<font size="20">May interesting na nangyayari do'n.</font>

769
00:43:26,416 --> 00:43:30,041
<font size="20">Pinadala ko sa 'yo 'yong mga PDF.
Alam mo ba kung ano ang PDF?</font>

770
00:43:30,125 --> 00:43:31,708
<font size="20">Hulaan mo, Jo.</font>

771
00:43:31,791 --> 00:43:34,750
<font size="20">Alam ni Ibrahim. Maalam siya sa lahat.</font>

772
00:43:36,375 --> 00:43:37,208
<font size="20">PDF.</font>

773
00:43:37,750 --> 00:43:39,250
<font size="20">Bingo.</font>

774
00:43:43,583 --> 00:43:45,583
<font size="20">Susmaryosep.</font>

775
00:43:54,916 --> 00:43:58,958
<font size="20">Susmaryosep talaga, Joyce.
Biruin mo, may matalino kang anak.</font>

776
00:43:59,041 --> 00:44:02,958
<font size="20">Napakahalagang impormasyon nito.
Ngayon, may laban na tayo.</font>

777
00:44:03,041 --> 00:44:04,291
<font size="20">-Magaling, Jo.
-Magaling.</font>

778
00:44:04,375 --> 00:44:06,333
<font size="20">Salamat, Ma. Mauuna na 'ko.</font>

779
00:44:07,333 --> 00:44:08,583
<font size="20">Ayan na.</font>

780
00:44:10,875 --> 00:44:13,041
<font size="20">-Pasok kayo.
-Salamat.</font>

781
00:44:15,791 --> 00:44:19,708
<font size="20">Magandang hapon.
Kilala n'yo na si PC De Freitas.</font>

782
00:44:19,791 --> 00:44:22,208
<font size="20">Iniimbestigahan namin
ang pagpatay kay Tony Curran.</font>

783
00:44:23,583 --> 00:44:26,458
<font size="20">Balita ko, may nalalaman daw kayo</font>

784
00:44:26,958 --> 00:44:29,208
<font size="20">sa paghahanda ni Mr. Curran
na i-redevelop—</font>

785
00:44:29,291 --> 00:44:31,833
<font size="20">Ang bastos naman namin,
Detective Chief Inspector.</font>

786
00:44:31,916 --> 00:44:34,333
<font size="20">-Upo ka.
-Oo nga, upo ka.</font>

787
00:44:34,416 --> 00:44:36,500
<font size="20">Para di ka mapagod. Ayan.</font>

788
00:44:36,583 --> 00:44:38,291
<font size="20">Wag kang mahiya.</font>

789
00:44:41,208 --> 00:44:43,958
<font size="20">-Ako lang ba o mainit dito?
-Mainit talaga.</font>

790
00:44:44,041 --> 00:44:45,375
<font size="20">Seventy-six years old na ako.</font>

791
00:44:46,958 --> 00:44:49,250
<font size="20">Ang higpit ng hawak n'yo, Mr. Ritchie.</font>

792
00:44:49,333 --> 00:44:51,125
<font size="20">Akala ko may sakit at mahina kayo.</font>

793
00:44:51,208 --> 00:44:54,166
<font size="20">Sa edad ko,
may magaganda at masasamang araw.</font>

794
00:44:54,250 --> 00:44:56,083
<font size="20">Minsan okay ako, minsan hindi.</font>

795
00:44:56,166 --> 00:44:58,416
<font size="20">At mukhang tumubo na 'yong bungi n'yo.</font>

796
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:01,583
<font size="20">Ano 'yon? Ay, oo nga. Himala 'to.</font>

797
00:45:01,666 --> 00:45:04,541
<font size="20">Ang bastos namin.
Di ka man lang namin inalok ng tsaa.</font>

798
00:45:04,625 --> 00:45:08,000
<font size="20">-Gusto mo ba ng asukal?
-Wag na. Nagbabawas ako ng asukal.</font>

799
00:45:08,083 --> 00:45:11,208
<font size="20">Kain ka nito. Pwede ka bang kumain ng cake
habang naka-duty? Sana oo.</font>

800
00:45:11,291 --> 00:45:13,625
<font size="20">Wag na ho, marami akong nakain kanina.</font>

801
00:45:16,666 --> 00:45:17,666
<font size="20">Sige na nga.</font>

802
00:45:18,500 --> 00:45:20,625
<font size="20">-Ayan. Kumain ka nang marami.
-Mukhang masarap.</font>

803
00:45:21,791 --> 00:45:24,500
<font size="20">Sorry, hindi ko kaya… Ang…</font>

804
00:45:25,208 --> 00:45:26,541
<font size="20">Steady lang.</font>

805
00:45:29,958 --> 00:45:32,000
<font size="20">Grabe, sobrang sarap naman nito.</font>

806
00:45:32,083 --> 00:45:33,375
<font size="20">-Di ba?
-Wow!</font>

807
00:45:33,458 --> 00:45:34,750
<font size="20">Bale, Ron,</font>

808
00:45:35,833 --> 00:45:38,541
<font size="20">nakita n'yo sina Ian at Tony
na nag-aaway sa car park.</font>

809
00:45:38,625 --> 00:45:42,166
<font size="20">-Tama? Kaya tayo nandito.
-Oo. Matindi 'yong away nila.</font>

810
00:45:42,250 --> 00:45:45,166
<font size="20">Hindi sila nagkaayos.
Nilayasan siya ni Tony…</font>

811
00:45:45,875 --> 00:45:47,208
<font size="20">Tungkol yata sa pera.</font>

812
00:45:47,291 --> 00:45:49,750
<font size="20">Sabi nga nila, pagmamahal sa pera
ang ugat ng kasamaan.</font>

813
00:45:49,833 --> 00:45:51,375
<font size="20">Pero di ba si Jung ang nagsabi—</font>

814
00:45:51,458 --> 00:45:56,041
<font size="20">Sabi ng anak ko, mahigpit daw
ang security system sa bahay ni Tony.</font>

815
00:45:56,125 --> 00:45:58,875
<font size="20">Talaga? Kilala ba ng anak mo
si Tony Curran?</font>

816
00:45:59,875 --> 00:46:02,541
<font size="20">Lahat naman kami, kilala siya.</font>

817
00:46:02,625 --> 00:46:05,500
<font size="20">Sikat si Tony dito, e.</font>

818
00:46:05,583 --> 00:46:07,375
<font size="20">Oo, mahilig siyang gumala.</font>

819
00:46:07,458 --> 00:46:11,875
<font size="20">Lahat kami, nakausap na siya minsan.
Wala lang 'yon.</font>

820
00:46:11,958 --> 00:46:15,666
<font size="20">Makakatulong pa rin kung makakausap ko
ang anak n'yo. Si Jason, tama ba?</font>

821
00:46:15,750 --> 00:46:18,875
<font size="20">Sige, walang problema. Dadalawin niya ako.</font>

822
00:46:18,958 --> 00:46:20,833
<font size="20">Pero duda akong makakatulong siya.</font>

823
00:46:20,916 --> 00:46:23,958
<font size="20">Hayaan n'yo lang ang mga pulis
na gawin ang trabaho nila…</font>

824
00:46:24,041 --> 00:46:28,041
<font size="20">Ang sinasabi lang yata ni Ron,
baka may nakuha kayo sa security system.</font>

825
00:46:28,125 --> 00:46:31,000
<font size="20">Sira 'yon. Sayang sa pera,
kung ako ang tatanungin.</font>

826
00:46:31,083 --> 00:46:35,291
<font size="20">Nakapagtataka naman, builder siya
pero sira 'yong security system niya?</font>

827
00:46:35,791 --> 00:46:37,750
<font size="20">Oo nga. E, 'yong oras ng pagkamatay niya?</font>

828
00:46:38,833 --> 00:46:40,416
<font size="20">Bawal naming sabihin.</font>

829
00:46:40,500 --> 00:46:44,833
<font size="20">Di pa 'yon pampublikong impormasyon.
Masyadong sensitibo para sabihin.</font>

830
00:46:44,916 --> 00:46:49,791
<font size="20">Tama. Bigay ka nang bigay ng impormasyon,
pero kami, hindi.</font>

831
00:46:49,875 --> 00:46:54,958
<font size="20">Halimbawa, alam kong
may tatlong investor ang Coopers Chase</font>

832
00:46:55,041 --> 00:46:56,416
<font size="20">no'ng una 'tong tinayo.</font>

833
00:46:56,500 --> 00:47:00,833
<font size="20">Sina Ian Ventham, Tony Curran,
at isang di-kilalang investor</font>

834
00:47:00,916 --> 00:47:03,916
<font size="20">na gumamit ng shell account
na "Bloomin' Marvelous".</font>

835
00:47:05,083 --> 00:47:06,208
<font size="20">Alam mo ba 'yon?</font>

836
00:47:07,541 --> 00:47:09,875
<font size="20">-Hindi ko alam 'yon.
-Ah.</font>

837
00:47:11,958 --> 00:47:14,750
<font size="20">Meron din ako nito.</font>

838
00:47:17,833 --> 00:47:19,208
<font size="20">Lumang cell phone?</font>

839
00:47:20,500 --> 00:47:22,916
<font size="20">Luma man, gumagana pa rin 'to.</font>

840
00:47:24,166 --> 00:47:28,333
<font size="20">At naglalaman 'to ng mga PDF
ng financial accounts ni Ian Ventham</font>

841
00:47:28,416 --> 00:47:31,125
<font size="20">na nagpapakitang babalik kay Ian Ventham</font>

842
00:47:31,208 --> 00:47:33,833
<font size="20">ang stake ni Tony Curran sa lupang 'to
kapag namatay siya.</font>

843
00:47:33,916 --> 00:47:38,333
<font size="20">Ibig sabihin, kumita ng milyones
si Ian Ventham sa pagpatay kay Curran.</font>

844
00:47:38,833 --> 00:47:39,791
<font size="20">Talaga?</font>

845
00:47:41,375 --> 00:47:43,083
<font size="20">Kapalit ng oras ng pagkamatay niya.</font>

846
00:47:43,166 --> 00:47:45,666
<font size="20">Hindi ko pwedeng sabihin 'yon.</font>

847
00:47:47,833 --> 00:47:49,375
<font size="20">Gusto mo ba 'tong files o hindi?</font>

848
00:47:50,791 --> 00:47:51,916
<font size="20">11:24.</font>

849
00:47:52,500 --> 00:47:54,625
<font size="20">-PC De Freitas.
-Eksakto, a.</font>

850
00:47:54,708 --> 00:47:57,208
<font size="20">Na-record ng smartwatch
no'ng tumigil ang puso niya.</font>

851
00:47:57,291 --> 00:47:59,083
<font size="20">PC De Freitas!</font>

852
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:02,125
<font size="20">Gusto mo ba 'yong files o hindi?</font>

853
00:48:05,791 --> 00:48:06,833
<font size="20">Eto na.</font>

854
00:48:14,250 --> 00:48:15,125
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

855
00:48:17,791 --> 00:48:20,916
<font size="20">Saan n'yo naman nakuha
'tong mga account ni Ian Ventham?</font>

856
00:48:21,000 --> 00:48:24,458
<font size="20">Pribadong kompanya 'yon.
Kahit kami, hindi namin makuha.</font>

857
00:48:25,833 --> 00:48:26,708
<font size="20">Nagtulungan kami.</font>

858
00:48:29,916 --> 00:48:34,000
<font size="20">Alam pa rin ng henerasyon namin
kung gaano kahalaga ang pagtutulungan.</font>

859
00:48:35,750 --> 00:48:38,416
<font size="20">Paano mo napagaan 'yong puff pastry?</font>

860
00:48:38,500 --> 00:48:41,958
<font size="20">Dapat haluin 'yon nang mabilis
habang malamig pa.</font>

861
00:48:42,041 --> 00:48:44,375
<font size="20">-Eto na.
-Magaling ka sigurong gumamit ng kamay.</font>

862
00:48:44,458 --> 00:48:47,250
<font size="20">-Ilang beses na akong nasabihan n'yan.
-Jason!</font>

863
00:48:49,583 --> 00:48:52,208
<font size="20">-Ayan na siya. Jason, anak ko.
-Hi, Pa.</font>

864
00:48:52,291 --> 00:48:55,583
<font size="20">Gaya ng ipinangako ko. Eto na.
DCI Hudson. Si Jason.</font>

865
00:48:55,666 --> 00:48:57,625
<font size="20">Jason "The Hammer" Ritchie.</font>

866
00:48:57,708 --> 00:49:02,625
<font size="20">Hindi ka na kailangang ipakilala.
Napanood ko ang lahat ng laban mo.</font>

867
00:49:02,708 --> 00:49:04,708
<font size="20">Sayang at tumigil ka dahil sa injury mo.</font>

868
00:49:04,791 --> 00:49:07,000
<font size="20">-Nangyayari talaga 'yon minsan.
-Sorry, oo nga.</font>

869
00:49:07,083 --> 00:49:09,833
<font size="20">-Pero masaya ring mag-guest sa TV, 'no?
-Oo.</font>

870
00:49:09,916 --> 00:49:12,083
<font size="20">Di ba may Snow White pantomime ka
sa Pasko?</font>

871
00:49:12,166 --> 00:49:13,458
<font size="20">Oo, ako 'yong prinsipe.</font>

872
00:49:13,541 --> 00:49:14,458
<font size="20">DCI Hudson,</font>

873
00:49:14,541 --> 00:49:18,583
<font size="20">gusto mo bang magpakuha kasama ng
three-time WBA middleweight champion?</font>

874
00:49:18,666 --> 00:49:21,666
<font size="20">-Ngayon na. Dali.
-Maraming salamat. Sigurado ka?</font>

875
00:49:21,750 --> 00:49:23,125
<font size="20">Oo naman.</font>

876
00:49:23,208 --> 00:49:25,416
<font size="20">Matutuwa silang lahat sa presinto.</font>

877
00:49:25,500 --> 00:49:27,000
<font size="20">Pout na, dilaan mo ang labi mo.</font>

878
00:49:27,083 --> 00:49:29,416
<font size="20">-Ikaw talaga 'yan? Nakataas ang kamao.
-Ako nga 'to.</font>

879
00:49:29,500 --> 00:49:31,083
<font size="20">-Ayan.
-Damihan mo na.</font>

880
00:49:31,166 --> 00:49:33,416
<font size="20">-Ayan. Ang ganda.
-Ding ding.</font>

881
00:49:33,500 --> 00:49:35,208
<font size="20">-Natural na natural, a.
-Sumuntok ka.</font>

882
00:49:35,291 --> 00:49:37,041
<font size="20">Gusto ko 'yan. Diyan mismo.</font>

883
00:49:37,125 --> 00:49:39,083
<font size="20">-Okay na ba?
-Magugustuhan mo 'to.</font>

884
00:49:39,166 --> 00:49:41,958
<font size="20">-Merong maganda d'yan.
-Ang gaganda, o.</font>

885
00:49:42,541 --> 00:49:44,291
<font size="20">-Salamat.
-Wala 'yon. Mauuna na 'ko.</font>

886
00:49:44,375 --> 00:49:45,791
<font size="20">-Sandali lang.
-Sige.</font>

887
00:49:45,875 --> 00:49:48,625
<font size="20">Ano'ng masasabi mo
tungkol kina Tony Curran at Ian Ventham?</font>

888
00:49:48,708 --> 00:49:51,375
<font size="20">-Magkakakilala kayo, di ba?
-Hindi.</font>

889
00:49:52,208 --> 00:49:53,916
<font size="20">Kilala ko lang sila.</font>

890
00:49:54,500 --> 00:49:57,458
<font size="20">Maraming kaaway si Tony, pero si Ian din.</font>

891
00:49:57,541 --> 00:49:58,958
<font size="20">May naaalala ka ba kung sino?</font>

892
00:50:00,250 --> 00:50:01,083
<font size="20">Wala.</font>

893
00:50:01,583 --> 00:50:02,750
<font size="20">Sa ngayon, wala.</font>

894
00:50:03,541 --> 00:50:05,125
<font size="20">Sige na, aalis na 'ko.</font>

895
00:50:05,208 --> 00:50:08,041
<font size="20">-Sige.
-Tawagan mo ako kapag may naalala ka.</font>

896
00:50:08,125 --> 00:50:10,166
<font size="20">-DCI Hudson, nice to meet you.
-Kayo rin.</font>

897
00:50:10,250 --> 00:50:12,208
<font size="20">-PC De Freitas, galingan mo.
-Oo.</font>

898
00:50:12,291 --> 00:50:15,500
<font size="20">Heto na ako. Teka lang, Jason.</font>

899
00:50:15,583 --> 00:50:19,541
<font size="20">DCI Hudson, alam kong mahilig ka sa cake.
Sa 'yo na 'tong coffee and walnut.</font>

900
00:50:19,625 --> 00:50:23,666
<font size="20">Si Donna na lang ang ipagmaneho mo.
Maraming rum 'yan.</font>

901
00:50:23,750 --> 00:50:26,333
<font size="20">Napapalabas no'n 'yong lasa ng walnuts.</font>

902
00:50:26,958 --> 00:50:29,041
<font size="20">-Salamat.
-Masaya akong makita kayo.</font>

903
00:50:34,375 --> 00:50:35,208
<font size="20">Maud.</font>

904
00:50:35,958 --> 00:50:37,708
<font size="20">Ano'ng habol mo, Elizabeth?</font>

905
00:50:38,291 --> 00:50:41,333
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang sabihing nakikiramay ako.</font>

906
00:50:41,916 --> 00:50:43,958
<font size="20">Sobrang bait ni Tony.</font>

907
00:50:45,083 --> 00:50:47,500
<font size="20">May ideya ka ba
kung sino'ng pumatay sa kanya?</font>

908
00:50:48,416 --> 00:50:51,291
<font size="20">Marami akong ideya
tungkol sa maraming bagay.</font>

909
00:50:51,375 --> 00:50:55,291
<font size="20">Pero di ibig sabihing sasabihin ko 'yon,
lalo na't may mga parak.</font>

910
00:50:55,791 --> 00:50:58,583
<font size="20">Oo nga, napakaraming gago rito.</font>

911
00:50:58,666 --> 00:51:01,333
<font size="20">-Pero madalas gago ang mga pulis, di ba?
-Oo.</font>

912
00:51:02,791 --> 00:51:04,958
<font size="20">Ang ganda naman nitong mga bulaklak.</font>

913
00:51:06,125 --> 00:51:09,166
<font size="20">Oo, galing 'yan sa kaibigan kong
nagmamahal din kay Tony.</font>

914
00:51:09,666 --> 00:51:11,833
<font size="20">May mga tao pa ring
marunong magbigay-galang.</font>

915
00:51:17,500 --> 00:51:21,875
<font size="20">BUONG PUSONG NAKIKIRAMAY,
NAGMAMAHAL, B.T.</font>

916
00:51:24,833 --> 00:51:29,000
<font size="20">Jason, ayos ka lang ba, anak?
Uy, akala ko iinom tayo.</font>

917
00:51:29,083 --> 00:51:32,208
<font size="20">-Aalis na 'ko. May nangyari lang.
-Kararating mo lang, a.</font>

918
00:51:32,291 --> 00:51:34,791
<font size="20">-Kailangan ko nang umalis.
-Bakit? Ano'ng problema?</font>

919
00:51:34,875 --> 00:51:38,666
<font size="20">-Basta, hayaan mo na, okay?
-Bakit galit na galit ka? Ha?</font>

920
00:51:38,750 --> 00:51:42,958
<font size="20">Sige. Alam kong kinakahiya mo
'yong mga guesting ko sa TV.</font>

921
00:51:43,041 --> 00:51:45,416
<font size="20">Pero wag mo sanang masyadong ipahalata.</font>

922
00:51:45,958 --> 00:51:47,916
<font size="20">Hindi ko kinakahiya 'yon, Jason.</font>

923
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:51,791
<font size="20">Aaminin ko, mas naiintindihan ko
ang mundo ng boxing.</font>

924
00:51:51,875 --> 00:51:56,041
<font size="20">-Grabe, ang galing mong pambato.
-Di mo talaga mapigilan, 'no?</font>

925
00:51:56,125 --> 00:51:58,625
<font size="20">-Ang alin?
-Wala, kailangan ko nang umalis.</font>

926
00:51:59,125 --> 00:52:00,666
<font size="20">-Mag-ingat ka lang—
-Ngayon na.</font>

927
00:52:00,750 --> 00:52:02,375
<font size="20">Sige, ingat ka lang sa pagmomotor.</font>

928
00:52:10,458 --> 00:52:12,083
<font size="20">Nagsinungaling sa 'yo si Jason.</font>

929
00:52:12,750 --> 00:52:13,625
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

930
00:52:13,708 --> 00:52:15,833
<font size="20">Nasa file ni Tony Curran 'yon.</font>

931
00:52:15,916 --> 00:52:19,041
<font size="20">Rumaraket-raket siya kina Tony at Ian noon</font>

932
00:52:19,125 --> 00:52:21,208
<font size="20">bago 'yong mga guesting niya sa TV.</font>

933
00:52:21,291 --> 00:52:23,333
<font size="20">-At eto pa.
-Ano?</font>

934
00:52:24,375 --> 00:52:27,541
<font size="20">Si Jason 'yong pangatlong tao
sa litratong nakuha sa crime scene.</font>

935
00:52:28,083 --> 00:52:31,166
<font size="20">Braso niya 'yon. Pareho 'yong tattoo.
Nasaan 'yong phone mo?</font>

936
00:52:31,250 --> 00:52:33,000
<font size="20">Nandito.</font>

937
00:52:33,958 --> 00:52:35,500
<font size="20">Sige nga, ipakita mo.</font>

938
00:52:36,916 --> 00:52:37,750
<font size="20">Tingnan mo.</font>

939
00:52:42,958 --> 00:52:45,833
<font size="20">-Parang nagmamadali rin siyang umalis.
-Oo nga.</font>

940
00:52:46,416 --> 00:52:49,416
<font size="20">Sige. Bantayan natin sila ni Ian Ventham.</font>

941
00:52:50,250 --> 00:52:52,625
<font size="20">Ayokong matakasan tayo ng mga tao.</font>

942
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:09,250
<font size="20">Inunahan ka ng nag-aaral pa lang.</font>

943
00:53:09,333 --> 00:53:10,541
<font size="20">Diyos ko, Ibrahim,</font>

944
00:53:10,625 --> 00:53:13,375
<font size="20">inaalam natin kung gaano kabilis
nagmaneho si Ian Ventham</font>

945
00:53:13,458 --> 00:53:15,416
<font size="20">mula Coopers Chase
papunta sa bahay ni Tony.</font>

946
00:53:15,500 --> 00:53:17,375
<font size="20">Mabilis dapat.</font>

947
00:53:17,458 --> 00:53:19,416
<font size="20">Gusto n'yo ng Jelly Baby?</font>

948
00:53:19,500 --> 00:53:21,791
<font size="20">Di base sa bilis ang kalkulasyon ko.</font>

949
00:53:21,875 --> 00:53:26,791
<font size="20">Meron akong komplikadong algorithm
na tutukoy kung aabot sa oras si Ian</font>

950
00:53:26,875 --> 00:53:28,208
<font size="20">para mapatay si Tony.</font>

951
00:53:28,291 --> 00:53:30,458
<font size="20">Maghintay ka lang.</font>

952
00:53:39,833 --> 00:53:42,500
<font size="20">Sobrang busy ko ngayon, okay?</font>

953
00:53:42,583 --> 00:53:45,125
<font size="20">Dahil namatay 'yong kasosyo ko,
ang dami kong gagawin.</font>

954
00:53:45,208 --> 00:53:49,375
<font size="20">Siyempre. Pwede mo bang sabihin
kung sino 'tong kasama ni Tony?</font>

955
00:53:51,083 --> 00:53:53,791
<font size="20">-Si Bobby Tanner.
-Tama, si Bobby Tanner.</font>

956
00:53:53,875 --> 00:53:55,833
<font size="20">Ilang taon na siyang
hinahanap ng mga pulis.</font>

957
00:53:55,916 --> 00:53:57,791
<font size="20">Akusado sa napakaraming kaso.</font>

958
00:53:57,875 --> 00:54:00,416
<font size="20">Kilala raw siya sa buong lugar.</font>

959
00:54:00,500 --> 00:54:03,041
<font size="20">Akala ko patay na siya.
Saan mo nakuha 'to?</font>

960
00:54:03,125 --> 00:54:04,416
<font size="20">Sa crime scene.</font>

961
00:54:05,583 --> 00:54:06,416
<font size="20">Gano'n ba?</font>

962
00:54:07,291 --> 00:54:08,583
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

963
00:54:08,666 --> 00:54:11,750
<font size="20">Ian, bakit ka makikisosyo
kay Bobby Tanner?</font>

964
00:54:12,291 --> 00:54:14,125
<font size="20">Napakasahol ng taong 'yon.</font>

965
00:54:14,625 --> 00:54:17,208
<font size="20">Pinuputol ang daliri ng kaaway
tapos ipapadala 'yon.</font>

966
00:54:17,291 --> 00:54:19,958
<font size="20">Meron kaming freezer na puno no'n
sa Scotland Yard.</font>

967
00:54:21,291 --> 00:54:24,666
<font size="20">Sabihin mo na ngayon,
o aalamin namin sa ibang paraan.</font>

968
00:54:27,625 --> 00:54:29,375
<font size="20">Siya ang pangatlong may-ari.</font>

969
00:54:30,458 --> 00:54:31,625
<font size="20">May-ari ng ano?</font>

970
00:54:31,708 --> 00:54:34,166
<font size="20">Coopers Chase. Ang hina n'yong umintindi.</font>

971
00:54:36,375 --> 00:54:39,833
<font size="20">Kinuha siya ni Tony para sa dagdag na pera
para matapos 'yong gawa.</font>

972
00:54:40,333 --> 00:54:43,750
<font size="20">-Di ako ang nakaisip no'n.
-Alam mo ba kung nasaan siya?</font>

973
00:54:43,833 --> 00:54:45,833
<font size="20">Di ka nakikinig?
Akala ko nga patay na siya.</font>

974
00:54:45,916 --> 00:54:49,583
<font size="20">Matagal na siyang nawawala… ilang taon na.</font>

975
00:54:49,666 --> 00:54:53,291
<font size="20">Kung buhay pa siya, hanapin n'yo na siya.
Delikado siyang tao.</font>

976
00:54:53,375 --> 00:54:55,416
<font size="20">Tingin mo,
pinatay ni Bobby Tanner si Curran?</font>

977
00:54:55,500 --> 00:54:59,041
<font size="20">Malay ko. Trabaho n'yo 'yon, di ba?
May aasikasuhin pa 'ko.</font>

978
00:54:59,125 --> 00:55:02,083
<font size="20">Bakit ka nakipagtalo kay Tony Curran
bago siya namatay?</font>

979
00:55:03,333 --> 00:55:05,916
<font size="20">Tungkol sa negosyo.
Komplikadong ipaliwanag.</font>

980
00:55:06,500 --> 00:55:08,125
<font size="20">Nasa litrato rin si Jason Ritchie.</font>

981
00:55:09,333 --> 00:55:10,875
<font size="20">Kita 'yong tattoo niya.</font>

982
00:55:11,375 --> 00:55:13,833
<font size="20">Pinapatay mo ba sa kanya si Curran?</font>

983
00:55:13,916 --> 00:55:16,708
<font size="20">Ni ayokong maalalang
nag-e-exist si Jason Ritchie.</font>

984
00:55:17,541 --> 00:55:20,333
<font size="20">Pabor sa 'yo kapag namatay
'yong mga kasosyo mo, di ba?</font>

985
00:55:20,416 --> 00:55:23,708
<font size="20">Kikita ka ng mahigit £12 million
kapag nawala si Tony.</font>

986
00:55:24,208 --> 00:55:25,791
<font size="20">Paano n'yo nalaman 'yon?</font>

987
00:55:28,291 --> 00:55:31,083
<font size="20">Di ko siya pinatay,
kung 'yon ang iniisip n'yo.</font>

988
00:55:31,166 --> 00:55:33,583
<font size="20">Kasama ko buong umaga 'yong mga investor.</font>

989
00:55:33,666 --> 00:55:36,208
<font size="20">Tutukan n'yo ang paghahanap
at pag-aresto kay Tanner.</font>

990
00:55:36,291 --> 00:55:40,541
<font size="20">-Para ligtas siya at tayong lahat.
-Parang alalang-alala ka yata bigla.</font>

991
00:55:40,625 --> 00:55:42,750
<font size="20">Oo nga, pinagpapawisan ka.</font>

992
00:55:44,125 --> 00:55:47,083
<font size="20">Bahala kayo.
May urgent appointment pa ako.</font>

993
00:55:47,166 --> 00:55:49,666
<font size="20">Gawin n'yo ang trabaho n'yo.
Gagawin ko rin ang akin.</font>

994
00:55:51,500 --> 00:55:52,541
<font size="20">Aalis na 'ko.</font>

995
00:55:54,041 --> 00:55:56,250
<font size="20">-Mag-usap na lang ulit tayo.
-Sige.</font>

996
00:55:56,750 --> 00:55:58,166
<font size="20">Nasaan si Mrs. Ventham?</font>

997
00:55:59,041 --> 00:56:00,833
<font size="20">Tanungin mo sa abogado niya.</font>

998
00:56:03,750 --> 00:56:06,583
<font size="20">Ang gastos ng divorce, 'no?</font>

999
00:56:18,708 --> 00:56:21,250
<font size="20">Ayos, mukhang gumana 'yong algorithm ko.</font>

1000
00:56:21,333 --> 00:56:23,250
<font size="20">Kahit traffic at 29 kilometers—</font>

1001
00:56:23,333 --> 00:56:24,416
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

1002
00:56:24,500 --> 00:56:29,250
<font size="20">Aabot ba sa oras si Ian Ventham
para mapatay si Tony Curran, oo o hindi?</font>

1003
00:56:29,333 --> 00:56:30,250
<font size="20">Hindi.</font>

1004
00:56:30,333 --> 00:56:32,000
<font size="20">Pambihira naman.</font>

1005
00:56:32,708 --> 00:56:33,791
<font size="20">-Pambihira.
-Pambihira.</font>

1006
00:56:33,875 --> 00:56:34,708
<font size="20">Pambihira.</font>

1007
00:56:37,583 --> 00:56:38,416
<font size="20">Sir?</font>

1008
00:56:39,583 --> 00:56:41,708
<font size="20">Imposibleng mapatay ni Ian Ventham
si Curran.</font>

1009
00:56:42,791 --> 00:56:43,625
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

1010
00:56:44,708 --> 00:56:45,625
<font size="20">Bakit naman?</font>

1011
00:56:45,708 --> 00:56:47,791
<font size="20">Hindi siya aabot sa oras.</font>

1012
00:56:47,875 --> 00:56:50,708
<font size="20">Makakarating siya seven minutes pa
matapos mamatay ni Curran.</font>

1013
00:56:50,791 --> 00:56:53,750
<font size="20">-At nakuha mo 'yan sa…
-Thursday Murder Club.</font>

1014
00:56:54,875 --> 00:56:57,041
<font size="20">Ano 'ka mo?</font>

1015
00:56:57,625 --> 00:57:00,750
<font size="20">'Yon ang tawag nila sa grupo nila.</font>

1016
00:57:01,500 --> 00:57:02,916
<font size="20">Sina Elizabeth 'ka ko.</font>

1017
00:57:03,000 --> 00:57:06,083
<font size="20">Nag-drive sila kanina papunta sa bahay
ni Curran para malaman 'yon.</font>

1018
00:57:06,625 --> 00:57:10,166
<font size="20">Pinapagawa ko na 'yon kay Griffiths
ngayon mismo.</font>

1019
00:57:10,250 --> 00:57:12,458
<font size="20">Diyos ko naman.</font>

1020
00:57:12,541 --> 00:57:14,916
<font size="20">Halos 30 taon na ako sa trabahong 'to.</font>

1021
00:57:15,000 --> 00:57:17,708
<font size="20">Di ako magpapatalo sa apat na pensyonado.</font>

1022
00:57:17,791 --> 00:57:20,875
<font size="20">-Griffiths, mabuti naman. Ano'ng balita?
-Base sa nadiskubre namin…</font>

1023
00:57:20,958 --> 00:57:23,125
<font size="20">Sabihin mo na lang.</font>

1024
00:57:23,625 --> 00:57:27,875
<font size="20">Aabot ba sa oras si Ventham
para mapatay si Curran, oo o hindi?</font>

1025
00:57:28,458 --> 00:57:30,791
<font size="20">-Hindi.
-Sige, lumayas ka na, Griffiths.</font>

1026
00:57:47,208 --> 00:57:49,250
<font size="20">-Hello, Donna.
-Elizabeth, hi.</font>

1027
00:57:49,958 --> 00:57:51,750
<font size="20">-Magpapatulong sana ako.
-Saan?</font>

1028
00:57:51,833 --> 00:57:56,208
<font size="20">Sa crime scene, may nakita kaming
litrato ni Curran kasama si Bobby Tanner.</font>

1029
00:57:57,708 --> 00:57:58,708
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner?</font>

1030
00:57:59,208 --> 00:58:01,833
<font size="20">Narinig ko na siya.
Napakasahol ng taong 'yon.</font>

1031
00:58:01,916 --> 00:58:03,708
<font size="20">Sangkot sa droga at pagpatay.</font>

1032
00:58:04,375 --> 00:58:05,208
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

1033
00:58:05,875 --> 00:58:09,833
<font size="20">At kailangan namin siyang makausap,
pero ilang taon na siyang nawawala.</font>

1034
00:58:09,916 --> 00:58:11,916
<font size="20">Baka matulungan n'yo akong hanapin siya.</font>

1035
00:58:12,500 --> 00:58:13,666
<font size="20">Siyempre naman.</font>

1036
00:58:14,166 --> 00:58:17,666
<font size="20">Kapalit ng anumang
bagong impormasyong nakuha n'yo.</font>

1037
00:58:17,750 --> 00:58:18,875
<font size="20">Elizabeth naman.</font>

1038
00:58:18,958 --> 00:58:22,375
<font size="20">Sige na, Donna. Alam mo na ang kalakaran.</font>

1039
00:58:25,333 --> 00:58:29,125
<font size="20">Sa litratong nabanggit ko,
may isa pang lalaki do'n.</font>

1040
00:58:29,208 --> 00:58:30,791
<font size="20">Okay. Sino?</font>

1041
00:58:31,416 --> 00:58:32,458
<font size="20">Si Jason Ritchie.</font>

1042
00:58:34,625 --> 00:58:35,458
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

1043
00:58:36,458 --> 00:58:37,541
<font size="20">At eto pa.</font>

1044
00:58:40,708 --> 00:58:42,333
<font size="20">Tawag ka ulit maya-maya.</font>

1045
00:59:04,916 --> 00:59:06,833
<font size="20">Wag mong gisingin ang patay.</font>

1046
00:59:12,041 --> 00:59:13,250
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1047
00:59:13,333 --> 00:59:15,500
<font size="20">-Nakita mo ba 'yong mukha niya?
-Ang dilim, e.</font>

1048
00:59:16,416 --> 00:59:20,041
<font size="20">Bale, kahit hindi na si Ian Ventham
ang pangunahing suspek,</font>

1049
00:59:20,125 --> 00:59:22,916
<font size="20">di ibig sabihing
di niya pinapatay si Tony.</font>

1050
00:59:23,000 --> 00:59:25,833
<font size="20">Mismo. At ito na ang nakakaasiwa.</font>

1051
00:59:25,916 --> 00:59:29,125
<font size="20">Balak kausapin ng pulisya si Jason.</font>

1052
00:59:29,208 --> 00:59:32,416
<font size="20">May usap-usapang rumaket siya minsan noon</font>

1053
00:59:32,500 --> 00:59:36,333
<font size="20">kina Mr. Ventham at Tony Curran
no'ng kinailangan nila ng dagdag na tao.</font>

1054
00:59:36,416 --> 00:59:39,375
<font size="20">-Anong klaseng raket?
-'Yon ang inaalam pa namin.</font>

1055
00:59:39,458 --> 00:59:40,833
<font size="20">Di ko pa sinasabi kay Ron.</font>

1056
00:59:40,916 --> 00:59:44,458
<font size="20">Buti na lang, abala siya
sa pag-oorganisa no'ng protesta.</font>

1057
00:59:44,541 --> 00:59:47,708
<font size="20">At dahil do'n, kailangan ko nang umalis.</font>

1058
00:59:48,208 --> 00:59:51,791
<font size="20">Sunduin ba kita sa Lunes?
Sabay tayong pumunta sa protesta.</font>

1059
00:59:51,875 --> 00:59:53,500
<font size="20">Di ko palalampasin 'yon.</font>

1060
00:59:53,583 --> 00:59:57,583
<font size="20">Di nila pwedeng hukayin ang sementeryo
at palayasin dito si Penny.</font>

1061
00:59:57,666 --> 00:59:59,333
<font size="20">Hindi pwedeng mangyari 'yon.</font>

1062
00:59:59,416 --> 01:00:00,458
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

1063
01:00:00,541 --> 01:00:02,750
<font size="20">Pero sa Lunes, lalaban tayo.</font>

1064
01:00:05,416 --> 01:00:09,541
<font size="20">Magtipon tayong lahat dito!</font>

1065
01:00:09,625 --> 01:00:14,291
<font size="20">Bubuo tayo ng human barricade
sa harap ng sementeryo</font>

1066
01:00:14,375 --> 01:00:17,791
<font size="20">at magkakaisa tayong lahat.</font>

1067
01:00:17,875 --> 01:00:18,750
<font size="20">Tama ba?</font>

1068
01:00:19,250 --> 01:00:20,166
<font size="20">Tama!</font>

1069
01:00:20,250 --> 01:00:21,791
<font size="20">Gawin na natin 'to.</font>

1070
01:00:21,875 --> 01:00:23,000
<font size="20">Ayan.</font>

1071
01:00:23,500 --> 01:00:24,416
<font size="20">Magpakatatag kayo.</font>

1072
01:00:24,500 --> 01:00:26,250
<font size="20">ITIGIL ANG PANGANGAMKAM NG LUPA</font>

1073
01:00:26,333 --> 01:00:28,083
<font size="20">Wag tayong magpapasakop, Ron.</font>

1074
01:00:28,166 --> 01:00:30,541
<font size="20">-Tama.
-Hindi tayo susuko.</font>

1075
01:00:30,625 --> 01:00:33,791
<font size="20">-Salamat sa pagpunta n'yo, John.
-Pigilan natin siya.</font>

1076
01:00:33,875 --> 01:00:35,750
<font size="20">Tingnan mo nga naman. Magaling.</font>

1077
01:00:35,833 --> 01:00:38,541
<font size="20">Nag-recycle lang ng slogan si Bernard.
Original 'tong akin.</font>

1078
01:00:38,625 --> 01:00:41,458
<font size="20">Bawal kayong magtalo, ha?</font>

1079
01:00:41,541 --> 01:00:43,750
<font size="20">-Mangingibabaw ang pagkakaisa.
-Oo naman.</font>

1080
01:00:44,333 --> 01:00:46,250
<font size="20">Magaling, Ibsy. Magaling.</font>

1081
01:00:46,333 --> 01:00:49,000
<font size="20">Joyce, bakit may dala kang coffee machine?</font>

1082
01:00:49,083 --> 01:00:51,583
<font size="20">Di naman 'to fiesta. Seryosong bagay 'to.</font>

1083
01:00:51,666 --> 01:00:55,458
<font size="20">Oo nga, pero makakapagprotesta tayo
nang mas matagal kung may masarap na kape.</font>

1084
01:00:56,083 --> 01:00:58,333
<font size="20">Ang talino niya talaga. Seryoso.</font>

1085
01:01:02,458 --> 01:01:05,500
<font size="20">Palapit na ang kalaban!</font>

1086
01:01:06,083 --> 01:01:09,750
<font size="20">Naku naman. Ano ba!
Hindi nila pwedeng gawin 'yon!</font>

1087
01:01:11,458 --> 01:01:13,791
<font size="20">Kuha ka ng pala.
Pasok ka sa likod at maghukay na.</font>

1088
01:01:13,875 --> 01:01:16,250
<font size="20">Masyadong mabagal kung isang pala lang.</font>

1089
01:01:16,333 --> 01:01:18,583
<font size="20">Dapat magsimula na
ang trabaho ngayon, kuha mo?</font>

1090
01:01:18,666 --> 01:01:21,125
<font size="20">Kailangan mo lang makapaghukay. Labas na.</font>

1091
01:01:21,208 --> 01:01:22,666
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1092
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:31,750
<font size="20">Lumayas kayo!</font>

1093
01:01:34,000 --> 01:01:36,958
<font size="20">Doon ka. Alis na. Makikiraan.</font>

1094
01:01:37,041 --> 01:01:39,333
<font size="20">Susmaryosep, parang The Walking Dead.</font>

1095
01:01:40,291 --> 01:01:41,291
<font size="20">Deretso ka lang.</font>

1096
01:01:41,375 --> 01:01:45,541
<font size="20">Makikiraan. Walang aatras.
Tumayo lang kayo d'yan. Ayan.</font>

1097
01:01:45,625 --> 01:01:46,458
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1098
01:01:46,541 --> 01:01:49,750
<font size="20">-Ano ba'ng nangyayari dito?
-Boo!</font>

1099
01:01:49,833 --> 01:01:54,041
<font size="20">Ano 'to? Binabalikan mo ang '80s?
Inaalala mo no'ng tinitigasan ka pa?</font>

1100
01:01:54,125 --> 01:01:57,333
<font size="20">Ano sa tingin mo ang nangyayari?
Nagpoprotesta kami!</font>

1101
01:01:57,416 --> 01:02:00,958
<font size="20">May mga tao ritong nakapagpalayas na
ng mga taong mas matino pa sa 'yo.</font>

1102
01:02:01,041 --> 01:02:05,375
<font size="20">May mga guro,
sundalo, doktor, at tagabangko.</font>

1103
01:02:06,708 --> 01:02:09,125
<font size="20">-Ano ang gusto natin?
-Walang maghuhukay!</font>

1104
01:02:10,000 --> 01:02:11,500
<font size="20">Mas malaking sulat sa menu.</font>

1105
01:02:12,416 --> 01:02:15,000
<font size="20">Mga hubad na model para sa art class.</font>

1106
01:02:15,083 --> 01:02:18,791
<font size="20">Teka nga. Di natin pwedeng isigaw
kung ano lang ang gusto natin.</font>

1107
01:02:18,875 --> 01:02:20,666
<font size="20">Hindi gano'n! Magkaisa tayo!</font>

1108
01:02:20,750 --> 01:02:24,083
<font size="20">Tumabi kayong lahat.
Hayaan n'yo kaming maghukay, pwede?</font>

1109
01:02:24,166 --> 01:02:26,500
<font size="20">Di ka pwedeng pumasok sa sementeryo.</font>

1110
01:02:26,583 --> 01:02:28,041
<font size="20">Bitawan mo siya, Ventham.</font>

1111
01:02:28,125 --> 01:02:30,708
<font size="20">Lumayas ka nga, traydor ka.
Nabisto na kita.</font>

1112
01:02:30,791 --> 01:02:34,333
<font size="20">Tapos? E, dadaan ka muna sa 'kin
at sa kanilang lahat bago ka makapasok.</font>

1113
01:02:34,416 --> 01:02:35,250
<font size="20">Kaya…</font>

1114
01:02:35,791 --> 01:02:37,291
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, layas.</font>

1115
01:02:37,791 --> 01:02:41,208
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, layas!</font>

1116
01:02:41,291 --> 01:02:42,125
<font size="20">Ganyan nga!</font>

1117
01:02:43,000 --> 01:02:46,541
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, layas!</font>

1118
01:02:46,625 --> 01:02:47,791
<font size="20">Magkaisa tayo!</font>

1119
01:02:48,750 --> 01:02:52,250
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, layas!</font>

1120
01:02:52,916 --> 01:02:57,750
<font size="20">Magsama-sama tayo, mga kapatid.
Lakasan n'yo ang boses n'yo.</font>

1121
01:02:57,833 --> 01:03:00,041
<font size="20">-Ian Ventham, layas!
-Tatawag ako ng pulis.</font>

1122
01:03:00,125 --> 01:03:02,416
<font size="20">Sige. Sabihin mo, nanakit ka ng vicar.</font>

1123
01:03:03,250 --> 01:03:04,541
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, layas!</font>

1124
01:03:05,833 --> 01:03:08,250
<font size="20">Hello, um,</font>

1125
01:03:08,875 --> 01:03:10,958
<font size="20">may nakita ka bang woodpecker?</font>

1126
01:03:11,041 --> 01:03:13,625
<font size="20">Parang nakakita kasi ako ng woodpecker.</font>

1127
01:03:14,416 --> 01:03:15,416
<font size="20">Wala.</font>

1128
01:03:17,166 --> 01:03:20,375
<font size="20">Parang nakita na kitang nag-aayos dito.</font>

1129
01:03:20,458 --> 01:03:22,250
<font size="20">Ikaw si Bogdan, tama ba?</font>

1130
01:03:23,541 --> 01:03:24,375
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

1131
01:03:29,833 --> 01:03:31,000
<font size="20">Ako si Marina.</font>

1132
01:03:34,875 --> 01:03:37,583
<font size="20">-'Yan din ang pangalan ng nanay ko.
-Talaga?</font>

1133
01:03:37,666 --> 01:03:40,458
<font size="20">Seryoso? Akalain mo 'yon.</font>

1134
01:03:40,541 --> 01:03:44,000
<font size="20">Sa bagay, magandang pangalan 'yon, e.
Siyempre, pangalan ko 'yon.</font>

1135
01:03:44,958 --> 01:03:49,291
<font size="20">-Kasama mo ba siya rito?
-Hindi. Nasa Poland pa rin siya.</font>

1136
01:03:51,208 --> 01:03:54,500
<font size="20">Siguradong nami-miss mo na siya.</font>

1137
01:03:55,500 --> 01:03:57,541
<font size="20">At nami-miss ka rin niya.</font>

1138
01:03:59,791 --> 01:04:03,125
<font size="20">Nami-miss ko nga siya. Araw-araw.</font>

1139
01:04:05,291 --> 01:04:08,500
<font size="20">-Marunong kang mag-Polish?
-Oo, kaunti lang.</font>

1140
01:04:09,791 --> 01:04:11,750
<font size="20">Siya ang dahilan kaya ako nandito.</font>

1141
01:04:11,833 --> 01:04:16,125
<font size="20">Mas maganda ang mga trabaho dito,
mas malaki ang sahod.</font>

1142
01:04:16,208 --> 01:04:18,750
<font size="20">Basta makapagpadala ako ng pera do'n.</font>

1143
01:04:18,833 --> 01:04:20,625
<font size="20">Tagasaan ka sa Poland?</font>

1144
01:04:20,708 --> 01:04:21,583
<font size="20">Sa Kraków.</font>

1145
01:04:21,666 --> 01:04:25,333
<font size="20">Nakakain ako
ng sobrang sarap na sopas sa Kraków.</font>

1146
01:04:25,416 --> 01:04:26,625
<font size="20">'Yong krupnik.</font>

1147
01:04:26,708 --> 01:04:29,166
<font size="20">-A, 'yong barley soup.
-Oo.</font>

1148
01:04:29,666 --> 01:04:31,708
<font size="20">Ano'ng ginawa mo sa Poland?</font>

1149
01:04:32,375 --> 01:04:33,833
<font size="20">Traveling circus.</font>

1150
01:04:34,375 --> 01:04:36,166
<font size="20">Sobrang saya no'n.</font>

1151
01:04:36,666 --> 01:04:37,500
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1152
01:04:38,708 --> 01:04:39,916
<font size="20">Nakakatawa, 'no?</font>

1153
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:43,333
<font size="20">Huhukayin ko nang mag-isa lahat 'to,
pero responsabilidad ko na 'to.</font>

1154
01:04:43,416 --> 01:04:45,833
<font size="20">Ikaw ang pumalit kay Tony bilang boss?</font>

1155
01:04:45,916 --> 01:04:49,625
<font size="20">Oo, ako na ang pangunahing kontratista
ni Ian ngayon.</font>

1156
01:04:51,958 --> 01:04:54,916
<font size="20">Binigay ba sa 'yo ni Ian 'yang trabaho
bago namatay si Tony?</font>

1157
01:04:56,333 --> 01:05:01,416
<font size="20">Oo, Marina, trabaho ko na 'to
bago pa mamatay si Tony. Bakit?</font>

1158
01:05:01,916 --> 01:05:05,083
<font size="20">May gusto ka bang itanong sa 'kin?</font>

1159
01:05:06,541 --> 01:05:09,750
<font size="20">Alam naman nating malaki ang nakuha ni Ian
sa pagkamatay ni Tony,</font>

1160
01:05:09,833 --> 01:05:13,708
<font size="20">kaya iniisip ko kung…</font>

1161
01:05:14,208 --> 01:05:16,916
<font size="20">pinapatay ba niya si Tony?</font>

1162
01:05:19,458 --> 01:05:20,583
<font size="20">Ewan ko.</font>

1163
01:05:21,916 --> 01:05:22,833
<font size="20">Siguro.</font>

1164
01:05:25,250 --> 01:05:27,333
<font size="20">Sige, lilinawin ko.</font>

1165
01:05:28,541 --> 01:05:32,000
<font size="20">Inutusan ka ba ni Ian na patayin si Tony?</font>

1166
01:05:33,583 --> 01:05:34,416
<font size="20">Hindi.</font>

1167
01:05:35,666 --> 01:05:38,791
<font size="20">At kung inutos man niya 'yon,
tatanggi pa rin ako.</font>

1168
01:05:39,708 --> 01:05:41,625
<font size="20">Marami akong gagawin para kay Ian Ventham.</font>

1169
01:05:41,708 --> 01:05:43,708
<font size="20">Maghuhukay ako ng mga kalansay,</font>

1170
01:05:44,208 --> 01:05:46,291
<font size="20">pero di ako papatay para sa kanya.</font>

1171
01:05:51,708 --> 01:05:54,250
<font size="20">Tinataboy ka ng lahat, Ian.
Umuwi ka na kaya?</font>

1172
01:05:54,333 --> 01:05:57,541
<font size="20">Kuha mo? Basahin mo ang mga karatula
at umalis ka na.</font>

1173
01:05:59,083 --> 01:06:01,000
<font size="20">Bitawan n'yo ako. Tumigil kayo.</font>

1174
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:03,583
<font size="20">Bitaw!</font>

1175
01:06:05,625 --> 01:06:08,083
<font size="20">Bitawan n'yo ako! Tumigil kayo!</font>

1176
01:06:08,833 --> 01:06:10,291
<font size="20">Wag n'yo akong hawakan!</font>

1177
01:06:11,291 --> 01:06:13,250
<font size="20">-Hoy!
-Ayaw ng lahat sa 'yo!</font>

1178
01:06:13,333 --> 01:06:16,291
<font size="20">Bakit ayaw mo kaming pakinggan?</font>

1179
01:06:16,375 --> 01:06:17,791
<font size="20">-Hoy!
-Bakit ayaw mo?</font>

1180
01:06:19,416 --> 01:06:20,750
<font size="20">Di pwede 'to! Itong…</font>

1181
01:06:23,791 --> 01:06:24,625
<font size="20">Itong…</font>

1182
01:06:26,375 --> 01:06:28,791
<font size="20">Padaanin n'yo ako.</font>

1183
01:06:47,416 --> 01:06:48,583
<font size="20">Patay na siya.</font>

1184
01:06:54,250 --> 01:06:55,208
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1185
01:07:14,208 --> 01:07:15,041
<font size="20">Bale,</font>

1186
01:07:15,875 --> 01:07:18,416
<font size="20">saksi tayong lahat sa pagpatay.</font>

1187
01:07:20,541 --> 01:07:21,958
<font size="20">Ito ang unang tanong.</font>

1188
01:07:22,041 --> 01:07:24,666
<font size="20">Paano mo nalamang pinatay siya
at hindi inatake sa puso?</font>

1189
01:07:24,750 --> 01:07:26,250
<font size="20">-Sobrang stressed siya.
-Oo nga.</font>

1190
01:07:26,333 --> 01:07:29,166
<font size="20">Posibleng namatay siya
sa pagka-overdose sa fentanyl</font>

1191
01:07:29,250 --> 01:07:31,500
<font size="20">na ibinigay bago mismo siya mamatay.</font>

1192
01:07:31,583 --> 01:07:33,666
<font size="20">Hinihintay nila
'yong kumpletong lab results.</font>

1193
01:07:33,750 --> 01:07:37,166
<font size="20">-Saan mo nakuha 'yong impormasyon mo?
-Nag-text si Donna.</font>

1194
01:07:37,666 --> 01:07:41,250
<font size="20">-Sobrang laki ng tulong niya.
-Saan galing 'yong fentanyl?</font>

1195
01:07:41,333 --> 01:07:44,750
<font size="20">Ginagamit 'yon ng medical professionals
sa anesthesia at pain relief.</font>

1196
01:07:44,833 --> 01:07:46,916
<font size="20">Epektibo 'yon sa maraming bagay.</font>

1197
01:07:47,416 --> 01:07:51,041
<font size="20">Pero nakamamatay ang mataas na dosis no'n.</font>

1198
01:07:51,125 --> 01:07:55,625
<font size="20">Ibig sabihin, kagagawan 'yon ng taong
may mapagkukunan ng syringe at gamot?</font>

1199
01:07:55,708 --> 01:07:59,125
<font size="20">E, di halos lahat 'yon
ng taga-Coopers Chase, Ron.</font>

1200
01:07:59,208 --> 01:08:02,166
<font size="20">Inipon ko 'yong mga litratong
kuha ng lahat ng nando'n.</font>

1201
01:08:02,250 --> 01:08:04,750
<font size="20">Ang hula ko,
nangyari 'yon habang dinudumog siya.</font>

1202
01:08:04,833 --> 01:08:10,083
<font size="20">Patago siyang tinurukan ng nakamamatay
na dosis habang nagkakagulo ang lahat.</font>

1203
01:08:10,166 --> 01:08:13,083
<font size="20">-Nandito sa litrato 'yong pumatay?
-Mismo.</font>

1204
01:08:13,666 --> 01:08:15,291
<font size="20">Nandito tayong lahat.</font>

1205
01:08:15,375 --> 01:08:17,000
<font size="20">Suspek tayong lahat.</font>

1206
01:08:28,750 --> 01:08:32,208
<font size="20">Napag-uusapan na rin ang litrato,
di pa nalulutas 'yong kay Bobby Tanner.</font>

1207
01:08:32,291 --> 01:08:33,208
<font size="20">Ano 'yon?</font>

1208
01:08:33,708 --> 01:08:34,958
<font size="20">-Sino?
-Ano?</font>

1209
01:08:35,458 --> 01:08:39,625
<font size="20">-Sorry, di ko pa ba nababanggit sa inyo?
-Hindi pa.</font>

1210
01:08:39,708 --> 01:08:44,541
<font size="20">Sinabi rin ni Donna na may nakita silang
litrato ni Tony Curran sa murder scene</font>

1211
01:08:44,625 --> 01:08:48,291
<font size="20">kasama ang kilalang kriminal
na si Bobby Tanner,</font>

1212
01:08:48,375 --> 01:08:49,541
<font size="20">at si Ja—</font>

1213
01:08:52,791 --> 01:08:53,666
<font size="20">At sino?</font>

1214
01:08:54,666 --> 01:08:57,708
<font size="20">-Di na mahalaga 'yon. Hindi—
-Di pwede.</font>

1215
01:08:57,791 --> 01:09:01,625
<font size="20">Hindi ka dapat naglilihim sa 'min.
Elizabeth, team tayo.</font>

1216
01:09:01,708 --> 01:09:04,125
<font size="20">Wala naman. Ano lang…</font>

1217
01:09:04,208 --> 01:09:06,458
<font size="20">Minsan, gabing-gabi nang
nagte-text si Donna</font>

1218
01:09:06,541 --> 01:09:09,000
<font size="20">tapos tumitiyempo lang ako
para masabi sa inyo.</font>

1219
01:09:09,083 --> 01:09:13,708
<font size="20">Ngayon na ang tamang oras.
Pwede mo na bang sabihin sa 'min?</font>

1220
01:09:15,125 --> 01:09:16,208
<font size="20">Sa ngayon,</font>

1221
01:09:16,291 --> 01:09:19,541
<font size="20">si Bobby Tanner ang hinahanap
ng mga pulis, kaya siya ang tutukan natin.</font>

1222
01:09:19,625 --> 01:09:21,833
<font size="20">Si Tanner ang pangatlong may-ari
ng Coopers Chase</font>

1223
01:09:21,916 --> 01:09:24,125
<font size="20">kasama sina Ian Ventham at Tony Curran.</font>

1224
01:09:24,208 --> 01:09:27,333
<font size="20">At malinaw na sinasabi
sa will ni Ian Ventham</font>

1225
01:09:27,416 --> 01:09:31,708
<font size="20">na magpapatuloy ang pag-develop
sa Coopers Chase kahit patay na si Ian.</font>

1226
01:09:31,791 --> 01:09:33,916
<font size="20">Si Bobby Tanner lang ang makakapigil do'n.</font>

1227
01:09:34,000 --> 01:09:35,750
<font size="20">At walang makahanap sa kanya.</font>

1228
01:09:35,833 --> 01:09:38,708
<font size="20">Ibig sabihin, di pa tapos ang laban
para sa tahanan natin.</font>

1229
01:09:39,541 --> 01:09:42,916
<font size="20">Patay man o buhay,
mapapalayas pa rin tayo ni Ian Ventham.</font>

1230
01:09:43,500 --> 01:09:47,333
<font size="20">Si Bobby Tanner na lang
ang nabubuhay na may-ari ng Coopers Chase?</font>

1231
01:09:47,416 --> 01:09:49,666
<font size="20">Oo, mukhang gano'n na nga.</font>

1232
01:09:49,750 --> 01:09:51,875
<font size="20">Pero baka patay na rin siya.
Walang nakakaalam.</font>

1233
01:09:51,958 --> 01:09:54,875
<font size="20">Kung mahanap natin siya,
mapipigilan natin ang development, tama?</font>

1234
01:09:54,958 --> 01:09:57,125
<font size="20">At maliligtas ang Coopers Chase?</font>

1235
01:09:57,208 --> 01:10:01,041
<font size="20">-At di na masisira 'yong sementeryo?
-Oo. Kaya dapat simulan na natin.</font>

1236
01:10:01,125 --> 01:10:04,583
<font size="20">Oo, isang oras na lang,
intermediate knitting na dito.</font>

1237
01:10:04,666 --> 01:10:05,500
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1238
01:10:06,000 --> 01:10:07,416
<font size="20">Kailan ka nagsimulang maglaro?</font>

1239
01:10:07,500 --> 01:10:13,625
<font size="20">Tinuruan ako ng tatay ko no'ng ten ako,
tapos natalo ko lang siya no'ng 13 na ako.</font>

1240
01:10:15,375 --> 01:10:18,458
<font size="20">-Ayaw niya akong panalunin.
-Ang galing naman.</font>

1241
01:10:18,541 --> 01:10:19,958
<font size="20">-Oo.
-Checkmate.</font>

1242
01:10:20,041 --> 01:10:21,708
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1243
01:10:21,791 --> 01:10:23,416
<font size="20">Uy, Elizabeth.</font>

1244
01:10:23,500 --> 01:10:25,541
<font size="20">Hinahanap ka niya.</font>

1245
01:10:25,625 --> 01:10:27,708
<font size="20">At naglalaro din siya ng chess.</font>

1246
01:10:28,250 --> 01:10:30,208
<font size="20">Ang galing-galing niya nga rito.</font>

1247
01:10:31,125 --> 01:10:33,958
<font size="20">Inayos niya rin 'yong Wi-Fi
sa study room ko.</font>

1248
01:10:34,458 --> 01:10:37,125
<font size="20">Bogdan, napadalaw ka.</font>

1249
01:10:37,708 --> 01:10:40,583
<font size="20">Sorry sa istorbo, Elizabeth.</font>

1250
01:10:42,666 --> 01:10:44,541
<font size="20">Walang problema. Welcome.</font>

1251
01:10:46,125 --> 01:10:48,125
<font size="20">Salamat sa laro, Stephen. Mauuna na 'ko.</font>

1252
01:10:48,208 --> 01:10:50,000
<font size="20">-Nag-enjoy ako.
-Aalis na 'ko.</font>

1253
01:10:50,083 --> 01:10:51,083
<font size="20">Ihahatid ko siya.</font>

1254
01:10:51,166 --> 01:10:53,583
<font size="20">-Elizabeth.
-Ano'ng ginagawa mo rito?</font>

1255
01:10:53,666 --> 01:10:56,833
<font size="20">Kailangan nating mag-usap.
Di ko na alam kung sino'ng lalapitan ko.</font>

1256
01:10:56,916 --> 01:10:59,250
<font size="20">Tinatanong ako
kung nasaan ako no'ng namatay si Ian.</font>

1257
01:10:59,333 --> 01:11:01,166
<font size="20">Sa sementeryo 'ka ko, kasama si Marina.</font>

1258
01:11:01,250 --> 01:11:04,000
<font size="20">Pero wala silang mahanap na Marina
sa Coopers Chase.</font>

1259
01:11:04,083 --> 01:11:08,666
<font size="20">Kaya nagtanong-tanong ako kung sino
'yong makulit na babaeng maraming tanong.</font>

1260
01:11:08,750 --> 01:11:10,541
<font size="20">At alam ng lahat na ikaw 'yon.</font>

1261
01:11:10,625 --> 01:11:12,583
<font size="20">Sige. Nahuli mo na ako.</font>

1262
01:11:13,083 --> 01:11:14,833
<font size="20">Gusto kitang makausap at naisip ko,</font>

1263
01:11:14,916 --> 01:11:18,125
<font size="20">kapag 'yon ang ginamit kong pangalan,
baka makuha ko ang tiwala mo.</font>

1264
01:11:18,208 --> 01:11:19,875
<font size="20">Ang daya mo.</font>

1265
01:11:19,958 --> 01:11:22,708
<font size="20">Oo nga. Nakagawian ko lang. Pasensya na.</font>

1266
01:11:26,416 --> 01:11:27,916
<font size="20">Bakit ka talaga nandito?</font>

1267
01:11:29,125 --> 01:11:31,000
<font size="20">May ipapakita ako sa 'yo.</font>

1268
01:11:31,583 --> 01:11:33,000
<font size="20">Mamayang gabi.</font>

1269
01:11:33,083 --> 01:11:35,208
<font size="20">Pagkagat ng dilim.</font>

1270
01:11:35,291 --> 01:11:38,708
<font size="20">Magkita tayo sa sementeryo. Ikaw lang.</font>

1271
01:11:39,250 --> 01:11:40,291
<font size="20">Mag-isa ka lang.</font>

1272
01:11:40,958 --> 01:11:41,875
<font size="20">Please.</font>

1273
01:11:43,500 --> 01:11:44,958
<font size="20">Ako lang mag-isa.</font>

1274
01:11:46,416 --> 01:11:47,375
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1275
01:11:51,833 --> 01:11:55,416
<font size="20">Ingat ka. Ikot, puwesto na.
Ilabas ang dibdib.</font>

1276
01:11:55,500 --> 01:12:00,666
<font size="20">Kaliwa, kanan. Steady lang.</font>

1277
01:12:00,750 --> 01:12:05,125
<font size="20">Huling ikot. Taas, kaliwa. Magaling.</font>

1278
01:12:07,916 --> 01:12:08,916
<font size="20">Ayun siya.</font>

1279
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:11,875
<font size="20">Present.</font>

1280
01:12:11,958 --> 01:12:13,541
<font size="20">-At present.
-Perfect.</font>

1281
01:12:17,166 --> 01:12:20,208
<font size="20">Tungkol saan naman 'to?</font>

1282
01:12:20,291 --> 01:12:22,750
<font size="20">Sinabi ko na nga, wala akong alam do'n.</font>

1283
01:12:23,250 --> 01:12:26,958
<font size="20">Nasa gym ako kasama 'yong kaibigan kong
si Dan Fairhurst no'ng namatay si Tony.</font>

1284
01:12:27,041 --> 01:12:30,250
<font size="20">Kasama mo siya bago mamatay si Curran,
hindi no'ng mismong namatay.</font>

1285
01:12:30,333 --> 01:12:32,500
<font size="20">-Nakita mo 'yong pagkakaiba?
-Oo.</font>

1286
01:12:33,000 --> 01:12:35,458
<font size="20">Natagpuan siya no'ng tagalinis.
Baka siya ang gumawa.</font>

1287
01:12:36,291 --> 01:12:38,250
<font size="20">Ganito ang palagay ko.</font>

1288
01:12:38,333 --> 01:12:41,375
<font size="20">Hindi man 'yong pumatay
ang unang nakakakitang patay ang biktima,</font>

1289
01:12:41,458 --> 01:12:43,458
<font size="20">siya ang huling nakakakitang buhay pa ito.</font>

1290
01:12:43,541 --> 01:12:45,333
<font size="20">-Ayos 'yon, a.
-Galing sa Columbo 'yon.</font>

1291
01:12:46,083 --> 01:12:49,583
<font size="20">E, ano pala 'to?
Ano'ng inaakusa n'yo sa 'kin?</font>

1292
01:12:49,666 --> 01:12:52,458
<font size="20">Bakit ka tinawagan ni Ian Ventham
nang tatlong beses</font>

1293
01:12:52,541 --> 01:12:54,541
<font size="20">pagkatapos nilang mag-away ni Tony Curran?</font>

1294
01:12:54,625 --> 01:12:56,458
<font size="20">Humihingi ba siya ng pabor?</font>

1295
01:12:56,541 --> 01:12:59,750
<font size="20">Inutusan ka ba niyang patayin si Curran
kasi natatakot siya sa kanya?</font>

1296
01:12:59,833 --> 01:13:02,583
<font size="20">Hindi, may iba kaming pinag-usapan no'n.</font>

1297
01:13:02,666 --> 01:13:04,458
<font size="20">Parang hindi naman, Jason.</font>

1298
01:13:05,041 --> 01:13:06,666
<font size="20">May iba pang nangyayari.</font>

1299
01:13:07,458 --> 01:13:08,875
<font size="20">Oo, meron nga.</font>

1300
01:13:09,375 --> 01:13:11,916
<font size="20">Binayaran ni Ventham
ang mga utang mo sa sugal, di ba?</font>

1301
01:13:13,000 --> 01:13:15,458
<font size="20">At dahil binayaran ni Ventham
ang mga utang mo,</font>

1302
01:13:15,541 --> 01:13:18,083
<font size="20">ginagawa mo ang iuutos niya
paminsan-minsan.</font>

1303
01:13:18,166 --> 01:13:22,708
<font size="20">-Kahit anong iutos niya—
-Hindi. Hindi lahat ng inutos niya.</font>

1304
01:13:22,791 --> 01:13:24,875
<font size="20">E, bakit ka niya tinawagan, Jason?</font>

1305
01:13:24,958 --> 01:13:26,166
<font size="20">Kasi…</font>

1306
01:13:26,750 --> 01:13:28,750
<font size="20">Basta. Alam n'yo…</font>

1307
01:13:29,375 --> 01:13:32,875
<font size="20">-Kailangan ko nang bumalik sa rehearsal.
-Kilala mo ba si Bobby Tanner?</font>

1308
01:13:33,375 --> 01:13:35,791
<font size="20">Ano? Si Bobby Tanner?</font>

1309
01:13:35,875 --> 01:13:37,250
<font size="20">Patay na siya, di ba?</font>

1310
01:13:39,583 --> 01:13:41,375
<font size="20">Naaalala mo ba no'ng kinuhanan 'to?</font>

1311
01:13:42,791 --> 01:13:43,750
<font size="20">Hindi.</font>

1312
01:13:43,833 --> 01:13:48,000
<font size="20">Braso mo 'tong nasa salamin, di ba?</font>

1313
01:13:48,708 --> 01:13:52,458
<font size="20">Malalim ang pagkakasangkot mo
sa sindikato, tama ba, Jason?</font>

1314
01:13:53,208 --> 01:13:56,458
<font size="20">Ano ba naman ang isa pang pagpatay, di ba?</font>

1315
01:13:56,958 --> 01:13:59,541
<font size="20">Bakit ka nagmamadali no'ng isang araw?</font>

1316
01:13:59,625 --> 01:14:02,750
<font size="20">-Tumatakas ka ba?
-Wala akong oras para dito.</font>

1317
01:14:02,833 --> 01:14:06,833
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie, inaaresto kita
sa hinalang pagpatay kay Tony Curran.</font>

1318
01:14:06,916 --> 01:14:09,083
<font size="20">Ano'ng pinagsasasabi mo?
Wala kang ebidensya.</font>

1319
01:14:09,166 --> 01:14:11,416
<font size="20">Ayaw mong sagutin ang mga tanong.
Wala kang alibi.</font>

1320
01:14:11,500 --> 01:14:12,708
<font size="20">May paraan at motibo ka.</font>

1321
01:14:12,791 --> 01:14:15,625
<font size="20">Higit sa lahat, nag-aalala ako
na baka bigla kang mawala.</font>

1322
01:14:15,708 --> 01:14:19,291
<font size="20">Sa madaling salita, flight risk ka.
Kaya, oo, pwede ka naming hulihin.</font>

1323
01:14:19,375 --> 01:14:21,458
<font size="20">Bitawan mo na 'yang skates mo.</font>

1324
01:14:22,166 --> 01:14:23,833
<font size="20">Putsa naman.</font>

1325
01:14:26,125 --> 01:14:28,791
<font size="20">Ang pagpatay kina Tony Curran
at Ian Ventham.</font>

1326
01:14:28,875 --> 01:14:30,833
<font size="20">Siguradong iisa lang ang pumatay.</font>

1327
01:14:30,916 --> 01:14:35,083
<font size="20">May dalawang magkasosyo na pinatay
nang ilang araw lang ang pagitan.</font>

1328
01:14:35,166 --> 01:14:38,458
<font size="20">Ibig sabihin, kagagawan no'ng taong
gustong pigilan 'yong redevelopment.</font>

1329
01:14:38,541 --> 01:14:41,375
<font size="20">Si Bernard kaya?
Galit na galit siya no'ng protesta, e.</font>

1330
01:14:41,458 --> 01:14:43,458
<font size="20">Oo nga. Magagalitin talaga siya.</font>

1331
01:14:43,541 --> 01:14:44,583
<font size="20">Chemist din siya,</font>

1332
01:14:44,666 --> 01:14:47,458
<font size="20">kaya siya ang pinakaposibleng
makakuha ng lason.</font>

1333
01:14:47,541 --> 01:14:51,041
<font size="20">-Bibigyan ko siya ng nine.
-Wag, masyadong mataas. Six lang.</font>

1334
01:14:51,541 --> 01:14:55,375
<font size="20">-Sige. Bibigyan ko siya ng seven.
-Pwede. E, si Father Mackie?</font>

1335
01:14:55,458 --> 01:14:57,666
<font size="20">Siya 'yong pinakagalit
no'ng nagpoprotesta tayo.</font>

1336
01:14:58,166 --> 01:15:01,458
<font size="20">-Siya ang unang ten.
-Kakaiba ang kinikilos niya ngayon.</font>

1337
01:15:01,541 --> 01:15:03,166
<font size="20">Walang maghihinala sa pari.</font>

1338
01:15:03,250 --> 01:15:05,708
<font size="20">-Gusto mo pang uminom?
-Oo.</font>

1339
01:15:06,375 --> 01:15:07,791
<font size="20">Iniisip ko nga.</font>

1340
01:15:08,291 --> 01:15:10,333
<font size="20">Ngayong wala na sina Tony at Ian,</font>

1341
01:15:11,291 --> 01:15:13,041
<font size="20">mababago kaya no'n ang mga bagay?</font>

1342
01:15:13,125 --> 01:15:15,541
<font size="20">Sa tingin mo, palalayasin pa rin tayo?</font>

1343
01:15:15,625 --> 01:15:18,000
<font size="20">Depende sa mangyayari
sa Coopers Chase Investments.</font>

1344
01:15:18,083 --> 01:15:21,166
<font size="20">-Kung di nila mahanap si Bobby Tanner.
-Tama.</font>

1345
01:15:21,250 --> 01:15:24,583
<font size="20">-Wag d'yan sa libro.
-Ay, sorry.</font>

1346
01:15:25,250 --> 01:15:26,083
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1347
01:15:31,208 --> 01:15:32,916
<font size="20">Mami-miss ko rito.</font>

1348
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:33,833
<font size="20">Ako rin.</font>

1349
01:15:34,833 --> 01:15:37,708
<font size="20">Kung gusto mong mapag-isa rito,
isara mo lang ang pinto.</font>

1350
01:15:38,208 --> 01:15:40,208
<font size="20">Kung gusto mong makihalubilo, buksan mo.</font>

1351
01:15:40,291 --> 01:15:42,125
<font size="20">Ano pa ba'ng hahanapin mo?</font>

1352
01:15:42,208 --> 01:15:44,500
<font size="20">Naaalala ko no'ng nasa Oxford pa ako.</font>

1353
01:15:44,583 --> 01:15:47,291
<font size="20">Mas masarap lang ang pagkain
at bawas ang matapobre dito.</font>

1354
01:15:48,666 --> 01:15:50,833
<font size="20">Ayan na. Hello?</font>

1355
01:15:50,916 --> 01:15:53,666
<font size="20">Ay— Hello? Sorry.</font>

1356
01:15:57,375 --> 01:15:58,458
<font size="20">Hello? Oo.</font>

1357
01:16:01,125 --> 01:16:01,958
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

1358
01:16:03,416 --> 01:16:04,500
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1359
01:16:04,583 --> 01:16:07,875
<font size="20">Ganito, wag kang magsasalita, ha?
Tumahimik ka lang.</font>

1360
01:16:07,958 --> 01:16:12,000
<font size="20">Aayusin natin 'to. Tahimik lang.
Wag kang magsasalita. Sige, bye.</font>

1361
01:16:13,958 --> 01:16:15,208
<font size="20">Si Jason 'yon.</font>

1362
01:16:16,375 --> 01:16:18,666
<font size="20">Inaresto siya sa pagpatay kay Tony Curran.</font>

1363
01:16:18,750 --> 01:16:20,291
<font size="20">Naku po, Ron.</font>

1364
01:16:20,375 --> 01:16:21,625
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1365
01:16:22,833 --> 01:16:24,958
<font size="20">-Dito?
-Oo, dito.</font>

1366
01:16:25,458 --> 01:16:28,500
<font size="20">May sakit 'yong asawa mo, si Stephen, 'no?</font>

1367
01:16:28,583 --> 01:16:30,750
<font size="20">Meron nga.</font>

1368
01:16:32,375 --> 01:16:34,500
<font size="20">May nilalagay ka ba sa tsaa niya?</font>

1369
01:16:35,625 --> 01:16:36,458
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

1370
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:38,750
<font size="20">Gamot para makatulog siya.</font>

1371
01:16:39,708 --> 01:16:42,375
<font size="20">Isa lang. Baka makamatay kapag mas marami.</font>

1372
01:16:43,666 --> 01:16:46,416
<font size="20">Ang bait mo
para makipaglaro ng chess sa kanya.</font>

1373
01:16:46,500 --> 01:16:50,291
<font size="20">Ngayon na lang ulit siya
may ibang nakalaro sa chess.</font>

1374
01:16:50,375 --> 01:16:52,083
<font size="20">Ang galing niya nga.</font>

1375
01:16:52,166 --> 01:16:55,041
<font size="20">-Nahirapan ako.
-Pwede ka bang makipaglaro ulit?</font>

1376
01:16:55,125 --> 01:16:59,125
<font size="20">Oo naman, gusto ko 'yon.
Wala akong masyadong kaibigan dito, e.</font>

1377
01:16:59,208 --> 01:17:02,500
<font size="20">Pero babalaan na kita.
Minsan okay si Stephen, minsan hindi.</font>

1378
01:17:02,583 --> 01:17:05,541
<font size="20">-Natiyempuhan mong okay siya.
-Gano'n din si Mama.</font>

1379
01:17:06,041 --> 01:17:08,791
<font size="20">Hindi niya ako laging naaalala.</font>

1380
01:17:10,166 --> 01:17:11,500
<font size="20">Malala ang sakit niya.</font>

1381
01:17:12,166 --> 01:17:15,833
<font size="20">Hindi ko alam kung hanggang kailan ko…</font>

1382
01:17:16,958 --> 01:17:20,333
<font size="20">Naku, Bogdan, sorry.
Dapat dalawin mo na siya.</font>

1383
01:17:22,500 --> 01:17:26,500
<font size="20">Gusto ko siyang makita,
kahit isang beses lang, pero di pwede.</font>

1384
01:17:26,583 --> 01:17:27,833
<font size="20">Bakit hindi?</font>

1385
01:17:29,166 --> 01:17:31,500
<font size="20">Pagdating naming mga trabahador dito,</font>

1386
01:17:31,583 --> 01:17:34,958
<font size="20">kinukuha nila at tinatago
'yong passport namin.</font>

1387
01:17:35,041 --> 01:17:38,166
<font size="20">Sabi nila,
normal daw 'yon sa trabahong 'to.</font>

1388
01:17:39,208 --> 01:17:40,625
<font size="20">Sinong "sila"?</font>

1389
01:17:43,125 --> 01:17:45,708
<font size="20">Basta. Gagawan ko ng paraan 'yon.</font>

1390
01:17:47,958 --> 01:17:49,625
<font size="20">O, siya, nandito na tayo.</font>

1391
01:18:06,625 --> 01:18:09,791
<font size="20">May nakita kang labi ng tao sa puntod.</font>

1392
01:18:09,875 --> 01:18:12,166
<font size="20">Bakit naman ako magtataka ro'n?</font>

1393
01:18:12,250 --> 01:18:13,791
<font size="20">Kasi, Elizabeth,</font>

1394
01:18:15,000 --> 01:18:18,208
<font size="20">pinatong lang 'yong kalansay
sa ibabaw ng kabaong.</font>

1395
01:18:27,083 --> 01:18:30,041
<font size="20">At bakit may maghuhukay ng puntod</font>

1396
01:18:31,416 --> 01:18:34,250
<font size="20">para maglagay ng kalansay
sa ibabaw ng kalansay?</font>

1397
01:18:34,333 --> 01:18:35,916
<font size="20">Para magtago ng bangkay.</font>

1398
01:18:39,291 --> 01:18:41,916
<font size="20">Mukhang may isa pang pinatay.</font>

1399
01:18:47,208 --> 01:18:48,208
<font size="20">Buhat na.</font>

1400
01:18:56,541 --> 01:19:00,000
<font size="20">-'Yon ang sinabi sa 'yo ni Elizabeth?
-Parang gano'n.</font>

1401
01:19:02,500 --> 01:19:03,833
<font size="20">Sige, halika.</font>

1402
01:19:07,458 --> 01:19:08,458
<font size="20">Tao po.</font>

1403
01:19:09,291 --> 01:19:11,708
<font size="20">-Pwede ba kaming pumasok?
-Nasa loob na kayo, e.</font>

1404
01:19:11,791 --> 01:19:13,250
<font size="20">Gusto mo pa ng cake, Inspector?</font>

1405
01:19:13,333 --> 01:19:16,375
<font size="20">Elizabeth, wag na tayong maglokohan.
Seryoso 'to.</font>

1406
01:19:17,166 --> 01:19:20,791
<font size="20">Gusto kong malaman
kung paano mo natagpuan 'yong bangkay.</font>

1407
01:19:20,875 --> 01:19:25,291
<font size="20">-Ipinaliwanag ko na 'yon kay Donna.
-Gusto kong marinig mula sa 'yo.</font>

1408
01:19:25,375 --> 01:19:26,458
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1409
01:19:26,541 --> 01:19:30,750
<font size="20">Ganito kasi 'yon.
Naglalakad ako, naghahanap ng narcissus.</font>

1410
01:19:30,833 --> 01:19:32,083
<font size="20">Narcissus?</font>

1411
01:19:32,875 --> 01:19:36,000
<font size="20">-Bulb ng daffodil para sa window box ko.
-Window box mo?</font>

1412
01:19:36,083 --> 01:19:38,416
<font size="20">Oo, para sa spring color
sa susunod na taon.</font>

1413
01:19:38,500 --> 01:19:39,708
<font size="20">-Sige.
-Oo.</font>

1414
01:19:39,791 --> 01:19:42,875
<font size="20">-Tapos naghuhukay ako—
-Kinamay mo?</font>

1415
01:19:42,958 --> 01:19:45,583
<font size="20">Hindi ko kinamay.
Ano ka ba. May dulos ako.</font>

1416
01:19:45,666 --> 01:19:49,166
<font size="20">-Ang tanga ko naman. Dulos pala.
-Oo, dulos para sa bulb ng bulaklak.</font>

1417
01:19:49,250 --> 01:19:51,625
<font size="20">-Sige.
-Tapos doon ko nakita 'yong kalansay.</font>

1418
01:19:51,708 --> 01:19:55,625
<font size="20">Gulat na gulat ako.
Grabe talagang gano'n ang nangyari.</font>

1419
01:19:59,875 --> 01:20:04,291
<font size="20">Nauubos na ang pasensya ko sa 'yo
at sa grupo n'yong mga pensyonado.</font>

1420
01:20:04,375 --> 01:20:07,125
<font size="20">Kinulong mo nga 'yong anak ko, e.</font>

1421
01:20:07,625 --> 01:20:10,250
<font size="20">At sa ngayon,
puro circumstantial evidence ang meron ka.</font>

1422
01:20:10,333 --> 01:20:14,041
<font size="20">Sorry, ha, pero di 'yon sapat
para makasuhan siya ng pagpatay.</font>

1423
01:20:14,125 --> 01:20:18,208
<font size="20">Kaya tama na 'yang pag-aangas mo
at hanapin mo na 'yong totoong pumatay.</font>

1424
01:20:18,291 --> 01:20:20,250
<font size="20">Gusto ko ngang mahanap
ang totoong pumatay.</font>

1425
01:20:20,333 --> 01:20:22,416
<font size="20">-Mabuti.
-Gustong-gusto ko.</font>

1426
01:20:22,500 --> 01:20:27,208
<font size="20">Kaya kung pwede, tantanan n'yo nang
"Tuesday Death Society" 'tong kasong 'to</font>

1427
01:20:27,291 --> 01:20:29,208
<font size="20">para makausad kami.</font>

1428
01:20:29,291 --> 01:20:34,708
<font size="20">Kung ako sa inyo, pagtuunan n'yo na lang
ang mga rotary club dinner, paggo-golf,</font>

1429
01:20:34,791 --> 01:20:37,833
<font size="20">pagpapakain sa weird na mga llama,
at pag-inom ng statin,</font>

1430
01:20:37,916 --> 01:20:40,250
<font size="20">at ipaubaya n'yo na 'to
sa 'ming mga propesyonal.</font>

1431
01:20:40,333 --> 01:20:44,625
<font size="20">Para sa mga mahina ang pandinig,
pakilakasan ang mga hearing aid n'yo.</font>

1432
01:20:44,708 --> 01:20:49,708
<font size="20">Bawal makialam sa trabaho ng mga pulis
ang sinumang hindi pulis.</font>

1433
01:20:50,250 --> 01:20:52,875
<font size="20">-Kuha n'yo?
-Oo, malinaw.</font>

1434
01:20:52,958 --> 01:20:53,791
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1435
01:20:55,583 --> 01:20:57,000
<font size="20">Salamat sa oras n'yo.</font>

1436
01:20:57,583 --> 01:20:58,416
<font size="20">Tara na.</font>

1437
01:21:00,583 --> 01:21:02,875
<font size="20">Kung ako sa 'yo,
ipapasuri ko 'yong kalansay.</font>

1438
01:21:02,958 --> 01:21:05,083
<font size="20">-Baka may koneksyon 'yon.
-Sige.</font>

1439
01:22:01,166 --> 01:22:03,750
<font size="20">HULING BABALA NA 'TO… TUMIGIL KA NA!</font>

1440
01:22:15,875 --> 01:22:16,708
<font size="20">Uy.</font>

1441
01:22:17,916 --> 01:22:19,083
<font size="20">Uy, hello.</font>

1442
01:22:19,166 --> 01:22:22,291
<font size="20">Hindi dapat kita kinakausap, pero…</font>

1443
01:22:23,208 --> 01:22:26,916
<font size="20">Gusto kong sabihin sa 'yo
na 'yong kalansay na nakita sa sementeryo,</font>

1444
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:29,291
<font size="20">mga labi 'yon ni Peter Mercer.</font>

1445
01:22:31,208 --> 01:22:32,166
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

1446
01:22:34,166 --> 01:22:36,125
<font size="20">Diyos ko, pambihira 'yon.</font>

1447
01:22:38,666 --> 01:22:40,000
<font size="20">Constable De Freitas,</font>

1448
01:22:40,083 --> 01:22:43,333
<font size="20">siya si Detective Inspector Penny Gray,
at siya si John, asawa niya.</font>

1449
01:22:43,416 --> 01:22:45,000
<font size="20">-Nice to meet you.
-Hi.</font>

1450
01:22:45,083 --> 01:22:47,041
<font size="20">Sana nakilala mo siya
no'ng malakas pa siya.</font>

1451
01:22:47,125 --> 01:22:49,375
<font size="20">Kagila-gilalas siya.</font>

1452
01:22:49,458 --> 01:22:50,583
<font size="20">Karangalan po ito.</font>

1453
01:22:51,666 --> 01:22:55,583
<font size="20">Penny, sobrang talinong pulis
nitong si Donna.</font>

1454
01:22:57,583 --> 01:23:01,583
<font size="20">Tinulungan niya akong suriin
'yong kalansay na nahukay ni Bogdan.</font>

1455
01:23:01,666 --> 01:23:06,083
<font size="20">Kay Peter Mercer daw 'yon
na may metal plate sa tuhod,</font>

1456
01:23:06,166 --> 01:23:08,583
<font size="20">pero 50 taon na siyang nakalibing
o higit pa.</font>

1457
01:23:08,666 --> 01:23:12,750
<font size="20">Ibig sabihin, walang kinalaman 'yon
sa pagpatay kay Ventham?</font>

1458
01:23:12,833 --> 01:23:15,958
<font size="20">Wala, pero nag-interview
sina Ron at Ibrahim ng ilang residente,</font>

1459
01:23:16,041 --> 01:23:21,208
<font size="20">at naalis na nila sa listahan ng suspek
sina Bernard, Marjorie, at Father Mackie.</font>

1460
01:23:22,125 --> 01:23:23,875
<font size="20">Gano'n ba?</font>

1461
01:23:25,125 --> 01:23:29,375
<font size="20">No'ng '70s, nagsisimba kami ni Penny rito.</font>

1462
01:23:29,458 --> 01:23:30,333
<font size="20">Talaga?</font>

1463
01:23:30,416 --> 01:23:34,333
<font size="20">Iba pa si Mackie noon. Mas kalmado siya.</font>

1464
01:23:34,416 --> 01:23:35,625
<font size="20">Pero magaling, Donna.</font>

1465
01:23:36,666 --> 01:23:38,250
<font size="20">Narinig mo 'yon, Penny?</font>

1466
01:23:38,333 --> 01:23:41,541
<font size="20">Magpapatuloy ang legasiya mo
sa dalagang ito.</font>

1467
01:23:48,041 --> 01:23:52,333
<font size="20">Bale, hindi mo naaalala
no'ng kinunan 'tong litratong 'to?</font>

1468
01:23:52,416 --> 01:23:55,208
<font size="20">Kasi nga,
laging may nagpapa-picture sa 'kin.</font>

1469
01:23:55,291 --> 01:23:57,750
<font size="20">Parang ikaw. Di ko alam kung ano 'to.</font>

1470
01:23:57,833 --> 01:24:00,125
<font size="20">-Sasabihin ko sa 'yo—
-Sinubukan ko siyang pigilan.</font>

1471
01:24:00,208 --> 01:24:02,083
<font size="20">-Wag— Ron?
-Salamat.</font>

1472
01:24:02,166 --> 01:24:04,458
<font size="20">-Pa?
-Ano'ng ginagawa mo rito?</font>

1473
01:24:04,541 --> 01:24:08,291
<font size="20">At bakit ganyan ang suot mo?
Nagpakasal ka ba nang suot 'yan?</font>

1474
01:24:08,375 --> 01:24:11,416
<font size="20">Oo, pare. Dalawang beses pa.</font>

1475
01:24:11,500 --> 01:24:16,625
<font size="20">May karapatan si Jason na katawanin
ng abogado, at ako ang abogado niya.</font>

1476
01:24:16,708 --> 01:24:18,208
<font size="20">Di ka naman abogado, Ron.</font>

1477
01:24:18,291 --> 01:24:22,000
<font size="20">Hindi ako kwalipikado,
pero nakapag-training ako.</font>

1478
01:24:22,083 --> 01:24:25,166
<font size="20">Ako ang nagtanggol sa sarili ko
laban sa mga pulis no'ng araw.</font>

1479
01:24:25,250 --> 01:24:26,291
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1480
01:24:26,375 --> 01:24:28,208
<font size="20">Inosente ang dinetain n'yo,</font>

1481
01:24:28,291 --> 01:24:31,666
<font size="20">at circumstantial evidence lang
ang hawak n'yo.</font>

1482
01:24:31,750 --> 01:24:33,875
<font size="20">Wala siyang alibi, Ron.</font>

1483
01:24:33,958 --> 01:24:36,000
<font size="20">Magpapakilala ako.</font>

1484
01:24:36,083 --> 01:24:37,041
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

1485
01:24:37,125 --> 01:24:39,208
<font size="20">Hiniling ng bagong abogado ni Jason</font>

1486
01:24:39,291 --> 01:24:41,750
<font size="20">na sumama ako
sa psychiatric evaluation ng anak niya.</font>

1487
01:24:41,833 --> 01:24:42,666
<font size="20">Kita mo?</font>

1488
01:24:42,750 --> 01:24:45,250
<font size="20">-Hirap na hirap siya ngayon.
-Ha?</font>

1489
01:24:45,333 --> 01:24:46,875
<font size="20">Malinaw na may PTSD siya.</font>

1490
01:24:46,958 --> 01:24:48,916
<font size="20">Kung itutuloy n'yo 'to
nang walang gabay ko,</font>

1491
01:24:49,583 --> 01:24:51,666
<font size="20">makakasuhan kayo ng pagpapabaya.</font>

1492
01:24:51,750 --> 01:24:54,083
<font size="20">-Alam kong mahilig ka sa cake.
-Naku!</font>

1493
01:24:54,166 --> 01:24:56,000
<font size="20">Ginawan kita ng lemon drizzle.</font>

1494
01:24:56,083 --> 01:24:59,125
<font size="20">Importante ang ginagawa n'yo.
Dapat may lakas kayo.</font>

1495
01:24:59,208 --> 01:25:00,333
<font size="20">Hiwain ko na ba?</font>

1496
01:25:00,416 --> 01:25:02,833
<font size="20">Lumayas kayo,
kung hindi, ipapaaresto ko kayong lahat!</font>

1497
01:25:02,916 --> 01:25:06,291
<font size="20">Teka lang. Sa pagkakaalam ko,
nasa United Kingdom tayo.</font>

1498
01:25:06,375 --> 01:25:09,708
<font size="20">At sa United Kingdom, may karapatan
ang mga tao na katawanin ng abogado.</font>

1499
01:25:09,791 --> 01:25:12,083
<font size="20">Tatlong beses nakausap ni Ventham si Jason</font>

1500
01:25:12,166 --> 01:25:13,875
<font size="20">ilang minuto bago namatay si Curran.</font>

1501
01:25:13,958 --> 01:25:15,916
<font size="20">Bata pa siya!
Lagi silang nagse-cell phone.</font>

1502
01:25:16,000 --> 01:25:18,041
<font size="20">E, nasaan si Jason
no'ng pinatay si Curran?</font>

1503
01:25:18,125 --> 01:25:22,000
<font size="20">Ayaw niyang sabihin,
kaya para sa 'kin, guilty siya.</font>

1504
01:25:23,166 --> 01:25:24,083
<font size="20">Ano?</font>

1505
01:25:24,166 --> 01:25:25,166
<font size="20">Anong "ano"?</font>

1506
01:25:25,250 --> 01:25:27,875
<font size="20">-Nasaan ka nga no'n?
-Wala ka na do'n.</font>

1507
01:25:27,958 --> 01:25:30,541
<font size="20">-Abogado kita.
-Kinakausap kita bilang tatay mo.</font>

1508
01:25:30,625 --> 01:25:33,500
<font size="20">Kaya itigil mo na ang kalokohang 'to
at sabihin mo na,</font>

1509
01:25:33,583 --> 01:25:36,250
<font size="20">nasaan ka no'ng pinatay si Curran?</font>

1510
01:25:36,333 --> 01:25:38,791
<font size="20">Para maabutan pa natin
'yong laban ng West Ham.</font>

1511
01:25:38,875 --> 01:25:40,166
<font size="20">Sige na. Bilis.</font>

1512
01:25:43,166 --> 01:25:45,083
<font size="20">Kasama ko 'yong asawa ni Ian.</font>

1513
01:25:46,541 --> 01:25:47,958
<font size="20">Si Gemma Ventham?</font>

1514
01:25:48,958 --> 01:25:51,333
<font size="20">-Kasi…
-May relasyon kayo?</font>

1515
01:25:51,416 --> 01:25:52,916
<font size="20">Ikaw, Jason, a.</font>

1516
01:25:55,000 --> 01:25:56,208
<font size="20">Kukumpirmahin niya 'to?</font>

1517
01:25:57,416 --> 01:26:00,250
<font size="20">Oo. Sorry po, Pa.</font>

1518
01:26:00,333 --> 01:26:03,125
<font size="20">Ayos lang, anak.
Gano'n ko nakilala ang nanay mo.</font>

1519
01:26:03,208 --> 01:26:06,125
<font size="20">Ayan na, pare.
Nakuha mo na 'yong alibi niya.</font>

1520
01:26:06,833 --> 01:26:07,916
<font size="20">Mapapatunayan mo ba?</font>

1521
01:26:10,125 --> 01:26:13,291
<font size="20">Oo, mapapatunayan ko.
Pwedeng makuha 'yong phone ko?</font>

1522
01:26:23,750 --> 01:26:27,958
<font size="20">May oras at date 'yan.
Tanungin mo pa si Gemma, kung kailangan.</font>

1523
01:26:29,458 --> 01:26:31,833
<font size="20">Ayan na, DCI Hudson.</font>

1524
01:26:31,916 --> 01:26:34,208
<font size="20">Wala nang dahilan para i-detain
ang inosenteng tao.</font>

1525
01:26:34,291 --> 01:26:37,000
<font size="20">Kung ako sa 'yo,
hanapin mo na 'yong totoong pumatay.</font>

1526
01:26:39,916 --> 01:26:40,750
<font size="20">Labas.</font>

1527
01:26:41,958 --> 01:26:43,750
<font size="20">Lumabas na kayo, ngayon na.</font>

1528
01:26:43,833 --> 01:26:45,625
<font size="20">-Iiwan ko 'tong cake.
-Labas!</font>

1529
01:26:46,500 --> 01:26:49,166
<font size="20">-The best ka talaga, Pa.
-Wala 'yon. Ibsy…</font>

1530
01:26:49,250 --> 01:26:51,708
<font size="20">-Ikaw rin, De Freitas.
-Sige.</font>

1531
01:26:55,541 --> 01:26:58,208
<font size="20">GUSTO MONG BISITAHIN SI BOBBY TANNER?</font>

1532
01:27:07,083 --> 01:27:10,208
<font size="20">-May kotse ka pala?
-Regalo 'to no'ng nag-retire ako.</font>

1533
01:27:10,291 --> 01:27:13,000
<font size="20">-Ah.
-Mula sa MI6.</font>

1534
01:27:20,250 --> 01:27:22,666
<font size="20">Naniniwala kang nandito si Bobby Tanner?</font>

1535
01:27:22,750 --> 01:27:24,541
<font size="20">Ilang taon na namin siyang hinahanap.</font>

1536
01:27:24,625 --> 01:27:28,916
<font size="20">Sigurado ako. Kumikilos ako
base sa kutob ko. Handa akong sumugal.</font>

1537
01:27:29,000 --> 01:27:32,083
<font size="20">Minsan gumagana, makikita mo na lang.</font>

1538
01:27:32,166 --> 01:27:36,375
<font size="20">-Paano mo nalaman?
-Kailan lang, pinadalhan ako ng bulaklak.</font>

1539
01:27:36,458 --> 01:27:40,625
<font size="20">Lilies, hyacinths,
carnations, tulips, at ranunculus.</font>

1540
01:27:40,708 --> 01:27:42,375
<font size="20">-Ang ganda naman.
-Oo.</font>

1541
01:27:42,875 --> 01:27:46,875
<font size="20">Oo, pero may kasamang card 'yon
at nakasulat do'n, "Tumigil ka na."</font>

1542
01:27:46,958 --> 01:27:50,958
<font size="20">At sobrang nakakalason sa mga tao
'yong kombinasyon ng mga bulaklak na 'yon.</font>

1543
01:27:51,041 --> 01:27:52,750
<font size="20">Malinaw na babala 'yon.</font>

1544
01:27:53,291 --> 01:27:54,416
<font size="20">Teka.</font>

1545
01:27:54,500 --> 01:27:57,791
<font size="20">Iniisip mong may kinalaman 'to
sa investors' account ng Coopers Chase?</font>

1546
01:27:58,791 --> 01:28:00,500
<font size="20">Donna, nabasa mo ang isip ko.</font>

1547
01:28:01,708 --> 01:28:04,083
<font size="20">Sariwa pa at personal na hinatid
'yong mga bulaklak,</font>

1548
01:28:04,166 --> 01:28:06,708
<font size="20">kaya malapit sa Coopers Chase
ang pinanggalingan no'n.</font>

1549
01:28:06,791 --> 01:28:09,291
<font size="20">-Tapos naalala ko 'yong card.
-Card?</font>

1550
01:28:09,375 --> 01:28:13,708
<font size="20">'Yong card sa bulaklak ng patay
para kay Tony Curran, galing kay "B.T."</font>

1551
01:28:13,791 --> 01:28:17,583
<font size="20">Parehong-pareho 'yong disenyo
ng card na 'yon sa card ko.</font>

1552
01:28:18,958 --> 01:28:22,000
<font size="20">Unique 'yong design nito.
Hinanap ko online.</font>

1553
01:28:22,500 --> 01:28:27,125
<font size="20">Thorny Blooms sa Moreton
na pinapatakbo ni Derek Ward.</font>

1554
01:28:28,166 --> 01:28:30,208
<font size="20">Sa tingin mo, nasa loob si Bobby Tanner?</font>

1555
01:28:30,708 --> 01:28:31,541
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

1556
01:28:32,041 --> 01:28:33,375
<font size="20">E, si Derek Ward?</font>

1557
01:28:34,166 --> 01:28:39,375
<font size="20">Duda akong makikita mong magkasama
sina Bobby Tanner at Derek Ward.</font>

1558
01:28:41,375 --> 01:28:43,833
<font size="20">Namumutol daw ng daliri ng kaaway
si Bobby Tanner.</font>

1559
01:28:44,750 --> 01:28:48,583
<font size="20">Naku, iha. Marami na akong nakitang
mas malala pa ro'n.</font>

1560
01:28:53,375 --> 01:28:56,000
<font size="20">Hello, ano po'ng maitutulong ko?</font>

1561
01:28:56,083 --> 01:28:59,333
<font size="20">Hello. Tumawag ako kanina,
nag-order ako para sa kasal.</font>

1562
01:28:59,416 --> 01:29:01,291
<font size="20">Nandito ba si Derek Ward?</font>

1563
01:29:01,791 --> 01:29:02,958
<font size="20">Sa ibaba po.</font>

1564
01:29:18,625 --> 01:29:20,500
<font size="20">Bishop sa E6.</font>

1565
01:29:23,083 --> 01:29:25,166
<font size="20">Ano'ng binabalak mo, Bogdan?</font>

1566
01:29:25,666 --> 01:29:30,000
<font size="20">Isa 'to sa mga bagay na gusto mong malaman
pero kailangan mong hulaan.</font>

1567
01:29:30,083 --> 01:29:31,208
<font size="20">Tama ka.</font>

1568
01:29:32,833 --> 01:29:36,291
<font size="20">Ang totoo, may isa pa akong
gustong itanong sa 'yo.</font>

1569
01:29:36,375 --> 01:29:38,833
<font size="20">-Ayos lang ba?
-Oo naman.</font>

1570
01:29:39,416 --> 01:29:43,541
<font size="20">'Yong unang taong pinatay, 'yong builder.</font>

1571
01:29:43,625 --> 01:29:45,250
<font size="20">Si…</font>

1572
01:29:45,750 --> 01:29:47,916
<font size="20">Naku naman.</font>

1573
01:29:48,833 --> 01:29:50,458
<font size="20">Di ko maalala 'yong pangalan niya.</font>

1574
01:29:50,958 --> 01:29:53,541
<font size="20">-Tony Curran.
-Ayun, siya nga.</font>

1575
01:29:53,625 --> 01:29:56,375
<font size="20">Sa lahat ng nabalitaan ko,</font>

1576
01:29:57,250 --> 01:29:59,291
<font size="20">parang kilala ko na
'yong pumatay sa kanya.</font>

1577
01:30:13,541 --> 01:30:16,875
<font size="20">-Ano'ng maitutulong ko?
-Magpapakilala ako, Derek.</font>

1578
01:30:16,958 --> 01:30:21,458
<font size="20">Ay, sorry, pwede ba kitang tawaging Derek,
o mas gusto mong Bobby?</font>

1579
01:30:22,583 --> 01:30:26,041
<font size="20">Elizabeth Best. Hinihintay nga kita rito.</font>

1580
01:30:30,166 --> 01:30:32,625
<font size="20">Pinapatay mo ba
sina Ian Ventham at Tony Curran?</font>

1581
01:30:33,833 --> 01:30:35,458
<font size="20">Deretsahan na, a.</font>

1582
01:30:36,250 --> 01:30:37,208
<font size="20">Pinapatay mo ba?</font>

1583
01:30:37,750 --> 01:30:39,916
<font size="20">Para makuha mo ang shares nila
sa Coopers Chase?</font>

1584
01:30:41,416 --> 01:30:42,250
<font size="20">Hindi.</font>

1585
01:30:42,333 --> 01:30:45,250
<font size="20">Hindi ko sila pinapatay, kahit gusto ko.</font>

1586
01:30:45,333 --> 01:30:48,250
<font size="20">Nasaan ka no'ng pinatay si Tony Curran?</font>

1587
01:30:48,333 --> 01:30:52,958
<font size="20">Nasa Dorchester Hotel ako,
naghahanda ng mga bulaklak</font>

1588
01:30:53,041 --> 01:30:56,416
<font size="20">para sa 21st birthday party
ni Prince Khalid Al-Berro.</font>

1589
01:30:56,500 --> 01:30:59,791
<font size="20">Meron akong 200 saksi
na magpapatunay no'n.</font>

1590
01:30:59,875 --> 01:31:01,541
<font size="20">Ay, hindi pala 'to cover?</font>

1591
01:31:03,208 --> 01:31:04,541
<font size="20">Florist ka talaga?</font>

1592
01:31:05,125 --> 01:31:09,041
<font size="20">Pag-aayos at pagtatabas
ng mga sariwang bulaklak</font>

1593
01:31:09,625 --> 01:31:11,833
<font size="20">ang tunay na passion ko.</font>

1594
01:31:11,916 --> 01:31:13,958
<font size="20">Doon lang ako nagiging tapat.</font>

1595
01:31:15,208 --> 01:31:19,291
<font size="20">May impormasyon kami na ikaw na lang
ang nag-iisang may-ari ng Coopers Chase.</font>

1596
01:31:19,375 --> 01:31:21,250
<font size="20">Sa kasamaang-palad, oo.</font>

1597
01:31:21,750 --> 01:31:24,500
<font size="20">Di na ako interesadong
ipagpatuloy ang investment na 'yon.</font>

1598
01:31:25,750 --> 01:31:27,958
<font size="20">E, ano na'ng balak mong gawin do'n?</font>

1599
01:31:29,000 --> 01:31:32,833
<font size="20">Maibenta na 'yong lupa kaagad
sa pinakamalaking halaga.</font>

1600
01:31:37,041 --> 01:31:41,000
<font size="20">Alam mo, Bogdan, nakikinig ako
kapag nagsasalita si Elizabeth.</font>

1601
01:31:41,750 --> 01:31:43,500
<font size="20">At sa tingin ko…</font>

1602
01:31:44,041 --> 01:31:47,375
<font size="20">Mahirap din ang sitwasyon mo, 'no?</font>

1603
01:31:47,875 --> 01:31:48,875
<font size="20">Sa nanay mo?</font>

1604
01:31:54,083 --> 01:31:54,916
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

1605
01:31:56,875 --> 01:31:58,666
<font size="20">Knight sa E4.</font>

1606
01:32:01,125 --> 01:32:04,375
<font size="20">Ayoko sanang maging bastos, Bogdan…</font>

1607
01:32:06,250 --> 01:32:08,458
<font size="20">pero pinatay mo ba si Tony Curran?</font>

1608
01:32:11,625 --> 01:32:14,291
<font size="20">Iniisip mong pinatay ko si Tony Curran?</font>

1609
01:32:15,250 --> 01:32:16,666
<font size="20">Oo, iho.</font>

1610
01:32:17,166 --> 01:32:18,541
<font size="20">Naniniwala ako ro'n.</font>

1611
01:32:23,125 --> 01:32:25,416
<font size="20">Knight sa E2.</font>

1612
01:32:28,458 --> 01:32:31,750
<font size="20">Donna, pwede bang
maghintay ka muna sa labas?</font>

1613
01:32:32,750 --> 01:32:35,541
<font size="20">-Ano'ng binabalak mo?
-Hayaan mo, walang mangyayari sa 'kin.</font>

1614
01:32:43,083 --> 01:32:44,083
<font size="20">Sige,</font>

1615
01:32:45,166 --> 01:32:46,750
<font size="20">mahalaga sa 'yo ang privacy.</font>

1616
01:32:47,416 --> 01:32:49,958
<font size="20">Nagbabanta ka ba? Wag mo nang subukan.</font>

1617
01:32:50,041 --> 01:32:53,541
<font size="20">Kumuha pa kami kanina ng tatlong
Polish na trabahador sa Amsterdam, boss.</font>

1618
01:32:53,625 --> 01:32:54,916
<font size="20">Eto na 'yong passport nila…</font>

1619
01:33:02,125 --> 01:33:04,125
<font size="20">Kumukuha ka ng trabahador sa Amsterdam?</font>

1620
01:33:04,208 --> 01:33:06,875
<font size="20">At bakit niya binibigay sa 'yo
'yong passport nila, Bobby?</font>

1621
01:33:07,625 --> 01:33:08,625
<font size="20">Tinatago ko lang.</font>

1622
01:33:08,708 --> 01:33:11,166
<font size="20">Oo, nakakagulat.</font>

1623
01:33:11,250 --> 01:33:12,625
<font size="20">Mga negosyante kami.</font>

1624
01:33:13,500 --> 01:33:16,291
<font size="20">Alam mong bawal magpuslit ng tao
sa bansang 'to</font>

1625
01:33:16,375 --> 01:33:21,958
<font size="20">para sa ilegal na trabaho
tapos kukunin ang ID nila pagdating dito.</font>

1626
01:33:22,666 --> 01:33:27,166
<font size="20">Makukulong ka
nang hindi bababa sa 25 taon.</font>

1627
01:33:28,333 --> 01:33:30,791
<font size="20">Kung ganito kaya?</font>

1628
01:33:31,500 --> 01:33:33,916
<font size="20">Itigil mo na 'tong ginagawa mo.</font>

1629
01:33:34,500 --> 01:33:36,750
<font size="20">Sa mga trabahador at mga passport nila.</font>

1630
01:33:37,416 --> 01:33:41,208
<font size="20">Tapos ibenta mo ang Coopers Chase
sa gusto kong bidder,</font>

1631
01:33:41,291 --> 01:33:43,083
<font size="20">sa kasalukuyang halaga nito.</font>

1632
01:33:43,166 --> 01:33:47,666
<font size="20">Ang kapalit, itatago ko
ang pagkatao at kinaroroonan mo.</font>

1633
01:33:48,750 --> 01:33:51,541
<font size="20">Siguraduhin mong
walang susugod na pulis dito.</font>

1634
01:33:51,625 --> 01:33:55,416
<font size="20">Inaasahan kong didispatsahin mo
'yong kasama mong pulis.</font>

1635
01:33:55,500 --> 01:33:57,708
<font size="20">Dahil kung hindi, ako ang gagawa.</font>

1636
01:33:59,541 --> 01:34:01,625
<font size="20">Kung mapahamak ang kaibigan kong si Donna,</font>

1637
01:34:01,708 --> 01:34:04,916
<font size="20">ako mismo ang maglalagay
ng isang dosenang pulang rosas</font>

1638
01:34:05,000 --> 01:34:06,166
<font size="20">sa kabaong mo.</font>

1639
01:34:08,458 --> 01:34:11,166
<font size="20">Hindi ko alam
kung bakit mo pinatay si Tony.</font>

1640
01:34:12,291 --> 01:34:14,500
<font size="20">Siguro may malalim na dahilan ka.</font>

1641
01:34:15,083 --> 01:34:17,083
<font size="20">Pero alam kong ikaw ang gumawa.</font>

1642
01:34:19,583 --> 01:34:21,416
<font size="20">Matalino ka, Stephen.</font>

1643
01:34:22,416 --> 01:34:24,666
<font size="20">Malamang, hindi ka nag-iwan ng bakas.</font>

1644
01:34:31,083 --> 01:34:33,041
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang sabihing</font>

1645
01:34:34,000 --> 01:34:35,375
<font size="20">aksidente lang 'yon.</font>

1646
01:34:37,208 --> 01:34:39,833
<font size="20">Wala akong intensyong patayin si Tony.</font>

1647
01:34:39,916 --> 01:34:42,666
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang makuha ang passport ko.
Sana maintindihan mo.</font>

1648
01:34:44,000 --> 01:34:45,916
<font size="20">Maniwala ka sa 'kin, Stephen.</font>

1649
01:34:47,250 --> 01:34:48,166
<font size="20">Stephen.</font>

1650
01:34:54,333 --> 01:34:56,000
<font size="20">Diyos ko, sorry.</font>

1651
01:34:56,083 --> 01:34:57,625
<font size="20">Pasensya ka na, iho…</font>

1652
01:34:58,125 --> 01:34:59,208
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1653
01:34:59,833 --> 01:35:01,625
<font size="20">Ano nga ang pinag-uusapan natin?</font>

1654
01:35:05,833 --> 01:35:09,166
<font size="20">Nagkukwento ka tungkol sa kasaysayan.</font>

1655
01:35:09,958 --> 01:35:10,791
<font size="20">Oo.</font>

1656
01:35:13,000 --> 01:35:16,458
<font size="20">-Gusto mo pa ng tsaa?
-Oo. Sige, gusto ko 'yan.</font>

1657
01:35:17,208 --> 01:35:18,041
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1658
01:35:18,750 --> 01:35:20,916
<font size="20">Isang asukal lang. Ay, hindi.</font>

1659
01:35:21,000 --> 01:35:23,916
<font size="20">Wala naman si Elizabeth.
Gawin mo nang apat.</font>

1660
01:35:24,416 --> 01:35:27,333
<font size="20">Ano, nagkakasundo na ba tayo?</font>

1661
01:35:32,833 --> 01:35:33,666
<font size="20">Oo, deal.</font>

1662
01:35:40,500 --> 01:35:42,583
<font size="20">Nabanggit mo kanina, "kami"?</font>

1663
01:35:42,666 --> 01:35:44,458
<font size="20">Negosyante 'ka mo kayo? Sino kayo?</font>

1664
01:35:45,250 --> 01:35:48,166
<font size="20">'Yong kasosyo ko, si Tony.
Sumalangit nawa siya.</font>

1665
01:35:48,750 --> 01:35:52,208
<font size="20">Pati si Tony Curran,
nagtatago ng mga passport?</font>

1666
01:35:52,791 --> 01:35:54,416
<font size="20">Naghahati kami sa mga trabahador.</font>

1667
01:35:54,500 --> 01:35:57,791
<font size="20">Dito nagtatrabaho 'yong iba.
Driver ng truck, naghahatid ng bulaklak.</font>

1668
01:35:57,875 --> 01:35:59,958
<font size="20">'Yong iba,
pinasok ni Tony sa Coopers Chase.</font>

1669
01:36:00,041 --> 01:36:02,416
<font size="20">Mga tao 'tong pinag-uusapan natin, a.</font>

1670
01:36:02,500 --> 01:36:05,583
<font size="20">Binabalik ko 'yong mga passport
ng mga tauhan ko paminsan-minsan,</font>

1671
01:36:05,666 --> 01:36:07,083
<font size="20">para madalaw ang pamilya nila.</font>

1672
01:36:07,708 --> 01:36:10,458
<font size="20">Si Tony, hindi.
Napakaganid no'ng gagong 'yon.</font>

1673
01:36:10,541 --> 01:36:13,416
<font size="20">Bihirang-bihira siyang magbalik
ng passport, baka hindi pa nga.</font>

1674
01:36:16,375 --> 01:36:17,375
<font size="20">Diyos ko po.</font>

1675
01:36:35,041 --> 01:36:37,958
<font size="20">Tawagan mo silang lahat.
Sina Ron, Ibrahim, Joyce, at Hudson.</font>

1676
01:36:38,041 --> 01:36:39,958
<font size="20">-Ngayon na. Kailangan ng backup.
-Saan?</font>

1677
01:36:40,041 --> 01:36:43,208
<font size="20">Sa apartment ko sa Coopers Chase.
Seven minutes, nando'n na tayo.</font>

1678
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:47,125
<font size="20">-Inumin mo na habang mainit pa.
-Salamat.</font>

1679
01:36:47,625 --> 01:36:48,458
<font size="20">Ayos.</font>

1680
01:37:16,083 --> 01:37:18,875
<font size="20">Stephen, wag mong inumin 'yan.
Baka may lason.</font>

1681
01:37:18,958 --> 01:37:21,958
<font size="20">-Ano'ng sinasabi mo?
-Nainom mo na.</font>

1682
01:37:22,958 --> 01:37:24,833
<font size="20">Diyos ko. Diyos ko, Donna.</font>

1683
01:37:27,458 --> 01:37:29,416
<font size="20">-Saan ka pupunta?
-Hindi ka makakatakas.</font>

1684
01:37:29,500 --> 01:37:30,708
<font size="20">Mag-ingat ka, iho.</font>

1685
01:37:32,541 --> 01:37:33,708
<font size="20">Wala pa rin akong kupas.</font>

1686
01:37:36,166 --> 01:37:39,125
<font size="20">Joyce, baka nilason ni Bogdan si Stephen.</font>

1687
01:37:41,875 --> 01:37:43,208
<font size="20">Okay lang siya.</font>

1688
01:37:44,166 --> 01:37:45,875
<font size="20">Normal naman ang pulso niya.</font>

1689
01:37:45,958 --> 01:37:49,291
<font size="20">Pero kailangan siyang matingnan.
Tatawagin ko 'yong naka-duty na doktor.</font>

1690
01:37:49,375 --> 01:37:50,208
<font size="20">Sige.</font>

1691
01:37:52,500 --> 01:37:57,291
<font size="20">Bogdan Jankowski, arestado ka
sa hinalang pagpatay kay Tony Curran.</font>

1692
01:37:57,375 --> 01:37:59,916
<font size="20">Wala kang ebidensya. Wala akong sinabi.</font>

1693
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:03,416
<font size="20">Minsan, hindi alam ni Stephen
ang sinasabi niya. Hindi niya maalala.</font>

1694
01:38:03,500 --> 01:38:04,333
<font size="20">Sandali.</font>

1695
01:38:05,041 --> 01:38:08,166
<font size="20">Kung may sinabi ka kay Stephen,
hindi niya kailangang maalala 'yon.</font>

1696
01:38:08,250 --> 01:38:12,708
<font size="20">Ano ba'ng sinasabi mo?
Hayaan mo kaming tapusin 'tong laro namin.</font>

1697
01:38:13,708 --> 01:38:16,333
<font size="20">Nire-record ni Stephen
ang lahat ng laro niya sa chess.</font>

1698
01:38:17,916 --> 01:38:19,333
<font size="20">Knight sa E4.</font>

1699
01:38:19,416 --> 01:38:22,458
<font size="20">Pinapakinggan niya 'to
para malaman ang strategy mo.</font>

1700
01:38:24,291 --> 01:38:26,625
<font size="20">Wala akong intensyong patayin si Tony.</font>

1701
01:38:26,708 --> 01:38:29,708
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang makuha ang passport ko.
Sana maintindihan mo.</font>

1702
01:38:30,208 --> 01:38:31,916
<font size="20">Maniwala ka sa 'kin, Stephen.</font>

1703
01:38:34,500 --> 01:38:35,875
<font size="20">Naku, Bogdan.</font>

1704
01:38:37,541 --> 01:38:38,958
<font size="20">Bakit mo ginawa 'yon?</font>

1705
01:38:40,791 --> 01:38:42,291
<font size="20">Aksidente lang 'yon.</font>

1706
01:38:43,500 --> 01:38:45,500
<font size="20">Gusto ko lang makuha 'yong passport ko.</font>

1707
01:38:46,583 --> 01:38:48,708
<font size="20">Tinago ni Tony,
kaya pumunta ako sa bahay niya.</font>

1708
01:38:48,791 --> 01:38:50,416
<font size="20">Pero ayaw niyang ibalik.</font>

1709
01:38:51,083 --> 01:38:52,333
<font size="20">Ayaw niyang makinig.</font>

1710
01:38:52,416 --> 01:38:54,500
<font size="20">Tapos nagalit siya sa 'kin.
Inatake niya ako.</font>

1711
01:38:54,583 --> 01:38:58,583
<font size="20">Pinagtanggol ko lang ang sarili ko.
Siya o ako. Wala na akong nagawa.</font>

1712
01:38:59,791 --> 01:39:01,958
<font size="20">Kaya, oo, pinatay ko si Tony.</font>

1713
01:39:02,041 --> 01:39:07,791
<font size="20">Pero hindi ko sinadya 'yon.
Hindi ko pinlano 'yon. Sorry.</font>

1714
01:39:09,375 --> 01:39:12,458
<font size="20">At hindi mo nilason si Stephen, di ba?</font>

1715
01:39:12,541 --> 01:39:15,125
<font size="20">Siyempre hindi ko nilason si Stephen.</font>

1716
01:39:15,208 --> 01:39:17,000
<font size="20">Kaibigan ko siya.</font>

1717
01:39:18,041 --> 01:39:19,958
<font size="20">Oo, alam ko.</font>

1718
01:39:21,625 --> 01:39:23,041
<font size="20">Bitbitin mo na siya.</font>

1719
01:39:31,416 --> 01:39:35,000
<font size="20">JASON 'THE HAMMER' RITCHIE,
PINATUMBA ANG KAMPEON SA LABAN NG TAON</font>

1720
01:39:41,708 --> 01:39:43,625
<font size="20">Gaano katagal na niyang ginagawa 'yan?</font>

1721
01:39:43,708 --> 01:39:46,041
<font size="20">-Ewan ko. Anim na buwan o isang taon.
-Kalmado siya.</font>

1722
01:39:46,125 --> 01:39:48,666
<font size="20">Oo nga. Hindi siya mukhang kinakabahan.</font>

1723
01:39:49,250 --> 01:39:51,583
<font size="20">-Gusto ko 'yon.
-Ako ang kinakabahan, e.</font>

1724
01:39:52,875 --> 01:39:55,166
<font size="20">-Nakakakaba 'yon.
-Para siyang ballet dancer.</font>

1725
01:39:55,250 --> 01:39:56,250
<font size="20">Di ba?</font>

1726
01:39:57,458 --> 01:39:59,416
<font size="20">-Gusto ko 'yon.
-Ang galing, o.</font>

1727
01:39:59,500 --> 01:40:03,416
<font size="20">-Paano siya hindi natutumba?
-Tapos nakangiti lang. At kalmado.</font>

1728
01:40:05,166 --> 01:40:06,000
<font size="20">Nakakakaba.</font>

1729
01:40:09,875 --> 01:40:12,125
<font size="20">-Ang galing ng landing. Ayos!
-Anak ko 'yan!</font>

1730
01:40:12,208 --> 01:40:13,500
<font size="20">Bravo.</font>

1731
01:40:13,583 --> 01:40:16,416
<font size="20">-Ronnie, bravo.
-Salamat.</font>

1732
01:40:16,500 --> 01:40:17,916
<font size="20">Diyos ko.</font>

1733
01:40:18,500 --> 01:40:20,375
<font size="20">-Bravo.
-Salamat.</font>

1734
01:40:31,125 --> 01:40:33,583
<font size="20">Sorry sa abala, John.</font>

1735
01:40:34,458 --> 01:40:36,083
<font size="20">Nandito kayong lahat.</font>

1736
01:40:36,583 --> 01:40:38,208
<font size="20">Ano'ng meron?</font>

1737
01:40:39,375 --> 01:40:41,166
<font size="20">John, nakita ko 'tong file.</font>

1738
01:40:41,250 --> 01:40:44,041
<font size="20">Ito 'yong cold case namin ngayon,
ang babaeng nakaputi.</font>

1739
01:40:44,625 --> 01:40:46,583
<font size="20">Nakatago lang, hindi ginagalaw.</font>

1740
01:40:46,666 --> 01:40:49,666
<font size="20">At di man lang 'to
binigay sa 'min ni Penny.</font>

1741
01:40:50,166 --> 01:40:51,750
<font size="20">Bakit kaya, sa tingin mo?</font>

1742
01:40:53,750 --> 01:40:56,458
<font size="20">Naaalala mo ba
ang kaso ni Angela Hughes, Pen?</font>

1743
01:40:57,875 --> 01:41:00,125
<font size="20">Napatay siya no'ng nilooban sila.</font>

1744
01:41:00,208 --> 01:41:03,541
<font size="20">Sinaksak ng magnanakaw na nakamaskara,
tapos nahulog siya sa bintana.</font>

1745
01:41:03,625 --> 01:41:05,708
<font size="20">Pero wala talagang
magnanakaw na nakamaskara.</font>

1746
01:41:06,333 --> 01:41:09,166
<font size="20">'Yong boyfriend niyang si Peter Mercer,
ang totoong pumatay.</font>

1747
01:41:09,250 --> 01:41:12,208
<font size="20">Di kinasuhan ng pulis si Peter
dahil naniwala sila sa kwento niya.</font>

1748
01:41:12,291 --> 01:41:14,416
<font size="20">Gusto nila siya. Tropa-tropa sila.</font>

1749
01:41:15,583 --> 01:41:18,083
<font size="20">Pero alam mo 'yong totoo, 'no, Pen?</font>

1750
01:41:18,166 --> 01:41:22,708
<font size="20">Alam mong guilty siya.
Kitang-kita mo 'yon.</font>

1751
01:41:26,458 --> 01:41:28,333
<font size="20">Pinatay ni Penny si Peter Mercer,</font>

1752
01:41:29,208 --> 01:41:30,208
<font size="20">tama ba, John?</font>

1753
01:41:32,291 --> 01:41:36,750
<font size="20">Alam niyang makakalusot si Peter,
kaya hinanap at pinatay niya siya.</font>

1754
01:41:37,750 --> 01:41:40,458
<font size="20">Tapos itinago niya 'yong bangkay
sa sementeryo.</font>

1755
01:41:40,541 --> 01:41:42,125
<font size="20">Tinulungan mo siya ro'n.</font>

1756
01:41:42,208 --> 01:41:46,666
<font size="20">At 'yon ang kalansay
na nahukay ni Bogdan nang di sinasadya.</font>

1757
01:41:48,375 --> 01:41:53,416
<font size="20">Ikaw mismo ang nagsabing nagsisimba kayo
sa misa si Father Mackie no'ng '70s.</font>

1758
01:41:53,500 --> 01:41:59,041
<font size="20">Kaya may koneksyon kayo sa sementeryo
no'ng naglaho si Peter Mercer.</font>

1759
01:41:59,666 --> 01:42:00,541
<font size="20">Pero alam mo,</font>

1760
01:42:00,625 --> 01:42:05,583
<font size="20">nabisto ko kayo
dahil sa mga litrato sa crime scene.</font>

1761
01:42:05,666 --> 01:42:08,166
<font size="20">Dahil kasali si Penny sa lahat.</font>

1762
01:42:09,750 --> 01:42:13,958
<font size="20">-Ano'ng pinapatunayan no'n?
-Wala naman, officially. Pero tingnan mo.</font>

1763
01:42:14,041 --> 01:42:18,125
<font size="20">Tingnan mo kung paano niya tingnan
si Peter Mercer. 'Yong itsura niya.</font>

1764
01:42:18,708 --> 01:42:21,208
<font size="20">Alam natin pareho
na kapag ganyan ang itsura ni Penny,</font>

1765
01:42:22,291 --> 01:42:24,750
<font size="20">may gagawin siyang matindi.</font>

1766
01:42:26,208 --> 01:42:30,708
<font size="20">Hindi maatim ni Penny
na makitang makatakas 'yong bully na 'yon.</font>

1767
01:42:31,583 --> 01:42:34,041
<font size="20">Marami na siyang nakitang
mapang-abuso na nakalaya.</font>

1768
01:42:35,041 --> 01:42:37,458
<font size="20">Naiintindihan ko, John. Oo. Pero…</font>

1769
01:42:38,375 --> 01:42:39,833
<font size="20">pinatay pa rin niya.</font>

1770
01:42:40,875 --> 01:42:42,916
<font size="20">Pinatay mo si Ian Ventham, John.</font>

1771
01:42:44,208 --> 01:42:48,708
<font size="20">At alam mong kapag nahukay ni Ian
'yong bangkay, baka maungkat 'yong kaso.</font>

1772
01:42:49,208 --> 01:42:52,375
<font size="20">Kaya kinailangang mamatay ni Ventham
para maprotektahan si Penny.</font>

1773
01:42:52,458 --> 01:42:53,916
<font size="20">'Yon din ang gagawin ko.</font>

1774
01:42:57,250 --> 01:43:00,791
<font size="20">Nagtatago ka ng mga syringe sa drawer,
di ba? Nakita ko 'yon.</font>

1775
01:43:11,125 --> 01:43:15,291
<font size="20">Ano'ng laman nito, John?
Mataas na dosis ba ng fentanyl?</font>

1776
01:43:15,375 --> 01:43:20,375
<font size="20">At alam mo kung paano gamitin 'to, di ba?
Dahil noon pa man, veterinarian ka na.</font>

1777
01:43:30,666 --> 01:43:32,333
<font size="20">Mahal ko si Penny.</font>

1778
01:43:33,291 --> 01:43:34,166
<font size="20">Sobra.</font>

1779
01:43:35,583 --> 01:43:37,375
<font size="20">Pero ano'ng silbi ko sa kanya?</font>

1780
01:43:38,416 --> 01:43:41,000
<font size="20">Nakaupo lang ako rito buong araw,
araw-araw.</font>

1781
01:43:41,083 --> 01:43:43,708
<font size="20">Binabasahan siya,
hinahawakan ang kamay niya.</font>

1782
01:43:44,250 --> 01:43:45,375
<font size="20">Hinahalikan siya.</font>

1783
01:43:47,000 --> 01:43:48,416
<font size="20">Pero di ko siya mapapagaling.</font>

1784
01:43:50,708 --> 01:43:52,708
<font size="20">Hindi ko na siya maibabalik.</font>

1785
01:43:55,208 --> 01:43:57,458
<font size="20">Pero meron akong isang magagawa.</font>

1786
01:43:58,583 --> 01:44:00,208
<font size="20">Mapoprotektahan mo siya.</font>

1787
01:44:03,750 --> 01:44:06,500
<font size="20">At sa huli, ni hindi ko rin nagawa 'yon.</font>

1788
01:44:12,125 --> 01:44:14,333
<font size="20">Siyempre kailangan mong isumbong sa pulis.</font>

1789
01:44:16,166 --> 01:44:17,000
<font size="20">Pwede bang…</font>

1790
01:44:18,666 --> 01:44:22,166
<font size="20">Pwede bang bigyan mo pa ako ng oras
para makasama si Penny?</font>

1791
01:44:23,375 --> 01:44:26,333
<font size="20">Bilang kaibigan ko. Bago mo ako isumbong.</font>

1792
01:44:36,875 --> 01:44:37,791
<font size="20">Siyempre naman.</font>

1793
01:44:38,958 --> 01:44:41,666
<font size="20">Hahayaan namin kayong makapagpaalam.</font>

1794
01:44:41,750 --> 01:44:42,583
<font size="20">Sa isa't isa.</font>

1795
01:44:44,375 --> 01:44:45,208
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1796
01:44:50,875 --> 01:44:52,666
<font size="20">Naku, Pen.</font>

1797
01:44:53,541 --> 01:44:54,791
<font size="20">Mami-miss kita.</font>

1798
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:01,666
<font size="20">Magpahinga ka na, mare.</font>

1799
01:45:03,875 --> 01:45:05,291
<font size="20">Nahirapan akong hulihin ka, a.</font>

1800
01:45:20,625 --> 01:45:25,000
<font size="20">Nalutas na ng Thursday Murder Club
ang cold case ni Angela Hughes,</font>

1801
01:45:25,625 --> 01:45:27,208
<font size="20">ang babaeng nakaputi.</font>

1802
01:45:30,458 --> 01:45:33,125
<font size="20">Nakuha namin ang mga sagot
na hinahanap namin.</font>

1803
01:45:34,916 --> 01:45:36,916
<font size="20">Pero sulit ba ang kapalit?</font>

1804
01:45:38,166 --> 01:45:39,000
<font size="20">Ang kalungkutan?</font>

1805
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:42,125
<font size="20">Ang pagkawala nila?</font>

1806
01:45:48,250 --> 01:45:50,250
<font size="20">Lahat tayo, hinubog ng pagmamahal.</font>

1807
01:45:50,750 --> 01:45:51,750
<font size="20">Ikaw at ako,</font>

1808
01:45:52,250 --> 01:45:53,833
<font size="20">walang duda ro'n.</font>

1809
01:45:53,916 --> 01:45:56,000
<font size="20">Kapag tinitingnan ko kayong
mga nagtipon dito,</font>

1810
01:45:56,083 --> 01:45:57,625
<font size="20">nakikita ko ang pagmamahal</font>

1811
01:45:58,208 --> 01:45:59,916
<font size="20">ng ama sa anak niyang lalaki…</font>

1812
01:46:02,041 --> 01:46:03,875
<font size="20">ng ina sa anak niyang babae…</font>

1813
01:46:06,041 --> 01:46:09,041
<font size="20">ng misis para sa mister
na kinakapitan niya.</font>

1814
01:46:09,666 --> 01:46:13,541
<font size="20">Nakikita ko rin ang makapangyarihang
pagmamahal ng pagkakaibigan.</font>

1815
01:46:15,083 --> 01:46:16,375
<font size="20">Bagong pagkakaibigan.</font>

1816
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:18,750
<font size="20">Di-inaasahang pagkakaibigan.</font>

1817
01:46:18,833 --> 01:46:23,000
<font size="20">'Yong pagkakaibigang nagpaparamdam
sa isang tao na may kinabibilangan na siya</font>

1818
01:46:24,083 --> 01:46:26,250
<font size="20">matapos maghanap nang ilang taon.</font>

1819
01:46:26,958 --> 01:46:30,000
<font size="20">Minsan, gumagawa ng masama
ang mabubuting tao.</font>

1820
01:46:30,083 --> 01:46:32,583
<font size="20">Pero 'yong ginawa ni John,
dahil 'yon sa pagmamahal…</font>

1821
01:46:34,333 --> 01:46:35,875
<font size="20">Sa pagmamahal niya kay Penny.</font>

1822
01:46:37,041 --> 01:46:41,166
<font size="20">Mananatili ang pagmamahalan nila
sa habang panahon at saan mang dako,</font>

1823
01:46:41,958 --> 01:46:44,500
<font size="20">at magkasama na silang sasayaw sa langit.</font>

1824
01:46:45,958 --> 01:46:47,250
<font size="20">Mami-miss natin sila.</font>

1825
01:46:49,708 --> 01:46:52,166
<font size="20">At hindi sila mawawala sa alaala natin.</font>

1826
01:46:59,875 --> 01:47:00,708
<font size="20">Ibrahim,</font>

1827
01:47:01,750 --> 01:47:03,916
<font size="20">napakaganda ng eulogy mo.</font>

1828
01:47:04,000 --> 01:47:06,291
<font size="20">Salamat sa pagsalo sa 'kin.</font>

1829
01:47:06,375 --> 01:47:08,083
<font size="20">Walang anuman.</font>

1830
01:47:08,875 --> 01:47:10,916
<font size="20">Hindi ko kakayaning magsalita.</font>

1831
01:47:12,291 --> 01:47:13,166
<font size="20">Sige na.</font>

1832
01:47:14,750 --> 01:47:16,333
<font size="20">-Joyce?
-Bakit?</font>

1833
01:47:18,708 --> 01:47:20,708
<font size="20">Para sa 'yo 'to.</font>

1834
01:47:25,125 --> 01:47:26,291
<font size="20">Kay Penny 'to.</font>

1835
01:47:27,000 --> 01:47:28,916
<font size="20">Pero ibibigay na namin sa 'yo.</font>

1836
01:47:35,541 --> 01:47:37,666
<font size="20">Welcome sa Thursday Murder Club.</font>

1837
01:47:38,250 --> 01:47:39,083
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1838
01:47:39,166 --> 01:47:41,958
<font size="20">Masaya kaming opisyal na miyembro ka na.</font>

1839
01:47:42,041 --> 01:47:43,125
<font size="20">Tama.</font>

1840
01:47:43,208 --> 01:47:45,333
<font size="20">Excited na ako sa mga gagawin natin.</font>

1841
01:47:45,416 --> 01:47:47,916
<font size="20">-At wag mong kalimutan ang LMC.
-Ano 'yon?</font>

1842
01:47:48,500 --> 01:47:50,958
<font size="20">Laging magdala ng cake.</font>

1843
01:47:53,625 --> 01:47:55,166
<font size="20">Joanna, tingnan mo.</font>

1844
01:47:55,250 --> 01:47:57,291
<font size="20">Opisyal na miyembro na ako.</font>

1845
01:47:58,125 --> 01:47:59,583
<font size="20">Congratulations, Ma.</font>

1846
01:48:01,666 --> 01:48:04,833
<font size="20">Naaalala mo no'ng lumipat ka rito
tapos sinabi kong pagkakamali 'yon?</font>

1847
01:48:06,083 --> 01:48:07,291
<font size="20">Nagkamali ako.</font>

1848
01:48:07,791 --> 01:48:09,666
<font size="20">Ngayon ko lang narinig 'yan, a.</font>

1849
01:48:11,666 --> 01:48:14,125
<font size="20">Akala ko di ka na sasaya uli
mula nang mamatay si Papa.</font>

1850
01:48:14,958 --> 01:48:16,708
<font size="20">Kaya salamat kay Elizabeth,</font>

1851
01:48:17,333 --> 01:48:18,166
<font size="20">kay Ron,</font>

1852
01:48:19,000 --> 01:48:19,958
<font size="20">at kay Ibrahim.</font>

1853
01:48:20,625 --> 01:48:22,583
<font size="20">At salamat sa Coopers Chase.</font>

1854
01:48:23,500 --> 01:48:25,791
<font size="20">Bilhin mo kaya 'to?</font>

1855
01:48:25,875 --> 01:48:29,416
<font size="20">-Excuse me?
-Balita ko, binebenta 'to, e.</font>

1856
01:48:29,500 --> 01:48:31,583
<font size="20">-Saan mo nabalitaan?
-Sa florist.</font>

1857
01:48:32,333 --> 01:48:33,333
<font size="20">Ano sa tingin mo?</font>

1858
01:48:35,208 --> 01:48:36,833
<font size="20">Para di na kami palayasin.</font>

1859
01:48:39,000 --> 01:48:40,791
<font size="20">Interesado ako sa proposal mo.</font>

1860
01:48:42,416 --> 01:48:43,583
<font size="20">Pag-usapan natin.</font>

1861
01:48:44,500 --> 01:48:46,250
<font size="20">Naku, Joanna.</font>

1862
01:48:46,333 --> 01:48:47,208
<font size="20">Ma.</font>

1863
01:48:52,375 --> 01:48:53,208
<font size="20">Salamat.</font>

1864
01:49:04,458 --> 01:49:07,375
<font size="20">-Happy anniversary, mahal.
-Happy anniversary.</font>

1865
01:49:07,458 --> 01:49:08,791
<font size="20">Para sa isa pang taon.</font>

1866
01:49:15,791 --> 01:49:16,916
<font size="20">Gusto mong sumayaw?</font>

1867
01:49:17,625 --> 01:49:20,208
<font size="20">-Bakit hindi?
-Tara, sayaw tayo.</font>

1868
01:49:20,833 --> 01:49:23,083
<font size="20">Masyadong maikli ang buhay
para di sumayaw.</font>

1869
01:49:53,041 --> 01:49:56,666
<font size="20">Tingnan mo 'to.
Kailangan mong makita 'to. Kalokohan.</font>

1870
01:49:56,750 --> 01:49:58,291
<font size="20">Oo nga, wala akong masabi.</font>

1871
01:49:59,416 --> 01:50:01,416
<font size="20">-Eto na.
-Sige. Good luck.</font>

1872
01:50:02,250 --> 01:50:04,833
<font size="20">-Kita mo 'yon?
-Pangalawa na 'yon.</font>

1873
01:50:05,500 --> 01:50:06,458
<font size="20">-Gano'n talaga.
-Naku.</font>

1874
01:50:06,541 --> 01:50:09,833
<font size="20">-Wala siyang binatbat. Cheers, Pa.
-Cheers. Good luck.</font>

1875
01:50:10,833 --> 01:50:14,375
<font size="20">Luma na 'yong frame.
Napakabata ko pa no'ng ikinasal ako.</font>

1876
01:50:14,458 --> 01:50:16,541
<font size="20">Hindi na yata ikakasal si Joanna.</font>

1877
01:50:17,125 --> 01:50:20,666
<font size="20">Kabadong-kabado si Gerry no'n,
pero sobrang bait niya.</font>

1878
01:50:28,166 --> 01:50:31,333
<font size="20">Wow, Ibrahim, ang guwapo mo naman.</font>

1879
01:50:32,708 --> 01:50:36,041
<font size="20">-Ilang taon ka nito?
-Twenty-two at may buhok pa ako.</font>

1880
01:50:37,166 --> 01:50:38,583
<font size="20">Guwapo ka pa rin naman.</font>

1881
01:57:45,541 --> 01:57:50,000
<font size="20">Nagsalin ng Subtitle: Nadine Aguazon</font>

